   </languages>
    <keywords></keywords><author activity="Writer"><first-name>Chad</first-name><last-name>Allen</last-name></author><author activity="Artist"><first-name>Paco</first-name><last-name>Allen</last-name></author><author activity="Translator" lang="sk"><first-name>Róbert</first-name><last-name>Kubík</last-name></author><book-title lang="sk">NYC2123 Koniec Dní</book-title><book-title lang="en">NYC2123 Dayender</book-title><annotation lang="sk"><p>Príbeh sa odohráva v roku 2123 v Manhattane v New Yorku, ktorý bol zdevastovaný tsunami pred 70 rokmi. Tí, čo prežili apokalipsu tu bojujú o prežitie.</p><p>Tento komiks bol pôvodne vytvorený pre Sony PlayStation Portable a distribuovaný pod licenciou Creative Commons.</p></annotation><annotation lang="en"><p>Set in 2123 in a Manhattan that was devastated by a tsunami 70 years ago, the post-apocalyptic survivors struggle to continue living.</p><p>This comic was originally conceived for Sony's PlayStation Portable and distributed under a Creative Commons license, although you can now read it online at http://www.nyc2123.com.</p></annotation></book-info>
