  <body>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 1</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 1</title>
      <image href="Issue 1/01.jpg"/>
	<text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#030303" points="421,377 579,377 579,406 419,406" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>ISSUE 1</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#030303" points="421,377 579,377 579,406 419,406" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>KAPITOLA 1</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/02.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="163,73 927,75 933,517 79,521 81,185 163,183" bgcolor="#000000" type="formal" inverted="True">
       <p>n 2054 a massive tsunami devastates Manhattan. The island's bridges and tunnels are destroyed. Two years of riots follow. Outlaw barge cities form in the waters around Manhattan, trafficking in illegal cybernetic body modifications and open source drugs. In 2065 the construction of a 20-meter-high barrier encircling what is left of Manhattan is completed and martial law is declared. This barrier is known simply as 'The Wall.' A sense of normalcy returns to parts of Manhattan, but the barge cities continue to thrive and the neighborhoods above 59th street remain lawless and squalid. Small bands of mercenary hackers and cyborg street-fighters -- 'nano-mobs' -- arise out of this chaos. They operate outside the law and without protection from the city's crime bosses.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="163,73 927,75 933,517 79,521 81,185 163,183" bgcolor="#000000" type="formal" inverted="True">
       <p>V roku 2054 masívna vlna tsunami zdevastovala Manhattan. Mosty a tunely na ostrove zostali zničené. Nasledovali dva roky nepokojov. Za účelom pašovania ilegálnych kybernetických telových modifikácií sa v okolí Manhattanu sformovali zločinecké vodné mestá. V roku 2065 je dokončená konštrukcia 20-metrov vysokej bariéry, ktorá obklopuje to, čo ešte zostalo z Manhattanu; je vyhlásený zákaz vychádzania. Táto bariéra je známa ako jednoducho 'Stena'. Bežný život sa vracia do niektorých častí Manhattanu, no vodným mestám na okolí sa naďalej darí a susedstvá nad 59-tou ulicou zostali plné zločinu a špiny. Malé skupiny najatých hackerov a kybernetických pouličných bitkárov -- 'nano-mobs' -- vznikajú v tomto chaose. Operujú mimo hraníc zákona a bez ochrany mestských mafiánskych bossov.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/03.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="107,163 323,163 323,221 106,221" type="commentary"><p>NEW YORK CITY</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="107,163 323,163 323,221 106,221" type="commentary"><p>MESTO NEW YORK</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/04.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="85,103 275,103 275,159 84,159" type="commentary"><p>2123 A.D.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="85,103 275,103 275,159 84,159" type="commentary"><p>ROK 2123</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/05.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="62,67 524,67 524,179 61,179" type="commentary"><p>TWO FIGURES MOVE SLOWLY AND UNSEEN ALONG THE OUTSIDE OF THE WALL THAT SHELTERS WHAT IS LEFT OF MANHATTAN.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="62,67 524,67 524,179 61,179" type="commentary"><p>DVE POSTAVY KRÁČAJÚ POMALY A NEBADANE POZDĹŽ STENY, KTORÁ OBKLOPUJE TO, ČO ZOSTALO Z MANHATTANU.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/06.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="740,288 758,269 765,246 833,244 904,244 940,263 946,288 940,315 921,323 829,323 819,331 771,333 763,317 740,308">
       <p>AT NIGHT, ALL CATS ARE GRAY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="660,425 675,404 729,388 840,388 879,396 906,413 915,433 906,458 877,475 831,485 742,483 690,475 667,458 656,440">
       <p>BUT NOT ALL TAILS ARE BUSHY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="740,288 758,269 765,246 833,244 904,244 940,263 946,288 940,315 921,323 829,323 819,331 771,333 763,317 740,308">
       <p>V NOCI SÚ VŠETKY MAČKY ŠEDÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="660,425 675,404 729,388 840,388 879,396 906,413 915,433 906,458 877,475 831,485 742,483 690,475 667,458 656,440">
       <p>ALE NIE VŠETKY CHVOSTY SÚ CHLPATÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/07.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="297,239 316,225 433,225 505,225 513,253 501,268 502,289 467,293 365,293 323,287 308,269"><p>WHAT'S THAT GOT TO DO WITH IT?</p></text-area><text-area points="542,263 563,233 625,213 740,210 840,223 879,254 879,292 844,325 760,342 665,340 585,327 546,296">
       <p>IT HAD A BUSHY TAIL. IT WAS A SQUIRREL. WHAT'S A CAT GOT TO DO WITH IT?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="297,239 316,225 433,225 505,225 513,253 501,268 502,289 467,293 365,293 323,287 308,269"><p>ČO TO MÁ S TÝM SPOLOČNÉ?</p></text-area><text-area points="542,263 563,233 625,213 740,210 840,223 879,254 879,292 844,325 760,342 665,340 585,327 546,296">
       <p>MALO TO CHLPATÝ CHVOST. BOLA TO VEVERIČKA. ČO S TÝM MÁ SPOLOČNÉ MAČKA?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/08.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="690,467 700,419 727,406 781,408 881,413 923,417 933,435 938,458 938,483 927,483 910,500 875,506 821,506 779,513 727,508 706,496 704,479">
       <p>I'M JUST SAYING EVERYTHING LOOKS GRAY AT NIGHT.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="690,467 700,419 727,406 781,408 881,413 923,417 933,435 938,458 938,483 927,483 910,500 875,506 821,506 779,513 727,508 706,496 704,479">
       <p>LEN VRAVÍM, ŽE V NOCI VŠETKO VYZERÁ ŠEDÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/09.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="13,29 33,15 65,17 90,10 194,10 210,31 208,54 185,75 140,77 96,85 58,77 38,83 29,63">
       <p>WHERE'D YOU SEE IT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="54,148 58,123 85,102 144,85 246,83 308,98 342,119 348,142 342,171 310,194 260,204 177,206 117,200 79,188 58,165">
       <p>ON THE BROOKLYN RIVIERA. IN A PARK. WHEN I WAS A KID.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="13,271 21,229 40,202 115,210 173,217 183,235 188,265 185,283 150,283 138,294 71,298 33,288">
       <p>WHATEVER. IT WAS A RAT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="2,381 21,344 54,315 121,302 188,310 233,348 250,392 256,431 252,475 240,510 200,552 163,563 83,563 35,542 8,502 2,479">
       <p>FUCK YOU, JAKE. IT WAS A SQUIRREL. RATS DON'T HAVE BUSHY TAILS. AND I DON'T KNOW ANYBODY WHO'S EVER SEEN A RAT.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="13,29 33,15 65,17 90,10 194,10 210,31 208,54 185,75 140,77 96,85 58,77 38,83 29,63">
       <p>KDE SI JU VIDELA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="54,148 58,123 85,102 144,85 246,83 308,98 342,119 348,142 342,171 310,194 260,204 177,206 117,200 79,188 58,165">
       <p>NA BROOKLYNSKEJ RIVIÉRE. V PARKU. KEĎ SOM BOLA DECKO.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="13,271 21,229 40,202 115,210 173,217 183,235 188,265 185,283 150,283 138,294 71,298 33,288">
       <p>BUDIŽ. ALE BOL TO POTKAN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="2,381 21,344 54,315 121,302 188,310 233,348 250,392 256,431 252,475 240,510 200,552 163,563 83,563 35,542 8,502 2,479">
       <p>CHOĎ DO PEKLA, JAKE. BOLA TO VEVERIČKA. POTKANY NEMAJÚ CHLPATÉ CHVOSTY. A NEPOZNÁM NIKOHO, KTO BY NIEKEDY VIDEL POTKANA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/10.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="277,38 296,19 417,19 494,8 660,19 667,42 675,75 635,104 625,113 535,110 340,121 288,110 271,58">
       <p>WELL IF THERE'S PARKS FULL OF 'EM IN BROOKLYN, THEN WHAT'S THIS JOB ABOUT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="435,185 448,154 477,131 531,121 610,121 656,133 685,152 696,183 683,223 654,240 606,252 523,250 469,240 444,213">
       <p>I DON'T KNOW. YOU CAN ASK WAGNER TOMORROW.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="463,483 467,452 494,423 544,410 613,410 656,425 681,450 690,483 683,513 660,542 610,556 540,556 490,540 467,513">
       <p>YOU LOOK LIKE SHIT, JAKE. ARE YOU GONNA MAKE IT?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="277,38 296,19 417,19 494,8 660,19 667,42 675,75 635,104 625,113 535,110 340,121 288,110 271,58">
       <p>HMM, KEĎ SÚ ICH PLNÉ PARKY V BROOKLYNE O ČOM JE POTOM TENTO NÁŠ JOB?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="435,185 448,154 477,131 531,121 610,121 656,133 685,152 696,183 683,223 654,240 606,252 523,250 469,240 444,213">
       <p>NEVIEM. MÔŽEŠ SA ZAJTRA SPÝTAŤ WAGNERA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="463,483 467,452 494,423 544,410 613,410 656,425 681,450 690,483 683,513 660,542 610,556 540,556 490,540 467,513">
       <p>VYZERÁŠ HROZNE JAKE. ZVLÁDNEŠ TO?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/11.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="506,32 974,32 974,174 507,174" type="commentary"><p>THE METHOXYHENETHYLAMINE-6 WAS PEAKING. JAKE TRIED TO PICTURE A SQUIRREL. DURING THE DAY AT FIRST, BUT EVERYTHING SEEMED TOO BRIGHT.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="476,246 805,246 805,357 477,357" type="commentary"><p>THERE WAS A SEARING PAIN BEHIND HIS EYES AND FOR A MOMENT HE WAS BLIND.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="506,32 974,32 974,174 507,174" type="commentary"><p>HLADINA METHOXYHENETHYLAMINE-6 BOLA NA MAXIME. JAKE SA SNAŽIL PREDSTAVIŤ SI VEVERIČKU ... CEZ DEŇ ... ALE VŠETKO VYZERALO PRÍLIŠ SVETLÉ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="476,246 805,246 805,357 477,357" type="commentary"><p>NÁHLE ZACÍTIL PÁLIVÚ BOLESŤ ZA OČAMI A NA CHVÍĽU OSLEPOL.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/12.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="25,31 298,33 296,279 25,281" type="commentary">
       <p>HIS VISION RETURNED, BUT HE WAS SOMEWHERE ELSE. THERE WAS A GRAY SQUIRREL, SURROUNDED BY CONCRETE AND TWISTED GRAY METAL.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="573,408 921,410 921,542 577,544" type="commentary">
       <p>THE PAIN AND BLINDNESS CAME AGAIN, AND THE SQUIRREL WAS RUNNING THROUGH A MEADOW OF MONOCHROME GRASS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="25,31 298,33 296,279 25,281" type="commentary">
       <p>ZRAK SA MU VRÁTIL, ALE OCITOL SA NIEKDE INDE. BOLA TAM ŠEDÁ VEVERIČKA OBKLOPENÁ BETÓNOM A SKRÚTENÝM KOVOM.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="573,408 921,410 921,542 577,544" type="commentary">
       <p>BOLESŤ A SLEPOTA PRIŠLA OPÄŤ, KEĎ VEVERIČKA BEŽALA KRÍŽOM CEZ LÚKU Z MONOCHROMATICKEJ TRÁVY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/13.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="354,23 963,23 952,202 352,200" type="commentary">
       <p>THE CONCRETE OF THE WALL MELTED AND OPENED UP LIKE A WINDOW ON TO THE MONOCHROME MEADOW, WHERE THE SQUIRREL HAD MULTIPLIED INTO A THOUSAND SQUIRRELS, SPILLING OVER THE ROLLING HILLS OF GRAY GRASS LIKE MERCURY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="398,229 735,229 735,367 646,423 402,417" type="commentary">
       <p>HE REACHED INTO THE WINDOW AND IT PULLED HIM DOWN. SOMEWHERE IN THE DISTANCE THERE WAS AN URGE TO THROW OUT HIS ARMS AND BREAK THE FALL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="354,23 963,23 952,202 352,200" type="commentary">
       <p>BETÓNOVÁ STENA SA ROZPUSTILA A OTVORILA AKO OKNO DO MONOCHROMATICKEJ LÚKY, KDE SA VEVERIČKA ROZMNOŽILA DO TISíCKY ĎALŠÍCH, KTORÉ SA ROZLIALI PO KOPCOCH ŠEDEJ TRÁVY AKO ORTUŤ.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="398,229 735,229 735,367 646,423 402,417" type="commentary">
       <p>NAČIAHOL SA K OKNU A TO HO STIAHLO NADOL. NIEKDE ĎALEKO POCÍTIL NUTKANIE ROZPRIAHNUŤ RUKY A ZABRÁNIŤ TAK PÁDU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/14.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,40 365,40 365,277 35,288" type="commentary">
       <p>AS THE HIGH BURNED OUT AND HIS SYNAPSYS TRIED TO RECONNECT, HE COULD FEEL THE ROUGH FUR OF THE SQUIRRELS WASH OVER HIM LIKE HE WAS FALLING THROUGH PINE TREES.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="777,83 796,42 858,33 938,33 958,50 985,85 977,104 921,106 873,102 863,121 813,123 792,115">
       <p>GIVE ME A PATCH, LANEY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,40 365,40 365,277 35,288" type="commentary">
       <p>KEĎ BOLESŤ OPADLA A JEHO NERVOVÉ ZAKONČENIA SA SNAŽILI ZNOVU SPOJIŤ, POCÍTIL AKO HO ŠVÁCA TVRDÁ KOŽUŠINA VEVERIČIEK AKOBY PADAL CEZ VETVY BOROVICE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="777,83 796,42 858,33 938,33 958,50 985,85 977,104 921,106 873,102 863,121 813,123 792,115">
       <p>PODAJ MI NÁPLASŤ, LANEY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/15.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="396,79 427,35 485,13 563,6 644,13 706,40 735,88 735,150 706,188 656,210 581,221 485,215 423,185 394,142 390,113">
       <p>ARE YOU KIDDING, ASSHOLE? I NEED TO BE IN A WI-FI ZONE BY 19:30. THAT'S TWENTY MINUTES FROM NOW. SO FUCKING GET UP AND WALK.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="763,204 767,115 777,69 838,67 946,71 981,73 979,131 983,171 946,202 938,215 879,225 794,217">
       <p>I DON'T WANT TO. I THINK I BROKE MY NOSE. GIVE ME A PATCH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="673,408 681,350 721,294 792,269 869,265 927,277 969,306 996,356 998,463 973,510 925,546 838,556 752,546 700,508 677,456">
       <p>HIGH TIDE'S IN FOUR HOURS. IF I GIVE YOU ANOTHER PATCH YOU'LL LIE HERE UNTIL THE WATER COMES UP AND WASHES YOU OUT TO SEA WITH THE SEWAGE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="396,79 427,35 485,13 563,6 644,13 706,40 735,88 735,150 706,188 656,210 581,221 485,215 423,185 394,142 390,113">
       <p>ŽARTUJEŠ, KRETÉN? POTREBUJEM BYŤ VO WI-FI ZÓNE O 19:30. TO JE ZA DVADSAŤ MINÚT. TAK KURVA VSTAŇ A IDEME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="763,204 767,115 777,69 838,67 946,71 981,73 979,131 983,171 946,202 938,215 879,225 794,217">
       <p>NECHCE SA MI. MYSLÍM, ŽE MÁM ZLOMENÝ NOS. PODAJ MI NÁPLASŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="673,408 681,350 721,294 792,269 869,265 927,277 969,306 996,356 998,463 973,510 925,546 838,556 752,546 700,508 677,456">
       <p>PRÍLIV JE ZA ŠTYRI HODINY. AK TI DÁM ĎALŠIU NÁPLASŤ, BUDEŠ TU LEŽAŤ, KÝM NEPRÍDE VODA A NESPLÁCHNE ŤA DO MORA AJ SO SPLAŠKAMI.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/16.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="65,117 54,98 60,46 106,40 188,38 194,60 206,98 183,106 152,115 98,113">
       <p>GIVE ME A PATCH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,238 81,202 94,173 117,158 154,156 179,175 194,219 194,263 181,298 154,319 119,319 94,304 83,275">
       <p>FOR FUCK'S SAKE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="565,431 571,390 590,350 623,325 681,313 754,315 790,327 806,365 827,404 848,406 848,458 835,496 802,529 773,544 733,550 673,550 627,540 592,515 569,467">
       <p>YOU'LL HAVE TO PEEL IT AND STICK IT ON YOURSELF, YOU STUPID FUCK. AND YOU BETTER BE THERE TOMORROW.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="65,117 54,98 60,46 106,40 188,38 194,60 206,98 183,106 152,115 98,113">
       <p>DAJ MI NÁPLASŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="77,238 81,202 94,173 117,158 154,156 179,175 194,219 194,263 181,298 154,319 119,319 94,304 83,275">
       <p>ACH BOŽE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="565,431 571,390 590,350 623,325 681,313 754,315 790,327 806,365 827,404 848,406 848,458 835,496 802,529 773,544 733,550 673,550 627,540 592,515 569,467">
       <p>MUSÍŠ TO ROZBALIŤ A NALEPIŤ SI TO NA SEBA, TY SPROSTÝ DEBIL. A OPOVÁŽ SA TAM ZAJTRA NEBYŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/17.jpg"/>
    
</page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/18.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="754,185 760,171 783,160 821,154 873,154 904,160 921,173 925,188 915,206 892,215 842,219 794,217 767,208 754,196">
       <p>ASSHOLE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="723,446 727,423 735,415 794,408 844,413 863,421 902,431 929,448 933,469 929,477 869,475 815,465 775,467 754,460 731,456">
       <p>UHHH HH H HH HH H</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="754,185 760,171 783,160 821,154 873,154 904,160 921,173 925,188 915,206 892,215 842,219 794,217 767,208 754,196">
       <p>KRETÉN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="723,446 727,423 735,415 794,408 844,413 863,421 902,431 929,448 933,469 929,477 869,475 815,465 775,467 754,460 731,456">
       <p>AHHH HH H HH HH H</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/19.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/20.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/21.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/22.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,341 40,333 170,331 179,339 179,410 170,423 41,423 31,413">
       <p>WHAT'S A PRETTY LIT'L THING LIKE YOU DOIN' OUT THE WALL AT THIS TIME UH NIGHT?</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,341 40,333 170,331 179,339 179,410 170,423 41,423 31,413">
       <p>ČO TU TAKÉ MALÉ STVORENIE AKO TY ROBÍ MIMO ÚZEMIA STENY O TAKOMTO ČASE V NOCI?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/23.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="28,403 33,390 54,379 90,375 126,378 153,384 166,396 166,414 151,429 124,435 81,435 51,430 31,418">
       <p>FREE COUNTRY, AIN'T IT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="206,548 211,539 286,539 294,544 294,581 288,590 215,591 206,583">
       <p>YEAH, RIGHT.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="28,403 33,390 54,379 90,375 126,378 153,384 166,396 166,414 151,429 124,435 81,435 51,430 31,418">
       <p>SME V SLOBODNEJ KRAJINE, NIE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="206,548 211,539 286,539 294,544 294,581 288,590 215,591 206,583">
       <p>OK, V PORIADKU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/24.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="31,23 350,21 350,127 31,127" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE COULD HEAR THE HYDRAULICS WIND UP TO OPEN CAST-TITANIUM HATCH.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="52,150 360,150 360,500 52,500" type="commentary">
       <p>BY LAW THEY HAD TO LET ANYONE IN THROUGH A HOLE, BUT EVERYONE KNEW THAT NOTHING GOOD HAPPENED ON THE OUTSIDE. FLOATING BROTHELS AND ILLEGAL ORGAN BANKS; BARGE LABS WHERE THEY SOLD GRAY MARKET BODY MODS AND OPEN SOURCE DRUGS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="31,23 350,21 350,127 31,127" type="commentary">
       <p>OZVAL SA ZVUK HYDRAULICKÉHO ZARIADENIA A TITÁNOVÝ POKLOP SA OTVORIL.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="52,150 360,150 360,500 52,500" type="commentary">
       <p>PODĽA ZÁKONA MUSELI KAŽDÉHO VPUSTIŤ DOVNÚTRA, ALE KAŽDÝ VEDEL, ŽA VONKU NAŇHO NEČAKÁ NIČ DOBRÉ. PLÁVAJÚCE BORDELY A ILEGÁLNE BANKY ORGÁNOV; LABORATÓRIÁ, KDE SA PREDÁVALI TELOVÉ MODIFIKÁCIE PRE ČIERNY TRH A OPEN SOURCE DROGY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/25.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="346,52 839,52 839,252 345,252" type="commentary"><p>OPEN SOURCE ANYTHING WAS ILLEGAL, AND DRUGS WERE PRETTY CLOSE TO THE TOP OF THE LIST. BUT THE GOVERNMENT STUFF WAS ALWAYS AT LEAST A GENERATION BEHIND THE DESIGNER SMACK ON THE BARGES, SO ALL REAL JUNKIES WENT OUTSIDE THE WALL TO SCORE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="405,328 915,328 915,507 408,507" type="commentary"><p>THE BARGE ISLANDS WERE PRETTY MUCH LAWLESS - THE COPS HAD A HARD ENOUGH TIME KEEPING THINGS INSIDE THE WALL LOCKED DOWN - WHICH IS WHY WAGNER ALWAYS INSISTED THAT SOMEONE TAG ALONG WITH JAKE ON HIS SHOPPING TRIPS.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="346,52 839,52 839,252 345,252" type="commentary"><p>"OPENSOURCOVANIE" HOCIČOHO BOLO ILEGÁLNE A DROGY BOLI VEĽMI VYSOKO NA ZOZNAME. ALE VLÁDA BOLA VŽDY MINIMÁLNE GENERÁCIU POZADU AKO DIZAJNÉRI, TAKŽE VŠETCI FEŤÁCI BOLI NÚTENÍ CHODIEVAŤ NA DRUHÚ STRANU STENY.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="405,328 915,328 915,507 408,507" type="commentary"><p>OSTROVY NA OKOLÍ BOLI V PODSTATE BEZ ZÁKONA - POLICAJTI MALI PROBLÉM UDRŽAŤ PORIADOK VO VNÚTRI ÚZEMIA STENY - PRETO AJ WAGNER VYŽADOVAL, ABY NA VYCHÁDZKY MIMO CHODIL VŽDY S JAKEOM NA NÁKUPY NIEKTO AKO DOPROVOD.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/26.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="448,110 969,108 969,429 444,431" type="commentary">
       <p>LANEY STEPPED THROUGH THE FIRST HATCH AND INTO THE WATERLOCK. SHE STOOD IN THE RED GLOW OF THE LOW-POWER LAMPS AND WAITED FOR THE OUTER HATCH TO CLOSE. JAKE WAS A DAMN GOOD DRIVER, BUT SOONER OR LATER THEY WOULD LOSE HIM TO THE DRUGS. UNTIL THEN, WAGNER HAD DECIDED THAT IT WAS WORTH THE RISK. IT JUST SEEMED TO LANEY LIKE IT WAS ALWAYS HER TURN TO PLAY BABYSITTER ON HIS RUNS OUTSIDE THE WALL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="448,110 969,108 969,429 444,431" type="commentary">
       <p>LANEY VSTÚPILA CEZ POKLOP DOVNÚTRA. STÁLA V ČERVENOM SVETLE NÍZKOENERGETICKÝCH LÁMP A ČAKALA KÝM SA VONKAJŠÍ POKLOP NEUZATVORÍ. JAKE BOL SAKRA DOBRÝ VODIČ, ALE SKÔR ČI NESKÔR HO STRATIA KVÔLI DROGÁM. DOVTEDY SA WAGNER ROZHODOL, ŽE TO STOJÍ ZA TO RIZIKO. LEN LANEY SA ZDALO, ŽE TO ZOSTALO VŽDY NA NEJ HRAŤ SA NA OPATROVATEĽKU POČAS JEHO VÝJAZDOV MIMO ÚZEMIA STENY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/27.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="313,56 844,56 844,250 310,254" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE HEARD THE OUTER HATCH CLANG SHUT AND SEAL WITH A HISS. IF JAKE DIDN'T SHOW UP TOMORROW WAGNER WOULD BE PISSED OFF, AND SHE'D TAKE SOME OF THE HEAT. SHE BIT HER LIP AND WAITED FOR THE LAMPS TO TURN GREEN. FOR A SECOND SHE THOUGHT ABOUT GOING BACK FOR HIM.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="313,56 844,56 844,250 310,254" type="commentary">
       <p>POČULA AKO SA VONKAJŠÍ POKLOP UZAVREL A SO SYKOTOM UZAMKOL. AK SA JAKE ZAJTRA NEUKÁŽE, WAGNER BUDE NASRANÝ A ONA SCHYTÁ PÁR VÝČITIEK. ZAHRYZLA SI DO PERY A VYČKÁVALA, KÝM LAMPY NEZASVIETIA NA ZELENO. NA CHVÍĽU SI POMYSLELA, ČI BY SA NEMALA PRE NEHO PREDSA LEN VRÁTIŤ.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/28.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="248,88 265,71 631,73 644,85 646,160 629,179 265,179 250,163" type="code">
       <p>THE HOLE IS CLEAR. WELCOME TO THE CITY. YOU'RE AT TENTH AND FIRST.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="467,210 965,210 965,348 465,348" type="commentary">
       <p>THE LAMPS TURNED GREEN. THE INNER HATCH SWUNG OPEN AND SHE FELT THE WI-FI COME IN OFF 3,058 DIFFERENT NODES. FUCK JAKE - SHE HAD SHIT TO DO.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="248,88 265,71 631,73 644,85 646,160 629,179 265,179 250,163" type="code">
       <p>VSTUP JE VOĽNÝ. VITAJTE V MESTE. STE NA 101. ULICI.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="467,210 965,210 965,348 465,348" type="commentary">
       <p>LAMPY SA ROZSVIETILI NA ZELENO. VNÚTORNÝ POKLOP SA OTVORIL A ONA ZACÍTILA WI-FI SIGNÁL PRICHÁDZAJÚCI Z 3058 RÔZNYCH UZLOV. KAŠLAŤ NA JAKE-A - MÁM EŠTE ROBOTU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/29.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,383 600,383 602,535 33,540" type="commentary">
       <p>IT WAS A SATURDAY NIGHT AND FIRST AVENUE WAS HOPPING. KIDS FROM JERSEY AND LONG ISLAND CRUISED THE MOTO GRID TEN METERS UP IN BMWS AND KIAS, SPEAKERS BLASTING THE LATEST 8-BIT TRANCE TRACKS IN UNISON.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,383 600,383 602,535 33,540" type="commentary">
       <p>BOLA SOBOTNAJŠIA NOC A HLAVNÁ TRIEDA BOLA RUŠNÁ. DECKÁ Z JERSEY A LONG ISLAND-U SA PREHÁŇALI MOTO-GRIDOM 10 METROV NAD ULICOU V BMW-ČKACH A KIÁCH, S REPRODUKTORMI ZAPNUTÝMI NAPLNO HRAJÚCIMI NAJNOVŠIE 8-BITOVÉ TRANCE NAHRÁVKY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/30.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="17,25 677,23 675,133 19,133" type="commentary">
       <p>THE STREETS WERE FULL OF PEOPLE SMOKING HASH AND CIGARETTES IN FRONT OF ALCOHOL BARS. THEY WERE MOSTLY STUDENTS AND HIPSTERS WITH DESIGNER BODY MODS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="17,25 677,23 675,133 19,133" type="commentary">
       <p>ULICE BOLI PLNÉ ĽUDÍ FAJČIACICH HAŠIŠ A CIGARETY PRED BARMI. BOLI TO HLAVNE ŠTUDENTI A VOĽNOMYŠLIENKÁRI S NADIZAJNOVANÝMI TELOVÝMI MODIFIKÁCIAMI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/31.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="23,67 233,67 233,98 25,100" type="commentary">
       <p>POINTED EARS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="363,104 471,104 471,140 365,138" type="commentary">
       <p>CLAWS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="700,40 975,42 977,81 702,79" type="commentary">
       <p>ENLARGED CANINES.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="96,452 725,452 727,542 92,542" type="commentary">
       <p>AND THE OCCASIONAL TAIL - THE KIND OF USELESS SHIT FOR WHICH THE SHOPS ON ST. MARK'S WERE KNOWN.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="23,67 233,67 233,98 25,100" type="commentary">
       <p>ŠPICATÉ UŠI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="363,104 471,104 471,140 365,138" type="commentary">
       <p>DRÁPY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="700,40 975,42 977,81 702,79" type="commentary">
       <p>ZVÄČŠENÉ ŠPIČÁKY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="96,452 725,452 727,542 92,542" type="commentary">
       <p>A OBČAS I CHVOST - V PODSTATE ZBYTOČNÉ HOVADINY, PRE KTORÉ BOLI OBCHODY NA ST. MARK'S ULICI ZNÁME.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/32.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,23 560,21 560,81 25,81" type="commentary">
       <p>AS SHE WALKED DOWN FIRST TOWARDS NINTH, PEOPLE STARED.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="238,423 738,423 738,548 235,548" type="commentary">
       <p>PARTLY BECAUSE SHE WAS TALL AND BEAUTIFUL AND WEARING A SKIN-TIGHT KEVLAR BODY SUIT - BUT MOSTLY BECAUSE SHE WASN'T PACKING HARDWARE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,23 560,21 560,81 25,81" type="commentary">
       <p>AKO IŠLA SMEROM NADOL Z PRVEJ ULICE NA DEVIATU, ĽUDIA PO NEJ POKUKOVALI.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="238,423 738,423 738,548 235,548" type="commentary">
       <p>ČIASTOČNE PRETOŽE BOLA VYSOKÁ A KRÁSNA A NOSILA TESNE NA TELE PRILEPENÉ KEVLAROVÉ ŠATY - ALE HLAVNE PRETO, LEBO NEMALA ŽIADEN VIDITEĽNÝ HARDWARE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/33.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,25 548,25 550,150 33,150" type="commentary">
       <p>WI-FI ON THE INSIDE - EVERYONE KNEW BECAUSE THEIR GEAR PICKED UP HER PROFILE AS SHE WALKED BY, BUT SHE WASN'T WEARING SONY SPEC'S OR PANASONIC THIRD EYE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="104,387 586,387 586,512 103,512" type="commentary"><p>IT MADE THEIR FASHION MODS LOOK LIKE CHEAP COSTUMES. YOU HAD TO BE HARD-CORE TO LET THEM OPEN UP YOUR SKULL AND STICK THE GEAR INTO YOUR BRAIN.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,25 548,25 550,150 33,150" type="commentary">
       <p>ČO SA TÝKA JEJ WI-FI SIGNÁLU, VEDELI TO VŠETCI, PRETOŽE ICH PRÍSTROJE ZACHYTILI JEJ PROFIL, KEĎ IŠLA OKOLO, ALE NENIESLA ŽIADNE SONY ŠPECIÁLY ANI TRETIE OKO ZNAČKY PANASONIC.</p></text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="104,387 586,387 586,512 103,512" type="commentary"><p>ICH MÓDNE MODIFIKÁCIE V JEJ PRÍTOMNOSTI VYZERALI AKO LACNÉ KOSTÝMI. ČLOVEK MUSEL BYŤ RIADNE HARD-CORE, ABY SI NECHAL OTVORIŤ LEBKU A STRČIŤ ELEKTRONIKU DO SVOJHO MOZGU.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/34.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="13,444 304,448 358,492 454,490 667,558 8,556" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE STEPPED INTO A WAL-MART BODEGA ON THE CORNER OF FIRST AND NINTH TO BUY A PACK OF MARLBOROS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="13,444 304,448 358,492 454,490 667,558 8,556" type="commentary">
       <p>VSTÚPILA DO WAL-MART PRIESTOROV NA ROHU PRVEJ A DEVIATEJ ULICE, ABY SI KÚPILA BALÍČEK MARLBORIEK.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/35.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/36.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="54,115 67,100 492,100 508,119 506,223 490,238 73,238 54,223" type="code">
       <p>WARNING. NEW YORK CITY ORDINANCE 11238A PROHIBITS COMBUSTION OF TOBACCO AND CANNABIS DERIVED PRODUCTS IN ANY INDOOR SPACE ...</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="42,310 433,308 433,469 44,469" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE LIT UP ISIDE, JUST FOR KICKS, JUST BECAUSE SHE LIKED THE SOUND OF THE SYNTH VOICE RECITING THE BLOOMBERG ORDINANCE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="54,115 67,100 492,100 508,119 506,223 490,238 73,238 54,223" type="code">
       <p>POZOR. NARIADENIE MESTA NEW YORK ČÍSLO 11238A ZAKAZUJE SPAĽOVANIE TABAKU A Z TRÁVY VYROBENÝCH PRODUKTOV VO VNÚTRI BUDOV ...</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="42,310 433,308 433,469 44,469" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ZAPÁLILA SI VO VNÚTRI, LEN TAK NASCHVÁĽ, PRETOŽE MILOVALA ZVUK SYNTETIZÁTOROVÉHO HLASU RECITUJÚCEHO NARIADENIE BLOOMBERGA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/37.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="165,370 309,371 309,545 164,545" type="commentary">
       <p>OUTSIDE ON THE STREET SHE HEADED WEST DOWN NINTH, TOWARDS THE VILLAGE. SHE LET THE CROWD FALL AWAY AND DOVE INTO THE WI-FI AS SHE WALKED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="165,370 309,371 309,545 164,545" type="commentary">
       <p>VONKU NA ULICI ZAMIERILA NA ZÁPAD NADOL PO DEVIATEJ ULICI SMEROM K MESTEČKU. NEREGISTROVALA DAV NAOKOLO A LEN SA PONORILA DO WI-FI SIGNÁLU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/38.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="508,308 996,308 998,540 521,540 506,525" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE SPRAWLING, LAYERED, THREE DIMENSIONAL NETWORK SNAPED INTO FOCUS. CONNECTIONS BETWEEN NODES GREW AND SHRANK; THE SURFACE RIPPLED AS USERS CRUISED THE NETWORK; NODES SHIFTED POSITION AND NEW CONNECTIONS WERE FORMED WHILE OTHERS DISAPPEARED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="508,308 996,308 998,540 521,540 506,525" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ROZVETVENÁ, ZVRSTVENÁ, 3-DIMENZIONÁLNA SIEŤ SA OBJAVILA V JEJ VIZUÁLNOM POLI. KONEKCIE MEDZI UZLAMI RÁSTLI A ZMENŠOVALI SA; POVRCH SA VLNIL KEĎ POUŽIVATELIA BROWSOVALI SIEŤOU; UZLY MENILI SVOJE POZÍCIE A NOVÉ KONEKCIE SA FORMOVALI, KÝM INÉ ZANIKALI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/39.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="31,98 246,98 248,340 242,365 238,392 244,417 250,425 250,481 33,483" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE MOVED DOWN THROUGH THE LAYERS, PAST THE ADVERTS AND THE NATIONAL NEWS, PAUSING BRIEFLY TO FOLLOW A STRONG CONNECTION TO A CLUSTER OF NODES AROUND NAPSTER.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="621,448 979,450 979,548 623,550" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE COULD HEAR THE CHATTER FROM FAR OFF: KIDS HACKING IN FOR FREE GOODS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="31,98 246,98 248,340 242,365 238,392 244,417 250,425 250,481 33,483" type="commentary">
       <p>IŠLA SMEROM NADOL CEZ VRSTVY SIETE, POMEDZI REKLAMY A ŠTÁTNE SPRAVODAJSTVO, ZASTAVUJÚC LEN LETMO OKOLO SILNEJ KONEKCIE SMEROM KU ZHLUKU UZLOV V OKOLÍ NAPSTERU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="621,448 979,450 979,548 623,550" type="commentary">
       <p>MOHLA POČUŤ VRAVU Z DIAĽKY: DECKÁ SNAŽIACE SA DOSTAŤ DNU K VECIAM ZADARMO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/40.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="9,16 183,16 183,113 166,136 159,221 129,303 94,329 94,345 9,345" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PRESSING DEEPER SHE LET GO FOR A FEW SECONDS AND RELAXED INTO A FREEFALL, LETTING THE NETWORK PULL HER DOWN THROUGH THE STRONG CONNECTIONS: PAST CYBERSEX CLUSTERS AND EBAY, HER VELOCITY INCREASING AS A GOVERNMENT PROPAGANDA NODE SUCKED IN USERS LIKE A GIANT VORTEX.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="9,16 183,16 183,113 166,136 159,221 129,303 94,329 94,345 9,345" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>POKRAČUJÚC HLBŠIE NADOL SA NA CHVÍĽU UVOLNILA A RELAXOVALA PRI VOĽNOM PÁDE NECHAJÚC SIEŤ, ABY JU TIAHLA SMEROM K SILNEJŠÍM KONEKCIÁM: OKOLO CYBERSEX ZHLUKOV A EBAY-U, JEJ RÝCHLOSŤ NARASTALA V OKOLÍ UZLA VLÁDNEJ PROPAGANDY, KTORÝ NASÁVAL POUŽÍVATEĽOV AKO OBROVSKÝ VÍR.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/41.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="29,33 275,33 273,85 323,113 323,488 283,504 250,538 29,538" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE BROKE THE FALL SLOWLY, PEELING AWAY FROM THE PROPAGANDA NODE, MOVING BACK UP THROUGH THE LAYERS. SHE WAS FILTERING STRONG NOW, FOCUSING ON CONNECTIONS THAT BROUGHT HER OFF TO THE EDGE OF THE NETWORK, PAST HACKER NODES AND PROTECTED LAYERS THAT APPEARED AS HUGE BLANK SPOTS IN THE NETWORK.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="29,33 275,33 273,85 323,113 323,488 283,504 250,538 29,538" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>POSTUPNE PÁD ZASTAVILA, ABY SA DOSTALA PREČ OD UZLA PROPAGANDY A POHLA SA SMEROM NAHOR POMEDZI INÉ VRSTVY SIETE. FILTRE MALA NASTAVENÉ NAPLNO SÚSTREDIAC SA NA KONEKCIE, KTORÉ BY JU DOSTALI PREČ SMEROM K OKRAJU SIETE, OKOLO UZLOV HACKEROV A CHRÁNENÝCH VRSTIEV, KTORÉ VYZERALI AKO OBROVSKÉ PRÁZDNE MIESTA V SIETI.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/42.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="46,23 938,23 940,129 879,152 46,152" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>WAGNER'S CONTACT ON THE INSIDE WAS SUPPOSED TO HAVE HIDDEN THE ACCESS CODE THEY'D NEED FOR TOMORROW'S JOB HERE, BUT NOBODY LIKED JACKING INTO STRANGE SYSTEMS. SHE TOOK A CLOSER LOOK, SCANNING THE SURFACE FOR KNOWN VIRAL PATTERNS AND WORM TRACKS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="356,413 979,413 979,546 358,546" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>IT LOOKED CLEAN, SO SHE LOCKED IN AND SCANNED THE SURFACE FOR A RECEPTOR SITE. IT WAS SUBTLE, BUT THERE - TO MOST USERS THE NODES SURFACE WOULD HAVE APPEARED COMPLETELY SMOOTH.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="46,23 938,23 940,129 879,152 46,152" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>WAGNEROV KONTAKT ZVNÚTRA TU MAL UKRYŤ PRÍSTUPOVÝ KÓD, KTORÝ POTREBOVALI NA ZAJTRAJŠIU AKCIU, ALE NIKTO NEMAL RÁD ŠPÁRANIE SA V NEZNÁMOM SYSTÉME. POZRELA SA BLIŽSIE SKÚMAJÚC POVRCH HĽADAJÚC ZNÁME VÍRUSOVÉ VZORKY A STOPY PO ČERVOCH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="356,413 979,413 979,546 358,546" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>VYZERALO TO ČISTÉ, TAK SA NAPOJILA A HĽADALA NA POVRCHU MIESTO PRE RECEPTOR. BOLO TO MALINKÉ, ALE NAŠLA TO - PRE VÄČŠINU UŽIVATEĽOV SA UZLY JAVILI ÚPLNE HLADKÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/43.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="673,38 996,38 996,144 673,144" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE ACCESS CODE WAS THERE - ITS ICON A SMALL GOLDEN SKELETON KEY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="773,452 992,452 992,540 700,540 700,496" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE CUT AND PASTED THE KEY INTO HER WETWARE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="673,38 996,38 996,144 673,144" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PRÍSTUPOVÝ KÓD BOL TAM - JEHO IKONA BOL MALÝ ZLATÝ KĽÚČ S LEBKOU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="773,452 992,452 992,540 700,540 700,496" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PREKOPÍROVALA KĽÚČ DO SVOJEJ ELEKTRONICKEJ PAMÄTE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/44.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,21 375,19 465,142 473,175 15,175" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE CLOSED THE NODE AND BLASTED UP THROUGH THE LAYERS ON THE MAIN PIPE UNTIL SHE WAS BACK OUTSIDE, BACK ON THE STREET, MOVING PAST THE CROWD ON 7<sup>TH</sup> AVENUE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="552,425 977,425 979,535 565,533" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE TOOK A LAST DRAG OFF THE MARLBORO, FLICKED IT INTO THE STREET, AND PINGED WAGNER ON AIM.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,21 375,19 465,142 473,175 15,175" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>UZAVRELA UZOL A VYRAZILA NAHOR CEZ VRSTVY NA HLAVNEJ TEPNE, AŽ KÝM NEBOLA ÚPLNE VON, SPÄŤ NA ULICI, PRECHÁDZAJÚC OKOLO DAVU NA SIEDMEJ AVENUE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="552,425 977,425 979,535 565,533" type="commentary">
       <p>POTIAHLA SI POSLEDNÝKRÁT Z MARLBORKY, HODILA ŠPAK NA ULICU A NAPÍSALA WAGNEROVY NA MESSENGER.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/45.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="24,20 326,20 326,359 185,359 110,379 20,379" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>L: U there?</p><p>W: Yeah. U got it?</p><p>L: Yeah. I got it.</p><p>W: :-)</p><p>L: R we still on?</p><p>W: 9am sharp. Is Jake with you?</p><p>L: Yeah, he's here. Just went 2 starbux 4 a latte.</p><p>W: Good. I'll c u guys tomorrow. Don't be l8.</p><p>L: CU</p><p>W: TTFN</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="24,20 326,20 326,359 185,359 110,379 20,379" bgcolor="#000000" type="code" inverted="True">
       <p>L: Si tam?</p><p>W: Jasne. Máš to?</p><p>L: Jasne. Mám to.</p><p>W: :-)</p><p>L: Stále to platí?</p><p>W: O deviatej ráno, presne. Je Jake s tebou?</p><p>L: Jasne, je tu. Išiel si len dať kávu.</p><p>W: Dobre. Uvidíme sa zajtra. Nebuďte neskoro.</p><p>L: Maj sa</p><p>W: Čau</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/46.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="13,40 325,38 325,121 285,140 263,152 13,152" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE CHECKED THE TIME ON THE ATOMIC CLOCK IN COLORADO: 20:43:08.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="19,421 275,421 290,481 321,481 321,531 19,531" type="commentary">
       <p>IN TWO HOURS JAKE WOULD PROBABLY BE FLOATING PAST CONEY ISLAND.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="13,40 325,38 325,121 285,140 263,152 13,152" type="commentary">
       <p>SKONTROLOVALA ČAS NA ATÓMOVÝCH HODINÁCH V COLORADE: 20:43:08.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="19,421 275,421 290,481 321,481 321,531 19,531" type="commentary">
       <p>ZA DVE HODINY BUDE JAKE PRAVDEPODOBNE PLÁVAŤ V OKOLÍ CONEY ISLAND.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/47.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="44,35 344,35 344,79 44,77" type="commentary">
       <p>THE NEXT MORNING.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="383,77 677,77 679,142 383,142" type="commentary">
       <p>OUTSIDE WAGNER'S APARTMENT IN SOHO.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="44,35 344,35 344,79 44,77" type="commentary">
       <p>NA DRUHÝ DEŇ RÁNO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="383,77 677,77 679,142 383,142" type="commentary">
       <p>PRED WAGNEROVÝM BYTOM V SOHO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/48.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="35,40 46,25 265,25 277,38 275,148 267,160 50,160 35,148" type="code">
       <p>IDENTIFICATION VERIFIED. ATTEMPTING TO CONTACT OCCUPANT.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="17,240 275,240 275,496 19,496" type="commentary">
       <p>THERE WAS NO ANSWER. WAGNER WAS PROBABLY OUT GETTING COFEE, SHE THOUGHT, OR PROGIVIL7, DEPENDING ON HOW LONG HE'S BEEN UP.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="35,40 46,25 265,25 277,38 275,148 267,160 50,160 35,148" type="code">
       <p>IDENTIFIKÁCIA OVERENÁ. POKÚŠAM SA KONTAKTOVAŤ MAJITEĽA.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="17,240 275,240 275,496 19,496" type="commentary">
       <p>ŽIADNA ODPOVEĎ. WAGNER BOL PRAVDEPODOBNE MIMO NA KÁVE, MYSLELA SI, ALEBO NA PROGIVILE-7, ZÁVISIAC OD TOHO AKO DLHO BOL VČERA HORE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/49.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="385,21 952,21 952,127 679,127 385,77" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE DIPPED INTO THE WI-FI AND HACKED THE LOCK ON THE FRONT DOOR, AND THEN ALL THREE LOCKS ON HIS APARTMENT DOOR.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="296,496 894,496 894,556 296,556" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE HAD THE SUBROUTINE CACHED IN RAM, BECAUSE WAGNER WAS ALWAYS LATE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="385,21 952,21 952,127 679,127 385,77" type="commentary">
       <p>PONORILA SA DO WI-FI SIETE A HACKLA ZÁMOK NA VSTUPNÝCH DVERÁCH A NÁSLEDNE VŠETKY TRI ZÁMKY NA JEHO DVERÁCH DO BYTU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="296,496 894,496 894,556 296,556" type="commentary">
       <p>MALA TIETO PROGRAMY NAKEŠOVANÉ V RAM-KE, PRETOŽE WAGNER CHODIEVAL VŽDY NESKORO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/50.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/51.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/52.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/53.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 1/54.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/55.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="321,52 333,29 371,8 392,4 721,4 769,23 785,50 773,79 713,106 642,115 515,117 388,104 335,81">
       <p>WHAT THE FUCK ARE YOU DOING? HOW MANY TIMES HAVE I TOLD YOU NOT TO DO THAT?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="529,148 558,133 640,127 746,127 802,133 827,146 817,163 760,175 663,175 577,173 542,165">
       <p>GET BETTER LOCKS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="358,177 373,152 425,142 485,142 519,154 529,175 521,198 475,210 408,210 367,198">
       <p>FUCK YOU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="490,235 498,217 527,208 538,198 600,196 642,204 660,221 663,244 646,265 602,277 552,277 506,269 492,250">
       <p>GOOD MORNING TO YOU, TOO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="321,52 333,29 371,8 392,4 721,4 769,23 785,50 773,79 713,106 642,115 515,117 388,104 335,81">
       <p>ČO TO DO PEKLA ROBÍŠ? KOĽKOKRÁT SOM TI UŽ POVEDAL, ŽE TO ROBIŤ NEMÁŠ?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="529,148 558,133 640,127 746,127 802,133 827,146 817,163 760,175 663,175 577,173 542,165">
       <p>OBSTARAJ SI LEPŠIE ZÁMKY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="358,177 373,152 425,142 485,142 519,154 529,175 521,198 475,210 408,210 367,198">
       <p>NESER MA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="490,235 498,217 527,208 538,198 600,196 642,204 660,221 663,244 646,265 602,277 552,277 506,269 492,250">
       <p>DOBRÉ RÁNO ŽELÁM AJ JA TEBE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/56.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="23,60 33,38 79,17 150,13 221,19 260,38 269,58 263,88 221,106 165,113 96,110 44,98 25,77">
       <p>HOW CAN YOU WATCH ALL THAT AT ONCE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="227,115 254,106 271,92 279,85 352,85 392,98 413,117 413,146 396,171 363,181 308,185 260,177 233,163 223,142">
       <p>PARALLEL PROCESSING.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="27,183 42,160 92,144 169,142 215,148 219,163 235,181 256,185 254,202 233,219 194,229 138,231 81,229 44,215 27,196">
       <p>WHATEVER. WHERE'S JAKE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="215,238 246,225 260,210 310,213 342,223 354,244 350,273 331,292 290,298 244,294 217,277 213,258">
       <p>I DON'T KNOW.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="23,60 33,38 79,17 150,13 221,19 260,38 269,58 263,88 221,106 165,113 96,110 44,98 25,77">
       <p>AKO TO DOKÁŽEŠ SLEDOVAŤ VŠETKO NARAZ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="227,115 254,106 271,92 279,85 352,85 392,98 413,117 413,146 396,171 363,181 308,185 260,177 233,163 223,142">
       <p>PARALELNÉ SPRACOVANIE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="27,183 42,160 92,144 169,142 215,148 219,163 235,181 256,185 254,202 233,219 194,229 138,231 81,229 44,215 27,196">
       <p>HMM. KDE JE JAKE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="215,238 246,225 260,210 310,213 342,223 354,244 350,273 331,292 290,298 244,294 217,277 213,258">
       <p>NEVIEM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/57.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="292,88 310,48 381,15 454,6 625,6 708,25 754,56 767,92 748,142 700,169 600,188 444,188 356,171 304,135 294,108">
       <p>LOOK, LANEY, IF HE DOESN'T SHOW WE'RE IN DEEP SHIT. I'VE GOT A BUYER LINED UP FOR THIS THING AND I CAN'T JUST TELL HIM THAT THE GATEWAY DRIVER HAD A HANGOVER.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="396,290 402,260 435,235 510,219 606,223 665,235 696,263 702,300 679,335 621,354 558,360 483,358 419,338 398,310">
       <p>WELL THEN GET A DIFFERENT DRIVER. I DON'T KNOW WHERE THE FUCK HE IS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="154,469 571,469 571,530 153,530" type="commentary"><p>SOMEWHERE IN THE ATLANTIC BY NOW, SHE THOUGHT.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="292,88 310,48 381,15 454,6 625,6 708,25 754,56 767,92 748,142 700,169 600,188 444,188 356,171 304,135 294,108">
       <p>POZRI LANEY, AK SA NEUKÁŽE, SME V ŤAŽKOM PRÚSERI. MÁM KUPCA PRIPRAVENÉHO NA TÚTO VEC A NEMÔŽEM MU LEN TAK POVEDAŤ, ŽE NÁŠ VODIČ MÁ OPICU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="396,290 402,260 435,235 510,219 606,223 665,235 696,263 702,300 679,335 621,354 558,360 483,358 419,338 398,310">
       <p>NO TAK SI OBSTARAJ INÉHO VODIČA. NEVIEM, KDE DO PEKLA JE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="154,469 571,469 571,530 153,530" type="commentary"><p>ASI NIEKDE V ATLANTIKU, POMYSLELA SI.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 1/58.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="85,129 100,96 142,77 206,79 242,102 248,133 235,169 185,188 121,183 90,156">
       <p>WHERE'S JULIUS?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="744,446 750,423 781,400 838,394 900,402 927,423 933,452 921,481 881,502 835,506 783,500 752,479">
       <p>JULIUS ISN'T COMING!</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="85,129 100,96 142,77 206,79 242,102 248,133 235,169 185,188 121,183 90,156">
       <p>KDE JE JULIUS?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="744,446 750,423 781,400 838,394 900,402 927,423 933,452 921,481 881,502 835,506 783,500 752,479">
       <p>JULIUS NEPRÍDE!</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 1/59.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="270,212 753,212 753,279 268,279" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>TO BE CONTINUED</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="270,212 753,212 753,279 268,279" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>POKRAČOVANIE NABUDÚCE</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 2</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 2</title>
      <image href="Issue 2/01.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,377 581,377 581,406 417,406" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>ISSUE 2</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,377 581,377 581,406 417,406" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>KAPITOLA 2</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/02.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="13,19 301,19 301,89 14,89" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS HATED EVERYTHING ABOUT THE BARGE CITIES, STARTING WITH THE FACT THAT THERE WAS ONLY ONE WAY TO GET THERE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="13,19 301,19 301,89 14,89" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS NANÁVIDEL VŠETKO, ČO SA TÝKALO OSTROVNÝCH MIEST, POČÍNAJÚC FAKTOM, ŽE EXISTOVALA LEN JEDNA MOŽNOSŤ, AKO SA TAM DOSTAŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/03.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="313,46 929,46 929,140 308,140" type="commentary">
       <p>THE CHINESE MAFIA HAD A LOCK ON WATER TRANSPORT AROUND MANHATTAN, AND THEY ALL RAN HOT-RODDED <emphasis>DIY</emphasis> HYDROPLANES.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="313,46 929,46 929,140 308,140" type="commentary">
       <p>ČÍNSKA MAFIA MAFIA OVLÁDALA VODNÚ DOPRAVU V OKOLÍ MANHATTANU, A JAZDILI NA <emphasis>VYTUNENÝCH</emphasis> UPRAVENÝCH HYDROPLÁNOCH.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/04.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,29 965,29 965,140 298,138 298,163 33,163" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>IT WASN'T ALL THAT RARE FOR THEM TO FLIP OVER AT 150 <emphasis>KPH</emphasis> AND SHRED THEMSELVES AND EVERYTHING ON BOARD TO MESSY LITTLE CHUNKS. AND IF THE COPS SHOWED UP, THE PILOTS HAD A TENDENCY TO JETTISON THEIR PASSANGERS IN ORDER TO MAKE THE GETAWAY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="558,492 969,492 969,525 556,531" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>MORE MESSY LITTLE CHUNKS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,29 965,29 965,140 298,138 298,163 33,163" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>NEBOLO PRE NICH VÔBEC NEZVYČAJNÉ PREVRÁTIŤ SA V <emphasis>200 KM/H</emphasis> A ROZMLÁTIŤ SEBA A VŠETKO NA PALUBE NA KUSY. A KEĎ SA OBJAVILI POLIŠI, PILOTI MALI TENDENCIU HODIŤ PASAŽIEROV CEZ PALUBU, ABY UNIKLI DO BEZPEČIA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="558,492 969,492 969,525 556,531" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>LEN VIAC BORDELU NAOKOLO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/05.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="25,25 642,27 642,175 29,177" type="commentary">
       <p>IT'S NOT THAT JULIUS WAS AFRAID OF THE HYDROPLANES - OR ANYTHING ELSE FOR THAT MATTER. HIS ADRENAL GLANDS WERE CUSTOM GENETIC MODS, AND THE FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT ONLY KICKED IN WHEN HE NEEDED IT (AND THEN IT REALLY KICKED IN).</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="29,442 583,444 585,546 31,546" type="commentary">
       <p>BUT SINCE THE ODDS OF GETTING PULLED OVER BY A PATROL BOAT WERE ABOUT 1 IN 6074, DRIVING AT THIS SPEED WAS JUST AN UNNECESSARY RISK.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="25,25 642,27 642,175 29,177" type="commentary">
       <p>NEBOLO TO V TOM, ŽE BY SA JULIUS BÁL HYDROPLÁNOV - ALEBO VÔBEC NIEČOHO INÉHO. JEHO ADRENALÍNOVÉ ŽĽAZY BOLI ŠPECIÁLNE GENETICKY MODIFIKOVANÉ, A ADRENALÍN DOKÁZAL REGULOVAŤ PODĽA POTREBY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="29,442 583,444 585,546 31,546" type="commentary">
       <p>ALE KEĎŽE PRAVDEPODOBNOSŤ, ŽE BUDÚ CHYTENÍ STRÁŽNYM ČLNOM BOLA LEN 1 K 6074, JAZDIŤ TOUTO RÝCHLOSŤOU BOLO ZBYTOČNE VYSOKÉ RIZIKO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/06.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="35,63 477,63 477,154 38,154" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>AND IN JULIUS'S LINE OF WORK, RISK REDUCTION WAS THE NAME OF THE GAME.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="40,250 440,250 440,513 40,513" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>WHEN YOU SPENT MOST OF YOUR TIME TRYING TO STEAL SOMETHING, KILL SOMEONE OR NOT GET KILLED BY SOMEONE (OR MORE OFTEN, SOME COMBINATION OF THE ABOVE), IT'S IMPORTANT TO KEEP THE ODDS RUNNING IN YOUR FAVOR.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="35,63 477,63 477,154 38,154" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>A V JULIUSOVEJ BRANDŽI, REDUKCIA RIZIKA BOLO TO, O ČO SA HRALO.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="40,250 440,250 440,513 40,513" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>KEĎ ČLOVEK TRÁVI VÄČŠINU ČASU POKÚŠANÍM SA NIEČO UKRADNÚŤ, NIEKOHO ZABIŤ ALEBO NEBYŤ ZABITÝ NIEKÝM INÝM (ČASTEJŠIE VŠAK NEJAKÁ KOMBINÁCIA UVEDENÝCH VECÍ), JE DÔLEŽITÉ MAŤ PRAVDEPODOBNOSŤ ÚSPECHU NA SVOJEJ STRANE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/07.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="20,460 299,460 299,584 20,584" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE ONLY GOOD NEWS WAS THAT THE HYDROPLANES RIDE WAS PROBABLY THE MOST DANGEROUS PART OF TONIGHT'S JOB. SINCE THE PLAN DIDN'T CALL FOR ANY STEALING OR KILLING, THE CHANCES OF RUNNING INTO ANY HEAVY METAL WERE PRETTY LOW.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="20,460 299,460 299,584 20,584" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>JEDINÁ DOBRÁ SPRÁVA BOLA, ŽE CESTA HYDROPLÁNOM BOLA PRAVDEPODOBNE NAJNEBEZPEČNEJŠIA ČASŤ DNEŠNEJ MISIE. KEĎŽE PLÁN NEPOČÍTAL SO ŽIADNYM KRADNUTÍM ALEBO ZABÍJANÍM, PRAVDEPODOBNOSŤ VBEHNUTIA DO ROJA VYSTRELENÝCH GULIEK BOLA CELKOM NÍZKA.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/08.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="306,21 983,21 983,152 302,152" type="commentary">
       <p>ALL HE HAD TO DO WAS PICK UP A SAMPLE OF DESIGNER M7 THAT WAGNER HAD ARRANGED TO DELIVER TO A DRUG SYNDICATE BASED IN NORTH GOTHAM. HE WAS JUST A HIGH-PRICED, HIGHLY-MODIFIED CYBORG MESSENGER BOY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="306,21 983,21 983,152 302,152" type="commentary">
       <p>VŠETKO, ČO BOLO TREBA SPRAVIŤ, BOLO VYZDVIHNÚŤ BALÍČEK SO VZORKOU DIZAJNÉRU M7, KTORÝ WAGNER PLÁNOVAL NESKÔR DORUČIŤ DROGOVÉMU SYNDIKÁTU V SEVERNOM GOTHAME. JULIUS BOL LEN DRAHÝ, VYSOKO-MODIFIKOVANÝ KYBORGOVÝ POSLÍČEK.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/09.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="48,60 54,38 83,10 123,2 223,2 267,19 290,40 294,69 285,94 265,113 227,123 179,127 117,123 69,106 50,81">
       <p>WAIT HERE AND KEEP THE ENGINES WARM, JUST IN CASE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="242,154 246,133 254,123 267,119 285,110 338,113 365,123 375,144 375,169 360,188 338,198 298,200 267,196 248,181 240,163">
       <p>YOU'VE GOT AN HOUR.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="48,60 54,38 83,10 123,2 223,2 267,19 290,40 294,69 285,94 265,113 227,123 179,127 117,123 69,106 50,81">
       <p>ČAKAJ TU A NECHAJ MOTOR PRE ISTOTU BEŽAŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="242,154 246,133 254,123 267,119 285,110 338,113 365,123 375,144 375,169 360,188 338,198 298,200 267,196 248,181 240,163">
       <p>MÁŠ JEDNU HODINU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/10.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="1,81 15,46 39,20 76,8 118,8 151,24 174,51 185,83 188,123 186,175 174,215 151,243 118,258 86,261 40,249 9,214 3,190">
       <p>NO WAY. YOU WAIT 'TILL I GET BACK. THAT'S THE DEAL. YOU WANT NEGATIVE FEEDBACK ON THIS JOB? RIGHT NOW YOU'RE RATED 98% POSITIVE. NO CRASHES. NO PASSENGER DUMPS. YOU'RE NOT HERE WHEN I GET BACK AND YOUR REP IS TRASHED.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="44,294 53,281 75,273 114,271 140,281 149,298 145,318 129,329 96,333 59,326 45,311">
       <p>YEAH, OK. BUT HURRY UP.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="1,81 15,46 39,20 76,8 118,8 151,24 174,51 185,83 188,123 186,175 174,215 151,243 118,258 86,261 40,249 9,214 3,190">
       <p>V ŽIADNOM PRÍPADE. POČKÁŠ TU, DOKÝM SA NEVRÁTIM. TAKÁ JE DOHODA. CHCEŠ NEGATÍVNU ODOZVU NA TÚTO AKCIU? MOMENTÁLNE SI HODNOTENÝ NA 98% POZITÍVNE. ŽIADNE ZRÁŽKY, ÚMRTIA PASAŽIEROV. AK TU NEBUDEŠ, KEĎ SA VRÁTIM, TVOJA REPUTÁCIA BUDE V HAJZLI.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="44,294 53,281 75,273 114,271 140,281 149,298 145,318 129,329 96,333 59,326 45,311">
       <p>HMM, OK. ALE POHNI SI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/11.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/12.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="38,379 931,379 931,492 38,492" type="commentary">
       <p>"END OF BARGE 386 THERE'S A NOODLE SHOP. TELL THE GUY BEHIND THE COUNTER YOU'RE LOOKING FOR HOLLAND." THAT'S ALL WAGNER HAD GIVEN HIM IN THE WAY OF DIRECTIONS, BUT IT'S NOT LIKE THERE WERE A LOT OF NOODLE SHOPS AROUND.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="38,379 931,379 931,492 38,492" type="commentary">
       <p>"NA KONCI BÁRKY 386 JE OBCHOD S REZANCAMI. POVEDZ CHALANOVI ZA BAROM, ŽE HĽADÁŠ HOLLANDA." TO JE VŠETKO, ČO MU WAGNER DAL AKO INŠTRUKCIE, ALE POPRAVDE NEBOLO TU VEĽA OBCHODOV S REZANCAMI NA OKOLÍ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/13.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/14.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="640,50 650,23 690,4 760,6 800,17 815,46 806,81 769,100 721,104 669,96 644,75">
       <p>I'M HERE TO SEE HOLLAND.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="640,50 650,23 690,4 760,6 800,17 815,46 806,81 769,100 721,104 669,96 644,75">
       <p>HĽADÁM HOLLANDA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/15.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="100,73 106,50 140,35 198,35 225,50 235,71 227,96 204,108 167,115 127,108 104,96">
       <p>THAT DOOR.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="100,73 106,50 140,35 198,35 225,50 235,71 227,96 204,108 167,115 127,108 104,96">
       <p>TAMTIE DVERE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/16.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,445 323,445 323,584 18,584" type="commentary">
       <p>HE HEARD THE HUM OF THE HI-RES TOMOGRAPHY WEAPON-SCAN ON HIS LOW FREQUENCY AUDIO RECEPTORS. THEY'D BE EXPECTING HIM TO BE ARMED - THEY'D BE SUSPICIOUS IF HE WASN'T. BUT AS LONG AS HE WASN'T CARRYING ANYTHING THAT COULD START A WAR, THEY'D LET HIM IN.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,445 323,445 323,584 18,584" type="commentary">
       <p>ZAČUL BZUKOT VYSOKOROZLIŠOVACIEHO TOMOGRAFICKÉHO SKENERA ZBRANÍ SVOJIMI NIZKOFREKVENČNÝMI AUDIO RECEPTORMI. OČAKÁVALI, ŽE BUDE OZBROJENÝ - BOLI BY PODOZRIEVAVÍ, AK BY NEBOL. ALE POKIAĽ NEMAL SO SEBOU NIČ, ČO BY MOHLO ZAČAŤ VOJNU, PUSTILI HO DOVNÚTRA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/17.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/18.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="344,46 354,25 390,15 448,13 483,27 492,46 483,67 450,79 415,83 377,79 352,69">
       <p>GET IN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="404,435 602,433 602,477 406,479" type="commentary">
       <p>GET IN WHAT?</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="344,46 354,25 390,15 448,13 483,27 492,46 483,67 450,79 415,83 377,79 352,69">
       <p>CHOĎ DNU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="404,435 602,433 602,477 406,479" type="commentary">
       <p>DNU KAM?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/19.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="94,30 103,15 130,3 268,3 291,11 303,29 298,46 274,60 238,65 185,68 136,63 101,49">
       <p>VOICEPRINT IDENTIFY. CLEARANCE B. LEVEL 4.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="16,474 320,476 319,570 16,570" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS FELT HIS STOMACH LEAP. THEY WERE IN AN ELEVATOR. GOING DOWN. UNDERWATER. THIS WAS AN OUTLIER IN THE PROBABILITY SPACE HE HAD NOT PREVIOUSLY CONSIDERED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="94,30 103,15 130,3 268,3 291,11 303,29 298,46 274,60 238,65 185,68 136,63 101,49">
       <p>HLASOVÝ IDENTIFIKÁTOR. POVOLENIE B. ÚROVEŇ 4.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="16,474 320,476 319,570 16,570" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS ZACÍTIL AKO JEHO ŽALÚDOK POSKOČIL. BOLI VO VÝŤAHU. SMEROM NADOL. POD VODNÚ HLADINU. TOTO BOLA VEC, S KTOROU VO SVOJICH ÚVAHÁCH O PRAVDEPODOBNOSTI ÚSPECHU MISIE NERÁTAL.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/20.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="23,25 963,23 963,108 25,110" type="commentary">
       <p>AT LEAST HE COULD RULE OUT IMMEDIATE DANGER. HIS BRAINWAVE SCANNERS AND PHEROMONE SENSORS WERE READING NEGATIVE ON THESE STOOGES. THEY WEREN'T KEYED UP.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="521,481 977,481 977,546 521,548" type="commentary">
       <p>ODDS HE'D HAVE TO KICK THEIR FUCKING TEETH IN: 3.8%.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="23,25 963,23 963,108 25,110" type="commentary">
       <p>ASPOŇ, ŽE MOHOL VYLÚČIŤ BEZPROSTREDNÉ NEBEZPEČENSTVO. JEHO SKENER MOZGOVÝCH VĹN A FEROMÓNOVÉ SENZORY NEINDIKOVALI PROBLÉM OHĽADOM TÝCHTO TÝPKOV. NEBOLI ROZRUŠENÍ.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="521,481 977,481 977,546 521,548" type="commentary">
       <p>PRAVDEPODOBNOSŤ, ŽE IM BUDE MUSIEŤ ROZBIŤ DRŽKU: 3.8%.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/21.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="2,73 6,40 35,17 79,6 129,4 192,8 235,23 256,48 260,69 256,94 240,115 213,127 152,135 75,133 29,121 6,100">
       <p>THIS IS YOUR STOP. LADIES LINGERIE, DESIGNER DRUGS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="663,46 669,27 696,17 723,15 752,19 773,29 777,48 771,67 748,81 702,81 675,73 665,58">
       <p>HEH.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="2,73 6,40 35,17 79,6 129,4 192,8 235,23 256,48 260,69 256,94 240,115 213,127 152,135 75,133 29,121 6,100">
       <p>TU JE TVOJA ZASTÁVKA. DÁMSKE PRÁDLO A DIZAJNÉRSKE DROGY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="663,46 669,27 696,17 723,15 752,19 773,29 777,48 771,67 748,81 702,81 675,73 665,58">
       <p>HEH.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/22.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="23,436 318,436 318,533 23,533" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS FELT THE FAMILIAR PRICKLE OF ANTI-BACTERIAL NANOBOTS ON HIS SKIN - STERILIZING HIM FROM HEAD TO TOE. THIS WAS THE KIND OF TREATMENT YOU USUALLY GOT AT A MOD SHOP, NOT A DRUG LAB.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="23,436 318,436 318,533 23,533" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS POCÍTIL ZNÁME MRAVČENIE ANTI-BAKTERIÁLNYCH NANOBOTOV NA SVOJEJ KOŽI - STERILUJÚC HO OD HLAVY PO PÄTY. TOTO BOLO ZAOBCHÁDZANIE, KTORÉ ČLOVEK ZVYČAJNE DOSTANE V MOD OBCHODOCH, NIE V DROGOVOM LABÁKU.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/23.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="59,14 315,14 315,51 59,51" type="commentary">
       <p>IT TOOK HIM A SECOND TO RECOGNIZE WHERE HE WAS ...</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="59,14 315,14 315,51 59,51" type="commentary">
       <p>TRVALO MU LEN CHVÍĽU NEŽ ZISTIL, KDE SA NACHÁDZA ...</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/24.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="44,40 846,42 848,127 44,127" type="commentary">
       <p>... AN UNCOLLAPSED SECTION OF THE HOLLAND TUNNEL. CARS USED TO DRIVE THROUGH HERE, BACK AND FORTH FROM MANHATTAN TO NEW JERSEY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="44,40 846,42 848,127 44,127" type="commentary">
       <p>... ZACHOVALÁ SEKCIA HOLLANDOVHO TUNELA. AUTÁ TADIAĽTO V MINULOSTI JAZDIEVALI MEDZI MANHATTANOM A NEW JERSEY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/25.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="18,16 210,16 173,124 168,254 154,309 16,309" type="commentary">
       <p>THIS WAS ALL SUPPOSED TO HAVE BEEN DESTROYED IN '54. HE'D NEVER HEARD ANYTHING ABOUT PARTS OF THE TUNNELS SURVIVING THE TSUNAMI. AND HE'D BEEN AROUND THE BLOCK A FEW TIMES. WHOEVER WAS BEHIND THIS OPERATION HAD DONE A DAMN GOOD JOB OF KEEPING IT SECRET.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="18,533 274,533 274,588 16,588">
       <p>JULIUS WASN'T A FAN OF SECRETS. THEY MADE IT HARDER TO GROK THE ODDS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="18,16 210,16 173,124 168,254 154,309 16,309" type="commentary">
       <p>TOTO VŠETKO MALO BYŤ ZNIČENÉ V 54.-TOM. NIKDY NEPOČUL O TOM, ŽE BY NEJAKÉ ČASTI TUNELA PREŽILI VLNY TSUNAMI. A TO TU NA OKOLÍ BOL UŽ NIEKOĽKOKRÁT. KTOKOĽVEK STÁL ZA TOUTO OPERÁCIOU, VYNALOŽIL POMERNE VEĽKÉ ÚSILIE, ABY VŠETKO ZOSTALO V UTAJENÍ.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="18,533 274,533 274,588 16,588">
       <p>JULIUS NEBOL FANÚŠIKOM TAJOMSTIEV. KOMPLIKOVALO MU TO PREDPOVEDE PRAVDEPODOBNOSTÍ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/26.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="35,42 517,42 517,338 33,338" type="commentary">
       <p>THIS GUY WAS A SERIOUS COOKER - THEY ALL LOOKED THE SAME. THE EYES ALLOWED THEM TO DO MICROSCOPIC WORK WITHOUT THE MICROSCOPES, AND THE MESS OF TUBES AND VENTILATORS LET THEM OPERATE IN TOXIC ENVIRONMENTS WITHOUT RESPIRATORS. HE'D SEEN IT A MILLION TIMES, BUT IT STILL GAVE HIM THE CREEPS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="35,42 517,42 517,338 33,338" type="commentary">
       <p>TENTO TÝPEK BOL SKUTOČNÝ VÝROBCA DROG - VŠETCI VYZERALI ROVNAKO. ICH OČI IM UMOŽNOVALI ROBIŤ MIKROSKOPICKÚ PRÁCU BEZ MIKROSKOPOV, A ZHLUK TRUBÍC A VENTILÁTOROV IM UMOŽNOVAL PRACOVAŤ V TOXICKOM PROSTREDÍ BEZ RESPIRÁTOROV. VIDEL TO UŽ MILIÓNKRÁT, ALE VŽDY HO TO ROZRUŠILO.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/27.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="600,44 610,31 838,31 852,44 854,110 842,119 613,121 600,110">
       <p>I TRUST YOU WILL FIND EVERYTHING IS IN ORDER.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="600,44 610,31 838,31 852,44 854,110 842,119 613,121 600,110">
       <p>DÚFAM, ŽE SA TI BUDE ZDAŤ VŠETKO V PORIADKU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/28.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="508,117 515,88 550,63 606,54 673,65 700,81 710,104 708,135 690,160 642,175 575,175 525,158 510,131">
       <p>WHAT'S WITH THE BOMB-PROOF CASE?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="573,235 596,215 954,217 971,238 973,454 954,481 590,481 571,458">
       <p>THE CASE CONTAINS THE LIQUID NITROGEN COOLING SYSTEM DESIGNED TO STABILIZE THE SPECIMENS FOR UP TO TWELVE HOURS. IT IS ALSO SHOCK-RESISTANT AND AIR-TIGHT. NONETHELESS, I RECOMMEND YOU HANDLE IT WITH EXTREME CARE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="508,117 515,88 550,63 606,54 673,65 700,81 710,104 708,135 690,160 642,175 575,175 525,158 510,131">
       <p>HMM, PREČO VÝBUŠNINÁM ODOLNÝ KUFOR?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="573,235 596,215 954,217 971,238 973,454 954,481 590,481 571,458">
       <p>KUFOR OBSAHUJE SYSTÉM CHLADENÝ TEKUTÝM DUSÍKOM NAVRHNUTÝ NA STABILIZOVANIE VZORIEK PO DOBU DVANÁSTICH HODÍN. JE TAKTIEŽ ODOLNÝ VOČI OTRASOM A JE VZDUCHOTESNÝ. NAPRIEK TOMU, ODPORÚČAM S NÍM MANIPULOVAŤ S EXTRÉMNOU OPATRNOSŤOU.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/29.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="50,35 65,19 333,19 350,38 348,108 338,123 69,125 50,113">
       <p>THE CLOCK IS RUNNING. I SUGGEST YOU GET MOVING.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="50,35 65,19 333,19 350,38 348,108 338,123 69,125 50,113">
       <p>ČAS BEŽÍ. NAVRHUJEM, ABY STE VYRAZILI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/30.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,44 423,44 423,513 29,513" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE <emphasis>SITREP</emphasis> ON THIS DEAL WAS OFFICIALLY FUCKED. JULIUS HAD NEVER SEEN M-SERIES DRUGS LEAVE A LAB IN LIQUID FORM, LET ALONE IN VIALS THAT NEEDED COOLING. SOMETHING WAS TOTALLY WRONG, BUT AT THIS POINT THERE WAS NO CHOICE BUT TO GO WITH THE FLOW. IF HE DITCHED OUT NOW, WHATEVER CRIME BOSS HAD ORDERED THIS PACKAGE WOULD CANCEL HIM AND EVERYONE HE'D EVER MET.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,44 423,44 423,513 29,513" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p><emphasis>SITUAČNÁ SPRÁVÁ</emphasis> OHĽADOM TEJTO AKCIE BOLA OFICIÁLNE V HAJZLI. JULIUS NIKDY NEVIDEL DROGY SÉRIE M OPÚŠŤAŤ LABÁK V KVAPALNEJ FORME A UŽ VÔBEC NIE V CHLADENÝCH AMPULKÁCH. NIEČO BOLO V NEPORIADKU, ALE V TOMTO BODE NEBOLA INÁ MOŽNOSŤ AKO POKRAČOVAŤ V PLÁNE. KEBY SA NA TO TERAZ VYKAŠĽAL, JE JEDNO AKÝ ZLOČINECKÝ BOSS SI TENTO BALÍK OBJEDNAL, ODPRÁSKOL BY HO SPOLU S KAŽDÝM S KÝM SA KEDY STRETOL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/31.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,67 23,42 38,23 69,10 125,6 185,10 219,25 233,56 229,90 204,113 152,125 85,123 42,110 21,85">
       <p>I THOUGHT I SAID TO KEEP THE ENGINES WARM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="754,65 763,42 794,27 852,21 915,27 942,44 948,67 942,88 917,104 879,113 819,113 779,102 758,85">
       <p>YOU TOOK A LONG TIME.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,67 23,42 38,23 69,10 125,6 185,10 219,25 233,56 229,90 204,113 152,125 85,123 42,110 21,85">
       <p>NEPOVEDAL SOM TI, ŽE MÁŠ MOTOR NECHAŤ BEŽAŤ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="754,65 763,42 794,27 852,21 915,27 942,44 948,67 942,88 917,104 879,113 819,113 779,102 758,85">
       <p>TRVALO TI TO NEJAK DLHO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/32.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="65,78 323,79 323,119 66,119" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS COULD TELL IT WAS GOING TO BE A ROUGH NIGHT.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="14,460 294,460 299,483 309,514 304,538 304,581 15,581" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE DRIVER WAS TOTALLY BEADED-UP. HIS RHYTMIC BETA WAS OF THE <emphasis>EEG</emphasis> CHARTS, AND HE WAS PUMPING OUT FEAR-FACTOR PHEROMONES SO HARD THAT THE SMELL OF IT RUNNING OVER JULIUS'S TWEAKED-OUT OLFACTORY CILIA MADE HIM WANT TO WOMIT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="65,78 323,79 323,119 66,119" type="commentary">
       <p>JULIUS VEDEL, ŽE TOTO BUDE EŠTE ŤAŽKÁ NOC.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="14,460 294,460 299,483 309,514 304,538 304,581 15,581" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PILOT BOL TOTÁLNE ROZRUŠENÝ. JEHO RYTMICKÉ BETA BOLO MIMO <emphasis>EEG</emphasis> GRAFOV, A PUMPOVAL DO OKOLIA FEROMÓNY STRACHU TAK SILNO, ŽE ICH PACH PRÚDIACI OKOLO JULIUSOVÝCH MODIFIKOVANÝCH ČUCHOVÝCH RECEPTOROV HO NAPÍNAL K ZVRACANIU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/33.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="700,33 890,33 913,96 910,100 717,102" type="code">
       <p>AUTOPILOT ENGAGED</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="700,33 890,33 913,96 910,100 717,102" type="code">
       <p>AUTOPILOT ZAPNUTÝ</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/34.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,65 350,65 350,142 288,175 256,242 296,308 375,308 375,477 31,477" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ENHANCED SENSORY AWARNESS IS A DIRECT RESULT OF THE EFFECTS OF MAGNIFIED ADRENALINE THROUGHPUT ON THE FIRING RATES OF SELECTED SYNAPSES WORKING VIA CENTRAL FEEDBACK CIRCUITS TO INCREASE THE SENSITIVITY OF CHRONICALLY STIMULATED NEURONS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,65 350,65 350,142 288,175 256,242 296,308 375,308 375,477 31,477" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>VYLEPŠENÁ CITLIVOSŤ SENZOROV JE PRIAMYM DÔSLEDKOM ZVÝŠENEJ ADRENALÍNOVEJ PRIECHODNOSTI CEZ VYBRANÉ NERVOVÉ ZAKONČENIA, KTORÁ FUNGUJE CEZ CENTRÁLNE VEDENIA ODOZIEV NA ZVÝŠENIE SENZITIVITY CHRONICKY STIMULOVANÝCH NEURÓNOV.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/35.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="29,38 308,38 308,102 29,102" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THAT WAS THE SCIENCE SHIT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="29,38 308,38 308,102 29,102" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>TO BOLO VEDECKÉ VYSVETLENIE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/36.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,27 317,27 317,138 29,138" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>BREAK IT DOWN AND HERE'S WHAT IT MEANS: TIME SLOWS DOWN FOR JULIUS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="29,154 298,154 298,221 29,221" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>EVERYTHING IS IN FOCUS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="29,231 298,231 298,385 29,385" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE PILOT RAISES HIS BLADE AND JULIUS CAN HEAR THE WHISPER OF AIR BEING SLICED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,27 317,27 317,138 29,138" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>V ĽUDSKEJ REČI TO ZNAMENALO JEDINÉ: ČAS PRE JULIUSA SPOMAĽUJE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="29,154 298,154 298,221 29,221" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>VŠETKO JE ZAOSTRENÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="29,231 298,231 298,385 29,385" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PILOT VYŤAHUJE SVOJU ČEPEĽ A JULIUS POČUJE SVIŠŤANIE KRÁJANÉHO VZDUCHU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/37.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,35 350,38 352,73 29,73" type="commentary">
       <p>HE SEES EVERYTHING.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="350,273 673,273 675,381 350,381" type="commentary">
       <p>EVERY MUSCLE TWITCH, EVERY EYE MOVEMENT, EVERY DILATATION OF THE NOSTRIL.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="619,452 977,452 977,542 621,544" type="commentary">
       <p>IT'S ALL DATA: FILTERED, COMPRESSED, PROCESSED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,35 350,38 352,73 29,73" type="commentary">
       <p>VIDÍ VŠETKO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="350,273 673,273 675,381 350,381" type="commentary">
       <p>KAŽDÝ POHYB SVALU, KAŽDÝ POHYB OKA, KAŽDÉ ROZŠÍRENIE NOZDIER.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="619,452 977,452 977,542 621,544" type="commentary">
       <p>SÚ TO VŠETKO DÁTA: FILTROVANÉ, ZHUSTENÉ, SPRACOVANÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/38.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="35,98 490,98 490,135 38,135" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>AND IT TELLS HIM WHAT TO DO.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="92,283 498,283 500,323 92,325" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHIFT YOUR WEIGHT THIS WAY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="35,98 490,98 490,135 38,135" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>A TO MU HOVORÍ, ČO ROBIŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="92,283 498,283 500,323 92,325" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PRENES SVOJU VÁHU TÝMTO SMEROM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/39.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="71,71 190,69 194,108 71,110" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>DUCK.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="71,71 190,69 194,108 71,110" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ČUPNI SI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/40.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 2/41.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 2/42.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="18,18 98,16 99,43 16,43" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>BLOCK.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="18,18 98,16 99,43 16,43" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ZABLOKUJ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 2/43.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="18,18 86,16 88,41 18,43" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SWING.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="18,18 86,16 88,41 18,43" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>ŠVIHNI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 2/44.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 2/45.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="42,38 131,38 131,69 44,69" type="commentary">
       <p>KILL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="42,38 131,38 131,69 44,69" type="commentary">
       <p>ZABI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
