      <image href="Issue 2/52.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="273,212 750,212 750,278 272,278" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>TO BE CONTINUED</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="273,212 750,212 750,278 272,278" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>POKRAČOVANIE NABUDÚCE</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 3</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 3</title>
      <image href="Issue 3/01.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,373 581,373 581,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>ISSUE 3</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,373 581,373 581,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>KAPITOLA 3</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/02.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,69 40,56 344,54 356,69 358,142 344,158 42,158 27,144" type="code">
       <p>PEDESTRIAN REQUESTS ENTRANCE. GROUND LEVEL.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="423,144 433,127 469,115 510,113 558,115 588,125 598,142 596,158 585,167 544,179 510,179 473,177 440,171 427,158">
       <p>LET HIM IN.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,69 40,56 344,54 356,69 358,142 344,158 42,158 27,144" type="code">
       <p>VCHOD PRE PEŠÍCH - PRÍZEMIE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="423,144 433,127 469,115 510,113 558,115 588,125 598,142 596,158 585,167 544,179 510,179 473,177 440,171 427,158">
       <p>PUSŤTE HO DNU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/03.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="6,60 13,38 44,19 94,10 160,10 213,23 238,44 238,71 219,94 177,106 117,108 65,106 25,94 8,73">
       <p>YOU LOOK LIKE A MILLION BUCKS, JAKE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="398,154 402,135 425,115 465,106 525,104 571,115 594,131 600,154 594,179 577,194 546,204 498,206 448,202 419,192 400,173">
       <p>SCREW YOU. GOT ANY SPEED?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="360,473 367,442 390,415 448,396 506,398 552,406 579,425 592,452 596,473 590,506 573,527 542,544 502,552 448,552 408,542 379,525 365,498">
       <p>HAVE A SEAT AND LISTEN UP. WE'RE ALREADY BEHIND SCHEDULE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="6,60 13,38 44,19 94,10 160,10 213,23 238,44 238,71 219,94 177,106 117,108 65,106 25,94 8,73">
       <p>VYZERÁŠ NAOZAJ VÝBORNE, JAKE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="398,154 402,135 425,115 465,106 525,104 571,115 594,131 600,154 594,179 577,194 546,204 498,206 448,202 419,192 400,173">
       <p>ALE CHOĎ. MÁŠ NEJAKÝ SPEED?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="360,473 367,442 390,415 448,396 506,398 552,406 579,425 592,452 596,473 590,506 573,527 542,544 502,552 448,552 408,542 379,525 365,498">
       <p>SADNI SI A POČÚVAJ. UŽ KVÔLI TEBE MEŠKÁME.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/04.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="544,40 550,17 571,4 658,2 679,13 690,29 690,48 677,67 650,77 623,81 581,77 556,65 544,52">
       <p>WHERE'S JULIUS?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="656,110 656,92 667,81 688,69 700,56 754,46 829,44 877,52 913,65 929,90 931,115 917,138 881,156 835,163 763,165 710,156 679,144 663,127">
       <p>THAT'S THE 64 FUCKING THOUSAND DOLLAR QUESTION.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="544,40 550,17 571,4 658,2 679,13 690,29 690,48 677,67 650,77 623,81 581,77 556,65 544,52">
       <p>KDE JE JULIUS?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="656,110 656,92 667,81 688,69 700,56 754,46 829,44 877,52 913,65 929,90 931,115 917,138 881,156 835,163 763,165 710,156 679,144 663,127">
       <p>TO JE OTÁZKA ZA SKURVENÝCH 64 TISÍC DOLÁROV.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/05.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="52,115 58,85 77,65 119,46 169,35 254,38 317,52 354,77 365,108 360,140 338,169 298,188 244,196 169,194 119,188 81,173 58,146">
       <p>HE'S ON A PICK-UP / DROP OFF, AND THAT'S ALREADY MORE THAN YOU NEED TO KNOW.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="52,115 58,85 77,65 119,46 169,35 254,38 317,52 354,77 365,108 360,140 338,169 298,188 244,196 169,194 119,188 81,173 58,146">
       <p>JE NA INEJ MISII, A TO UŽ JE VIAC NEŽ POTREBUJEŠ VEDIEŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/06.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="10,81 19,48 52,21 100,10 173,13 213,29 235,58 238,98 225,123 196,144 154,154 88,154 46,144 15,115">
       <p>SO WHO'S DOING THE LEGWORK? YOU FIND NEW MUSCLE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="421,33 433,10 452,2 619,4 640,19 644,35 638,54 610,73 556,79 485,77 440,65 423,50">
       <p>YOU'RE DOING THE LEGWORK.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="806,48 819,25 856,10 921,10 956,19 977,38 979,60 960,81 927,90 879,94 838,88 815,71">
       <p>THE FUCK I AM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="10,81 19,48 52,21 100,10 173,13 213,29 235,58 238,98 225,123 196,144 154,154 88,154 46,144 15,115">
       <p>TAKŽE ROBÍ PEŠIAKA? NAŠIEL SI SI NOVÉHO POSKOKA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="421,33 433,10 452,2 619,4 640,19 644,35 638,54 610,73 556,79 485,77 440,65 423,50">
       <p>TY ROBÍŠ PEŠIAKA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="806,48 819,25 856,10 921,10 956,19 977,38 979,60 960,81 927,90 879,94 838,88 815,71">
       <p>TAK TO KURVA HEJ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/07.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="4,208 4,102 31,48 75,4 340,4 383,42 417,104 425,165 429,229 417,302 388,367 331,415 298,431 246,438 158,435 104,423 58,392 17,340 4,296">
       <p>YEAH, THE FUCK YOU ARE. WE HAND THIS THING OFF TONIGHT OR WE DON'T GET PAID. AND YOU NEED TO GET PAID, MOTHERFUCKER, BECAUSE I'M GUESSING LANEY'S GOT A POCKETFUL OF <emphasis>MG</emphasis> PATCHES THAT YOU BOUGHT ON MY DIME. YOU CAN DO THE LEGWORK ON THIS JOB AND PAY ME BACK, OR I CAN REPO YOUR MOTO AND WHATEVER OTHER TRASH YOU OWN TO SQUARE THINGS UP. SO ARE WE STRAIGHT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="308,504 319,479 356,454 413,444 506,446 563,458 592,481 600,508 590,535 567,552 531,565 375,565 340,554 319,533 310,519">
       <p>YEAH, WE'RE STRAIGHT. BUT I WANT THE PATCHES NOW. ALL OF 'EM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="4,208 4,102 31,48 75,4 340,4 383,42 417,104 425,165 429,229 417,302 388,367 331,415 298,431 246,438 158,435 104,423 58,392 17,340 4,296">
       <p>TAK TO FAKT, ŽE HEJ. BUĎ DNES V NOCI TÚ VEC ODOVZDÁME ALEBO NEDOSTANEME ZAPLATENÉ. A TY POTREBUJEŠ MAŤ ZAPLATENÉ, TY PARCHANT, PRETOŽE TIPUJEM, ŽE LANEY MÁ PLNO <emphasis>MG</emphasis> NÁPLASTÍ, KTORÉ SI DOSTAL NA MÔJ ÚČET. PO DOKONČENÍ TOHTO DŽOBU MI TO BUĎ SPLATÍŠ, ALEBO STRELÍM TVOJU KÁRU A VŠETOK ĎALŠÍ ŠROT ČO EŠTE VLASTNÍŠ. ROZUMIEME SI?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="308,504 319,479 356,454 413,444 506,446 563,458 592,481 600,508 590,535 567,552 531,565 375,565 340,554 319,533 310,519">
       <p>JASNE, ŽIADEN PROBLÉM. ALE NÁPLASTE CHCEM TERAZ. VŠETKY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/08.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/09.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="0,271 4,156 35,71 73,29 131,6 219,4 279,35 315,81 335,142 346,227 346,333 333,396 317,442 275,488 213,513 144,513 88,498 44,463 8,396 0,340">
       <p>THE JOB IS EASY. INFILTRATE AND EXTRACT. OUR CLIENT IS AN OFF-ISLAND COLLECTOR OF RARE ANIMALS. A GENE SAMPLER. HIGH-END CLONER AND CUSTOM ORGANISM DESIGNER. AND IT JUST SO HAPPENS THAT SOME NORTH GOTHAM MAFIA WARLORD HAS A LITTLE COLLECTION OF HIS OWN THAT CONTAINS SOMETHING OUR CLIENT WANTS.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="529,54 538,33 573,19 631,13 704,17 740,29 752,52 748,71 729,88 679,98 606,98 560,90 533,73">
       <p>THE SQUIRREL.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="0,271 4,156 35,71 73,29 131,6 219,4 279,35 315,81 335,142 346,227 346,333 333,396 317,442 275,488 213,513 144,513 88,498 44,463 8,396 0,340">
       <p>ÚLOHA JE JEDNODUCHÁ. INFILTROVAŤ SA A ODNIESŤ. NÁŠ KLIENT JE ZBERATEĽ VZÁCNYCH ZVIERAT. GÉNOVÝ ODOBERAČ VZORIEK. HIGH-END KLONOVAČ A DIZAJNÉR UMELÝCH ORGANIZMOV. A AKOBY NÁHODOU NEJAKÝ MAFIÁNSKY BOSS ZO SEVERNÉHO GOTHAMU MÁ MALÚ KOLEKCIU NIEČOHO, ČO NÁŠ ZÁKAZNÍK ZROVNA POTREBUJE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="529,54 538,33 573,19 631,13 704,17 740,29 752,52 748,71 729,88 679,98 606,98 560,90 533,73">
       <p>VEVERIČKU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/10.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="392,113 402,63 429,25 469,4 817,2 867,31 892,75 896,125 881,165 846,198 779,223 696,235 596,238 510,225 448,204 404,165">
       <p>MORE SPECIFICALLY, A NORTH AMERICAN GRAY SQUIRREL, OFICIALLY EXTINCT. THERE ARE ONLY SEVEN OR EIGHT LEFT IN PRIVATE COLLECTIONS. ONE OF THEM HAPPENS TO BE JUST UP THE STREET FROM US. IN <emphasis>NOGO,</emphasis> AT 125<sup>TH</sup> AND LEX.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="833,290 827,265 835,235 869,213 944,210 983,223 998,246 998,279 990,290 954,308 892,313 850,304">
       <p>THAT'S ABOVE THE MOTO GRID.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="623,471 631,425 663,388 719,367 796,360 881,367 938,388 963,417 973,454 973,488 963,515 938,542 890,563 708,563 658,542 635,519 625,490">
       <p>YOUR MOTO'S STILL GOT WHEELS AIN'T IT? YOU'LL HAVE TO DROP OFF THE GRID AT 110<sup>TH</sup> AND TAKE THE SURFACE STREETS THE REST OF THE WAY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="392,113 402,63 429,25 469,4 817,2 867,31 892,75 896,125 881,165 846,198 779,223 696,235 596,238 510,225 448,204 404,165">
       <p>ŠPECIFICKEJŠIE, SEVEROAMERICKÚ ŠEDÚ VEVERIČKU, OFICIÁLNE VYHYNUTÚ. EXISTUJE ICH UŽ LEN SEDEM ALEBO OSEM V PRIVÁTNYCH ZBIERKACH. JEDNA Z NICH SA NACHÁDZA ZROVNA NEĎALEKO OD NÁS. V <emphasis>ZAKÁZANEJ ZÓNE,</emphasis> NA 125-TEJ A LEX.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="833,290 827,265 835,235 869,213 944,210 983,223 998,246 998,279 990,290 954,308 892,313 850,304">
       <p>TO JE NAD MOTO-GRIDOM.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="623,471 631,425 663,388 719,367 796,360 881,367 938,388 963,417 973,454 973,488 963,515 938,542 890,563 708,563 658,542 635,519 625,490">
       <p>TVOJE AUTO MÁ STÁLE KOLESÁ, NIE? BUDETE SA MUSIEŤ ODPOJIŤ Z GRIDU NA 110-TEJ A ÍSŤ ĎALEJ NA POVRCHU PO ZVYŠOK CESTY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/11.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="113,48 123,19 138,2 275,0 294,21 298,44 294,75 273,96 248,106 200,108 163,104 125,85 113,65">
       <p>FUCK THAT. I'LL DO THE WI-FI FROM HERE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="0,244 6,183 25,148 58,123 123,110 152,113 177,117 208,119 246,142 273,175 281,225 285,275 275,321 258,356 223,381 190,392 154,396 100,396 63,383 27,356 4,319">
       <p>NO YOU WON'T. YOU'LL BE IN THE DAMN MOTO WHILE JAKE IS INSIDE - OTHERWISE IT'LL BE STRIPPED BARE IN THE TWO MINUTES IT TAKES HIM TO GET IN AND OUT.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="638,35 979,33 975,250 638,254" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>WAGNER WAS RIGHT. WHETHER SHE WANTED TO OR NOT, SHE'D HAVE TO HACK INTO THIS MOBSTER'S NETWORK WHILE SITTING IN A PARKED MOTO RIGHT OUTSIDE HIS DOOR.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="635,315 973,313 977,527 640,533" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>LANEY PREFERRED TO STEAL STUFF FROM RICH PEOPLE IN NEW JERSEY - IT WAS A HELL OF A LOT SAFER. BUT IT'S NOT LIKE YOU EVER HAD A CHOICE ABOUT IT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="113,48 123,19 138,2 275,0 294,21 298,44 294,75 273,96 248,106 200,108 163,104 125,85 113,65">
       <p>SEREM NA TO. POJDEM CEZ WI-FI ODTIAĽTO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="0,244 6,183 25,148 58,123 123,110 152,113 177,117 208,119 246,142 273,175 281,225 285,275 275,321 258,356 223,381 190,392 154,396 100,396 63,383 27,356 4,319">
       <p>NIE, NEPÔJDEŠ. BUDEŠ V AUTE, ZATIAĽ ČO JAKE BUDE VO VNÚTRI - INAK TO NEBUDE MOŽNÉ HO ZA DVE MINÚTY DOSTAŤ DOVNÚTRA A VON.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="638,35 979,33 975,250 638,254" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>WAGNER MAL PRAVDU. ČI CHCELA ALEBO NIE, BUDE SA MUSIEŤ NABÚRAŤ DO MAFIÁNOVEJ SIETE, KEĎ BUDE SEDIEŤ V AUTE ZAPARKOVANOM HNEĎ VEDĽA JEHO DVERÍ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="635,315 973,313 977,527 640,533" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>LANEY MALA RADŠEJ OKRÁDANIE BOHATÝCH ĽUDÍ V NEW JERSEY - BOLO TO KURVA BEZPEČNEJŠIE. TO ALE NEZNAMENALO, ŽE BY MALA TERAZ NEJAKO NA VÝBER.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/12.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="10,60 19,29 44,8 65,0 192,2 225,23 238,48 238,83 215,108 175,125 100,127 48,117 19,94">
       <p>THE SQUIRREL IS IN CAGE 143. YOU CAN'T MISS IT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="467,146 471,123 498,100 542,90 635,85 690,98 719,123 723,146 713,173 677,196 640,202 552,204 498,190 473,169">
       <p>PAPER. HOW QUAINT. YOU WRITE THIS ON HERE YOURSELF?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="494,356 498,340 519,323 550,317 623,317 660,329 677,346 675,371 654,388 615,396 554,396 515,388 498,373">
       <p>JUST DON'T FUCK IT UP.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="10,60 19,29 44,8 65,0 192,2 225,23 238,48 238,83 215,108 175,125 100,127 48,117 19,94">
       <p>VEVERIČKA JE V KLIETKE 143. NEMÔŽETE JU MINÚŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="467,146 471,123 498,100 542,90 635,85 690,98 719,123 723,146 713,173 677,196 640,202 552,204 498,190 473,169">
       <p>HMM, PAPIER. AKÉ RETRO. NAPÍSAL SI TO TAM SÁM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="494,356 498,340 519,323 550,317 623,317 660,329 677,346 675,371 654,388 615,396 554,396 515,388 498,373">
       <p>LEN TO NEDOSERTE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/13.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="88,69 410,71 408,165 92,165" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>JAKE'S MOTO WAS A '98 SKODA, OR AT LEAST IT USED TO BE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="56,290 377,292 381,502 67,508" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>NOT ONLY WERE MOST OF THE MECHANICAL MODS ILLEGAL UNDER NYC LAW, BUT THE WHOLE THING WAS RUNNING <emphasis>LINUX</emphasis> - A FEDERAL OFFENSE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="88,69 410,71 408,165 92,165" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>JAKEOVO AUTO BOLA ŠKODA Z 98-HO, ALEBO TAK ASPOŇ VYZERALA.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="56,290 377,292 381,502 67,508" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>NIELENŽE BOLI VŠETKY TIE MODIFIKÁCIE V NYC NELEGÁLNE, ALE CELÁ TÁ VEC BEŽALA NA <emphasis>LINUXE</emphasis> - A TO JE FEDERÁLNY ZLOČIN.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/14.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="54,437 945,437 945,521 54,521" type="commentary"><p>BUT ALL SERIOUS DRIVERS RAN SOME FLAVOR OF OPEN SOURCE <emphasis>OS</emphasis>, BECAUSE LIKE EVERY OTHER MICROSOFT PRODUCT, WINDOWS MOTO EDITION WAS A PIECE OF SHIT.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="54,437 945,437 945,521 54,521" type="commentary"><p>V PODSTATE ALE VŠETCI SERIÓZNI VODIČI MALI NEJAKÝ DRUH SLOBODNÉHO <emphasis>OPERAČNÉHO SYSTÉMU</emphasis>, PRETOŽE TAK AKO KAŽDÝ MICROSOFT PRODUKT, WINDOWS MOTO EDITION BOL OBYČAJNÝ KUS HOVNA.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/15.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/16.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/17.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/18.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/19.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/20.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/21.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 3/22.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/23.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/24.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="92,92 108,63 150,40 215,31 298,38 342,58 360,88 354,119 333,142 273,154 183,154 123,142 94,115">
       <p>JESUS. YOU ARE NOT GOING TO DO THIS JOB ON SMACK.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="483,4 754,6 783,23 794,56 781,83 750,106 692,119 581,123 508,115 460,90 448,56 452,31 475,8">
       <p>MY MOTO, MY RULES. THERE'S NO WAY IN HELL I CAN DRIVE SURFACE STREETS SOBER.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="25,452 975,454 977,544 21,546" type="commentary">
       <p>HE TOOK A DEEP BREATH AND WAITED FOR THE INITIAL HIT. HE ALWAYS LIKED TO SAY THAT THE KICK AT THE BEGINNING WAS LIKE GETTING WHACKED IN THE HEAD WITH A BASEBALL BAT, BUT IN A GOOD WAY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="92,92 108,63 150,40 215,31 298,38 342,58 360,88 354,119 333,142 273,154 183,154 123,142 94,115">
       <p>JEŽIŠI. TY CHCEŠ SNÁĎ ROBIŤ TENTO DŽOB NA DROGÁCH?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="483,4 754,6 783,23 794,56 781,83 750,106 692,119 581,123 508,115 460,90 448,56 452,31 475,8">
       <p>MOJE AUTO, MOJE PRAVIDLÁ. ANI NÁHODOU NEBUDEM JAZDIŤ PO ULICIACH NA POVRCHU TRIEZVY.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="25,452 975,454 977,544 21,546" type="commentary">
       <p>ZHLBOKA SA NADÝCHOL A ČAKAL NA ÚVODNÝ HIT. VŽDY RÁD VRAVIEVAL, ŽE POČIATOČNÝ HIT BOL AKO KEĎ ČLOVEK DOSTANE BEJZBOLKOU PO HLAVE, ALE V DOBROM ZMYSLE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/25.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="21,23 733,21 733,83 21,88" type="commentary">
       <p>HE STEPPED ON THE THROTTLE AND THE MOTO ACCELERATED TO 150 <emphasis>KPH</emphasis> IN LESS THAN A BLOCK.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="23,438 967,440 967,544 25,548" type="commentary">
       <p>ON HER LEFT LANEY CAUGHT GLIMPSES OF THE FARMING OUTPOSTS IN CENTRAL PARK: FIELDS OF CORN AND SOYBEANS SURROUNDED BY RAZOR WIRE AND TENT VILLAGES. IN TWO MORE SECONDS THEY WERE PAST THE PARK, AND JAKE WAS DECELERATING TOWARDS 110<sup>TH</sup>.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="21,23 733,21 733,83 21,88" type="commentary">
       <p>ŠLIAPOL NA PLYN A AUTO ZRÝCHLILO NA 150 <emphasis>KM/H</emphasis> ZA MENEJ AKO JEDEN BLOK.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="23,438 967,440 967,544 25,548" type="commentary">
       <p>NAĽAVO LANEY ZBADALA ZÁBLESKY FARMÁRSKYCH STANOVÍŠŤ V CENTRAL PARKU: KUKURIČNÉ A SÓJOVÉ POLIA OBKLOPENÉ OSTNATÝM DRÔTOM A STANOVÉ MESTEČKÁ. O ĎALŠIE DVE SEKUNDY MINULI PARK A JAKE ZAČAL SPOMAĽOVAŤ SMEROM K 110-TEJ ULICI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/26.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="117,73 125,50 163,27 206,21 290,21 340,33 363,52 371,73 363,98 338,117 292,129 210,131 156,121 129,106 119,88">
       <p>HOLD ON. WE'RE GOING TO DROP IN HARD.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="23,444 981,444 983,546 23,548" type="commentary">
       <p>WHAT HE SHOULD HAVE DONE - WHAT ANYONE ELSE WOULD HAVE DONE - WAS STOP AT 110<sup>TH</sup> AND LET THE GRID LOWER THEM DOWN TO THE SURFACE STREETS. INSTEAD THEY WERE CLOSING IN ON THE END OF GRID AND STILL DOING OVER A HUNDRED.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="117,73 125,50 163,27 206,21 290,21 340,33 363,52 371,73 363,98 338,117 292,129 210,131 156,121 129,106 119,88">
       <p>DRŽ SA. PRISTÁTIE BUDE TVRDÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="23,444 981,444 983,546 23,548" type="commentary">
       <p>ČO MAL UROBIŤ - RESP. ČO BY KAŽDÝ NA JEHO MIESTE UROBIL - BOLO ZASTAŤ NA 110-TEJ A NECHAŤ SA ZNIESŤ DOLU GRIDOM AUTOMATICKY NA POVRCH. NAMIESTO TOHO SA BLÍŽILI KU KONCU GRIDU A STÁLE IŠLI VIAC NEŽ STOVKOU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/27.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="25,31 423,31 425,219 27,221" type="commentary">
       <p>JUST AS THEY HIT THE END OF THE GRID, HE FLIPPED ON THE MOTO'S TURBINES AND THE COCKPIT WAS FILLED WITH THE LOUD ROAR OF THE MICRO-JETS SUCKING IN WIND.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="265,375 554,396 552,467 263,442" text-rotation="355" bgcolor="#000000" inverted="True" type="code">
       <p>WARNING: MOTO GRID ENDS IN 328 METERS.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="25,31 423,31 425,219 27,221" type="commentary">
       <p>HNEĎ AKO NARAZILI NA KONIEC MOTO-GRIDU, JAKE ZAPOL TURBÍNY A KOKPIT SA NAPLNIL OHLUŠUJÚCIM REVOM MIKROTRYSIEK NASÁVAJÚCICH VZDUCH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="265,375 554,396 552,467 263,442" text-rotation="355" bgcolor="#000000" inverted="True" type="code">
       <p>POZOR: MOTO GRID KONČÍ O 328 METROV.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/28.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="513,15 973,15 973,110 515,110" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>FOR A MOMENT HE COULD FEEL THE PULL OF THE GRID HOLDING THEM UP, FIGHTING GRAVITY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="40,483 940,481 940,548 40,548" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THEN THEY WERE OUT OF THE MAGNETIC FIELD COMPLETELY, FREE-FALLING TOWARDS THE STREET BELOW IN A SHALLOW ARC.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="513,15 973,15 973,110 515,110" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>NA MOMENT POCÍTIL ŤAH GRIDU, KTORÝ ICH DRŽAL NAVRCHU BOJUJÚC PROTI GRAVITÁCII.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="40,483 940,481 940,548 40,548" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>POTOM SA DOSTALI VON Z MAGNETICKÉHO POĽA KOMPLETNE VOĽNE PADAJÚC VEĽKÝM OBLÚKOM SMEROM NADOL NA POVRCH.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/29.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="556,31 963,31 963,163 556,163" type="commentary">
       <p>HE GUNNED THE THROTTLE WHEN THEY HIT THE PAVEMENT, FLING POSITIVE HORIZONTAL <emphasis>Gs</emphasis> ON TOP OF NEGATIVE VERTICAL ONES.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="13,231 408,231 408,340 306,500 13,500" type="commentary">
       <p>THE SYNTHETIC DRUGS MIXED WITH THE RAW ADRENALINE IN HIS BLOOD AND OVERLOADED HIS DOPAMINE RECEPTORS, MELTING NEURONS LIKE MARSHMALLOWS ACROSS HIS ENTIRE NERVOUS SYSTEM. IT FELT GREAT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="556,31 963,31 963,163 556,163" type="commentary">
       <p>HNEĎ AKO SA DOSTALI NA POVRCH, ŠLIAPOL PORIADNE NA PLYN VRHNÚC POZITÍVNE HORIZONTÁLNE <emphasis>G</emphasis> NA NEGATÍVNE VERTIKÁLNE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="13,231 408,231 408,340 306,500 13,500" type="commentary">
       <p>SYNTETICKÉ DROGY SA ZMIEŠALI S ČISTÝM ADRENALÍNOM V JEHO KRVI A ZAHLTILI JEHO DOPAMÍNOVÉ RECEPTORY, TAVIAC NEURÓNY AKO ŽELATÍNU NAPRIEČ CELÝM JEHO NERVOVÝM SYSTÉMOM. BOL TO SUPER POCIT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/30.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/31.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="33,42 371,42 371,140 296,263 40,263" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE MOTO WAS JUST REWING UP PAST 200 WHEN JAKE HIT THE BREAKS. HE GAVE THE WHEEL A KICK TO THE LEFT AND DOWNSHIFTED MANUALLY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="33,42 371,42 371,140 296,263 40,263" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>AUTO PRÁVE ZRÝCHĽOVALO NAD 200, KEĎ JAKE ŠLIAPOL NA BRZDY. HNEĎ NATO ZATOČIL VOLANTOM PRUDKO DOĽAVA A MANUÁLNE PODRADIL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/32.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="31,200 448,202 446,533 31,538" type="commentary">
       <p>LANEY HAD JUST CAUGHT UP WITH THE MOTO'S FORWARD ACCELERATION WHEN THE SLIDE BEGAN. AS SOON AS HER VISUAL INPUT STARTED TO MAKE SENSE AGAIN, SHE REALIZED THEY WERE SLIDING TOWARDS THE WALL. IT WAS CLOSE - LESS THAN A BLOCK - AND THEY WERE STILL MOVING FAST. SHE CLOSED HER EYES AND WAITED FOR THE IMPACT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="31,200 448,202 446,533 31,538" type="commentary">
       <p>LEN ČO SA LANEY PRISPÔSOBILA PREDNEJ AKCELERÁCII, AUTO SA ZAČALO KĹZAŤ. HNEĎ AKO JEJ VIZUÁLNY VSTUP ZAČAL OPÄŤ DÁVAŤ ZMYSEL, ZISTILA, ŽE SA KĹŽU SMEROM ROVNO DO STENY. STENA BOLA BLÍZKO - MENEJ AKO JEDEN BLOK - A ONI STÁLE IŠLI AKOSI PRIRÝCHLO. LANEY ZAVRELA OČI A OČAKÁVALA NÁRAZ.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/33.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/34.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="54,35 306,35 329,131 329,200 298,265 52,265" type="commentary">
       <p>THE MOTO CAME TO REST JUST BESIDE THE WALL, PERFECTLY PARALLEL AND SO CLOSE THAT LANEY WOULDN'T HAVE BEEN ABLE TO OPEN HER DOOR.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="54,35 306,35 329,131 329,200 298,265 52,265" type="commentary">
       <p>AUTO ZASTAVILO TESNE PRI STENE, PERFEKTNE PARALELNE A TAK BLÍZKO, ŽE LANEY BY NEBOLA SCHOPNÁ OTVORIŤ DVERE ANI O CENTIMETER.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/35.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,46 423,46 383,265 29,265" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE WOULD HAVE BET JAKE WAS THE ONLY DRIVER IN THE CITY GOOD ENOUGH TO HAVE EXECUTED THAT SLIDE, AND THE ONLY ONE CRAZY ENOUGH TO DO IT JUST FOR FUN.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="31,323 404,323 383,508 29,506" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE WAS PRETTY SURE HE HAD CALCULATED IT RIGHT DOWN TO THE MILLIMETER, BUT THAT DIDN'T MEAN SHE WANTED TO BE IN THE MIDDLE OF A JOB WHEN HE DID IT.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,46 423,46 383,265 29,265" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>STAVILA BY SA S HOCIKÝM, ŽE JAKE JE JEDINÝ VODIČ V MESTE DOSŤ DOBRÝ NATO, ABY TAKÝTO SKLZ VYKONAL, A JEDINÝ DOSTATOČNE BLÁZNIVÝ NATO, ABY TO UROBIL ZO SRANDY.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="31,323 404,323 383,508 29,506" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>BOLA SI ISTÁ, ŽE SI TO JAKE VYPOČÍTAL PRESNE NA MILIMETRE. TO ALE NEZNAMENALO, ŽE CHCELA BYŤ V STREDE PREBIEHAJÚCEJ AKCIE, KEĎ TO ZROVNA UROBIL.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/36.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="248,83 258,54 281,31 335,15 385,6 471,6 529,15 575,31 602,54 608,81 602,113 585,133 548,150 496,163 431,167 352,163 294,148 260,123 250,102">
       <p>JAKE. I'M NOT ON SAFE. I'M GOING TO BLOW YOUR FUCKING BRAINS OUT IF YOU DON'T GET STRAIGHT RIGHT NOW.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="615,98 617,77 608,48 617,27 650,8 681,2 754,2 798,15 819,35 827,60 823,88 806,108 775,125 723,129 669,125 631,115">
       <p>FUCK! WHAT THE HELL IS YOUR PROBLEM?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="248,83 258,54 281,31 335,15 385,6 471,6 529,15 575,31 602,54 608,81 602,113 585,133 548,150 496,163 431,167 352,163 294,148 260,123 250,102">
       <p>JAKE. TOTO UŽ BOLO PRÍLIŠ. VYSTRELÍM TI TEN TVOJ MOZOG Z HLAVY, KEĎ SA NEZAČNEŠ SPRÁVAŤ NORMÁLNE. A TO HNEĎ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="615,98 617,77 608,48 617,27 650,8 681,2 754,2 798,15 819,35 827,60 823,88 806,108 775,125 723,129 669,125 631,115">
       <p>SAKRA! AKÝ MÁŠ DO PEKLA ZAS PROBLÉM?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/37.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="483,175 490,117 523,67 598,31 708,21 810,27 883,50 929,94 948,146 946,198 929,240 898,273 844,302 756,317 660,317 573,300 515,265 488,215">
       <p>JAKE, I'M NOT FUCKING AROUND. YOU CAN'T PULL THAT SHIT IN THE MIDDLE OF A JOB. SO NOW YOU GET TO DO EXACTLY WHAT I SAY OR I'M GOING TO PLASTER THE INSIDE OF THIS THING WITH YOUR BRAINS AND THEN DUMP YOUR BODY IN THE STREET FOR THE ORGAN HARVESTERS TO FIND.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="483,175 490,117 523,67 598,31 708,21 810,27 883,50 929,94 948,146 946,198 929,240 898,273 844,302 756,317 660,317 573,300 515,265 488,215">
       <p>JAKE, NEROBÍM SI KURVA SRANDU. NEMÔŽEŠ STVÁRAŤ NIEČO TAKÉTO V STREDE PREBIEHAJÚCEJ AKCIE. TAKŽE TERAZ UROBÍŠ PRESNE TO, ČO TI POVIEM ALEBO VNÚTRO TVOJEJ KÁRY VYMAĽUJEM TVOJIM VYSTRELENÝM MOZGOM A POTOM TVOJE TELO VYHODÍM NA ULICU, KDE SI HO NÁJDU ZBERAČI ORGÁNOV.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/38.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="0,46 6,27 33,10 60,2 300,2 338,17 356,35 356,52 335,75 294,90 227,100 94,98 38,83 8,67 2,58">
       <p>YOU SEE THAT RED DOOR ABOUT 50 METERS DOWN ON THE LEFT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="323,194 327,177 352,165 392,163 415,173 423,185 423,204 406,219 383,223 346,221 325,208">
       <p>YEAH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="527,319 535,258 558,202 606,158 683,133 775,125 863,131 929,152 969,181 996,215 996,417 973,448 921,483 844,502 767,506 677,500 606,475 567,442 540,400">
       <p>BY THE TIME YOU GET THERE I'LL HAVE THE SECURITY HACKED. TAKE A LEFT INSIDE THE DOOR AND YOU'LL BE IN A ROOM FULL OF HALF-METER WIRE CAGES. THEY'RE SUPPOSED TO BE ELECTRIFIED AND LOCKED, BUT THEY WON'T BE. IN ONE OF THOSE CAGES IS THE SQUIRREL. IT SHOULD TAKE YOU TWO MINUTES ONCE YOU HIT THE DOOR. I'LL BE WAITING OUTSIDE IN THE MOTO.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="0,46 6,27 33,10 60,2 300,2 338,17 356,35 356,52 335,75 294,90 227,100 94,98 38,83 8,67 2,58">
       <p>VIDÍŠ TIE ČERVENÉ DVERE ASI 50 METROV NAĽAVO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="323,194 327,177 352,165 392,163 415,173 423,185 423,204 406,219 383,223 346,221 325,208">
       <p>JASNE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="527,319 535,258 558,202 606,158 683,133 775,125 863,131 929,152 969,181 996,215 996,417 973,448 921,483 844,502 767,506 677,500 606,475 567,442 540,400">
       <p>KÝM K NIM PRÍDEŠ, BUDEM MAŤ UŽ HEKNUTÚ OCHRANU OBJEKTU. VO VNÚTRI ZABOČÍŠ DOĽAVA A OCITNEŠ SA V MIESTNOSTI PLNEJ POL METRA VYSOKÝCH KLIETOK. MALI BY BYŤ POD PRÚDOM A UZAMKNUTÉ, ALE NEBUDÚ. V JEDNEJ Z TÝCH KLIETOK JE VEVERIČKA. NEMALO BY TI TO ZABRAŤ VIAC AKO DVE MINÚTY OD OKAMIHU, KEĎ TAM VSTÚPIŠ. JA BUDEM NA TEBA ČAKAŤ VONKU V AUTE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/39.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,65 25,46 56,29 102,21 196,21 246,31 269,42 279,60 275,79 258,96 219,106 156,113 94,108 52,100 27,88">
       <p>NOBODY DRIVES THE MOTO BUT ME.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="171,217 175,179 196,148 235,123 292,108 363,104 429,108 479,121 517,144 540,175 546,213 540,252 525,281 496,304 450,321 394,329 313,327 254,319 213,302 181,269 173,235">
       <p>YOU KEEP DRIVING LIKE THIS AND OUR SQUIRREL WON'T MAKE IT TWO BLOCKS. SO UNTIL YOU HEAR OTHERWISE I'M THE NEW DRIVER AND YOU'RE THE NEW PET-SITTER.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="94,377 102,354 125,338 163,329 227,329 258,338 279,354 288,375 283,396 273,413 248,425 215,429 156,429 121,421 100,402 96,392">
       <p>IF YOU DIDN'T HAVE THAT GUN ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="158,477 173,458 204,448 244,442 304,444 340,452 365,467 375,483 375,506 365,523 331,538 290,544 221,542 183,535 160,519 154,498">
       <p>YEAH, BUT I DO HAVE IT, SO GET MOVING.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,65 25,46 56,29 102,21 196,21 246,31 269,42 279,60 275,79 258,96 219,106 156,113 94,108 52,100 27,88">
       <p>NIKTO NERIADI MOJE AUTO. IBA JA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="171,217 175,179 196,148 235,123 292,108 363,104 429,108 479,121 517,144 540,175 546,213 540,252 525,281 496,304 450,321 394,329 313,327 254,319 213,302 181,269 173,235">
       <p>KEĎ BUDEŠ JAZDIŤ, TAK AKO JAZDÍŠ, NAŠA VEVERIČKA NEPREŽIJE CESTU DVA BLOKY. TAKŽE SOM NOVÝM VODIČOM JA A TY SI NOVÝM OPATROVATEĽOM DOMÁCICH ZVIERAT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="94,377 102,354 125,338 163,329 227,329 258,338 279,354 288,375 283,396 273,413 248,425 215,429 156,429 121,421 100,402 96,392">
       <p>KEBY SI NEMALA V RUKE TÚ ZBRAŇ ...</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="158,477 173,458 204,448 244,442 304,444 340,452 365,467 375,483 375,506 365,523 331,538 290,544 221,542 183,535 160,519 154,498">
       <p>JASNE, LENŽE JU MÁM, TAKŽE SI POHNI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/40.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="504,58 938,58 933,504 504,508" type="commentary">
       <p>AS JAKE HEADED FOR THE DOOR SHE DROPPED INTO WI-FI. SHE HIT THE LANDLINE NETWORK TO FIND THE NEAREST HARDWIRE CONNECTION - THE SECURITY SYSTEM NODE WOULDN'T BE ON WI-FI, BUT IT WOULD BE NETWORKED FOR REMOTE CONTROL. AND SOMEWHERE IN THAT NETWORK, INEVITABLY, THERE WOULD BE A WI-FI NODE. JAKE WAS HALFWAY TO THE DOOR WHEN SHE FOUND THE BUILDING'S SECURITY SYSTEM ON THE NETWORK.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="504,58 938,58 933,504 504,508" type="commentary">
       <p>AKONÁHLE JAKE VYRAZIL KU DVERÁM, NALOGOVALA SA DO WI-FI. NAPOJILA SA DO POZEMNEJ SIETE, ABY NAŠLA PRIAME SPOJENIE PO DRÁTE - BEZPEČNOSTNÝ SYSTÉM NEBUDE DOSTUPNÝ PO WI-FI, ALE BUDE NA SIETI KVÔLI OVLÁDANIU NA DIAĽKU. A NIEKDE V TEJ SIETI, BUDE URČITE WI-FI UZOL. JAKE BOL NA POLCESTE K DOMU, KEĎ LANEY OBJAVILA POLOHU BEZPEČNOSTNÉHO SYSTÉMU NA SIETI.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/41.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="77,21 573,21 573,190 433,183 285,156 110,110 81,83" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE BLEW THROUGH THE SYSTEMS FIREWALL AND INTO THE NODE, PULLING UP THE MAIN CONTROL PANEL FOR THE BUILDING'S SECURITY SYSTEM.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="77,21 573,21 573,190 433,183 285,156 110,110 81,83" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>PRERAZILA FIREWALL SYSTÉMU, NAPOJILA SA NA UZOL A OTVORILA HLAVNÝ OVLÁDACÍ PANEL BEZPEČNOSTNÉHO SYSTÉMU BUDOVY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/42.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="29,19 456,19 456,179 31,179" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE CREATED A KEY CARD OBJECT, AND COPIED THE ACCESS CODE SHE'D STOLEN LAST NIGHT OFF OF HER WETWARE AND ONTO THE CARD'S DATA STRIP.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="519,402 994,402 994,560 517,560" type="commentary">
       <p>SHE STARTED UP A STOPWATCH ROUTINE - IF IT TOOK JAKE MORE THAN THREE MINUTES, SHE'D ASSUME HE'D PASSED OUT ON THE FLOOR OR WANDERED INTO AN AREA THAT WAS STILL SECURE.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="29,19 456,19 456,179 31,179" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>VYTVORILA OBJEKT V TVARE VSTUPNEJ KARTY A SKOPÍROVALA PRÍSTUPOVÝ KÓD, KTORÝ UKRADLA MINULÚ NOC, ZO SVOJEJ ELEKTRONICKEJ PAMÄTE NA VSTUPNÚ KARTU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="519,402 994,402 994,560 517,560" type="commentary">
       <p>NASTAVILA SI STOPKY - AK TO ZABERIE JAKEOVI VIAC AKO TRI MINÚTY, BUDE PREDPOKLADAŤ, ŽE OMLDLEL NIEKDE NA DLÁŽKE ALEBO VOŠIEL DO PRIESTORU, KTORÝ JE STÁLE ZABEZPEČENÝ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/43.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/44.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="29,21 969,21 969,125 33,131" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>SHE SHUT DOWN ALL THE CAMERAS ALONG JAKE'S ROUTE JUST AS HE OPENED THE DOOR. SHE CRACKED THE LOCKS ON THE CAGES AND TURNED OFF THE ELECTRIC COUNTERMEASURES. SOMETHING WASN'T RIGHT - THIS WAS TOO EASY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="29,21 969,21 969,125 33,131" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>VYPLA VŠETKY KAMERY POZDĹŽ JAKOVEJ TRASY HNEĎ AKO OTVORIL DVERE. OTVORILA ZÁMKY NA KLIETKACH A TAKISTO VYPLA OCHRANU ELEKTRICKÝM PRÚDOM. NIEČO VŠAK NEBOLO V PORIADKU - ZDALO SA JEJ TO AŽ PRÍLIŠ JEDNODUCHÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/45.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="392,40 954,40 956,185 394,185" type="commentary">
       <p>SUDDENLY THERE WAS WI-FI CHATTER EVERYWHERE. IT WAS RICH - TECH, SUPER - ENCRYPTED, AND SHE DIDN'T HAVE TIME TO HACK IT. SHE DIDN'T NEED TO THOUGH: IT WAS A SWARM.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="392,40 954,40 956,185 394,185" type="commentary">
       <p>NO NÁHLE ZAČAL PRÚDIŤ ODVŠADIAĽ WI-FI ŠUM. BOL TO PRÚD TECHNICKÝCH VYSOKO ZAŠIFROVANÝCH DÁT, KTORÉ TERAZ NEMALA ČAS HACKNÚŤ. NEPOTREBOVALA TO VŠAK: BOL TO ROJ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/46.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="34,131 416,131 416,447 398,528 34,528" type="commentary"><p>SHE COULDN'T SEE THE SCOOTERS BUT SHE COULD HEAR THE BUZZ OF THEIR MOTORS ECHOING OFF THE BUILDINGS.</p><p> </p><p>THEY WOULD COME IN FROM EVERY DIRECTION, NETWORKED AND TIME-SYNCHED TO HIT THEIR TARGET IN UNISON. THE MOTO WAS BULLETPROOF FROM BUMPER TO BUMPER, BUT THEY WERE LIKELY TO HAVE SOMETHING NASTIER THAN BULLETS.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="34,131 416,131 416,447 398,528 34,528" type="commentary"><p>SKÚTRE SÍCE NEVIDELA, ALE POČULA ZVUK ICH MOTOROV OZÝVAJÚCICH SA OD OKOLITÝCH BUDOV.</p><p> </p><p>PRICHÁDZALI ZO VŠETKÝCH SMEROV, POPREPÁJANÍ A ZOSYNCHRONIZOVANÍ UDRIEŤ NA ICH CIEĽ SPOLOČNE. ICH AUTO BOLO NEPRIESTREĽNÉ Z KAŽDÉHO SMERU, ALE NEPRIATELIA MAJÚ PRAVDEPODOBNE NIEČO SILNEJŠIE AKO NÁBOJE.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/47.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/48.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="48,104 54,83 77,63 119,52 185,52 223,65 244,81 248,108 233,133 208,148 150,154 90,148 58,131">
       <p>WHAT THE HELL IS THAT SHIT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="254,79 260,52 281,31 321,19 375,19 417,27 442,42 450,65 450,96 442,108 429,123 398,133 348,138 298,131 265,115 254,90">
       <p>IT'S A GOD DAMN SWARM. SOME KINDA SET-UP.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="433,135 440,119 467,104 521,96 575,100 600,106 606,117 621,131 623,144 608,160 567,175 496,175 456,167 435,148">
       <p>SO FUCKING DRIVE!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="604,85 613,63 644,38 706,23 781,21 873,25 923,38 952,58 963,79 956,108 929,131 869,146 775,150 688,146 635,129 610,106">
       <p>I GOTTA BRING THE SEC SYSTEMS BACK ONLINE TO COVER OUR TRACKS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="48,104 54,83 77,63 119,52 185,52 223,65 244,81 248,108 233,133 208,148 150,154 90,148 58,131">
       <p>ČO DO PEKLA JE TOTO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="254,79 260,52 281,31 321,19 375,19 417,27 442,42 450,65 450,96 442,108 429,123 398,133 348,138 298,131 265,115 254,90">
       <p>JE TO PREKLIATY ROJ. DÁKY PODVOD.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="433,135 440,119 467,104 521,96 575,100 600,106 606,117 621,131 623,144 608,160 567,175 496,175 456,167 435,148">
       <p>TAK KURVA CHOĎ!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="604,85 613,63 644,38 706,23 781,21 873,25 923,38 952,58 963,79 956,108 929,131 869,146 775,150 688,146 635,129 610,106">
       <p>MUSÍM DAŤ NAJSKÔR BEZPEČNOSTNÉ SYSTÉMY SPÄŤ ONLINE, ABY SOM ZAKRYLA NAŠE STOPY.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/49.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="265,63 271,38 306,19 356,15 415,21 444,38 454,65 442,94 404,113 356,117 296,108 269,85">
       <p>JUST A FEW MORE SECONDS ...</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="265,63 271,38 306,19 356,15 415,21 444,38 454,65 442,94 404,113 356,117 296,108 269,85">
       <p>LEN PÁR SEKÚND ...</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/50.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="242,46 254,21 300,4 365,2 438,6 473,23 483,42 481,63 458,83 410,94 363,96 285,90 250,71">
       <p>ALRIGHT, WE WERE NEVER HERE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="242,46 254,21 300,4 365,2 438,6 473,23 483,42 481,63 458,83 410,94 363,96 285,90 250,71">
       <p>HOTOVO, NIKDY SME TU NEBOLI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/51.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/52.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/53.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="15,67 75,58 354,31 356,69 329,75 52,104 15,106" text-rotation="6">
       <p><strong>FUCKING HELL</strong></p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="15,67 75,58 354,31 356,69 329,75 52,104 15,106" text-rotation="6">
       <p><strong>DO PEKLA</strong></p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/54.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="631,71 640,44 667,23 698,13 763,8 835,13 873,23 898,40 908,67 906,88 894,104 875,119 846,127 802,133 727,133 673,123 640,100 631,81">
       <p>JAKE, DO SOMETHING ABOUT THESE MOTHER - FUCKERS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="631,71 640,44 667,23 698,13 763,8 835,13 873,23 898,40 908,67 906,88 894,104 875,119 846,127 802,133 727,133 673,123 640,100 631,81">
       <p>JAKE, SPRAV NIEČO S TÝMITO PARCHANTMI.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/55.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/56.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/57.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="692,88 700,54 733,29 794,19 894,19 942,31 975,52 988,79 983,113 958,140 910,154 858,160 790,160 731,148 694,113">
       <p>THERE'S TOO MANY OF THEM. WE NEED TO GET THE FUCK OUT OF HERE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="692,88 700,54 733,29 794,19 894,19 942,31 975,52 988,79 983,113 958,140 910,154 858,160 790,160 731,148 694,113">
       <p>JE ICH PRÍLIŠ VEĽA. MUSÍME SA KURVA ODTIAĽTO DOSTAŤ PREČ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/58.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,96 27,60 48,40 79,29 117,25 158,31 190,52 202,85 200,123 183,148 154,165 102,169 58,160 29,140 21,115">
       <p>HOLD ON. AND DON'T MAKE ANY SUDDEN TURNS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,96 27,60 48,40 79,29 117,25 158,31 190,52 202,85 200,123 183,148 154,165 102,169 58,160 29,140 21,115">
       <p>MOMENT. NEROB ŽIADNE NÁHLE ZMENY SMERU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/59.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="29,29 460,29 460,113 27,113" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>THE MOTO LURCHED FORWARD AND THE ROAR OF THE MICRO-JETS WAS DEAFENING.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="29,29 460,29 460,113 27,113" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
       <p>AUTO VYRAZILO VPRED A ZVUK JEHO MICROTRYSIEK ZNEL OHLUŠUJÚCO.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/60.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="375,52 381,33 406,19 452,13 515,17 546,25 560,38 565,52 558,71 533,88 498,94 435,94 392,81 377,65">
       <p>LET ME SEE THE CAGE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="298,140 304,121 335,110 381,110 406,119 417,133 417,150 396,163 354,169 313,160 300,150">
       <p>WHAT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="371,235 377,219 394,204 423,196 465,194 531,194 560,200 583,215 592,233 588,254 567,271 529,279 481,283 423,277 388,267 375,248">
       <p>THE CAGE. LET ME SEE IT.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="375,52 381,33 406,19 452,13 515,17 546,25 560,38 565,52 558,71 533,88 498,94 435,94 392,81 377,65">
       <p>UKÁŽ MI TU KLIETKU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="298,140 304,121 335,110 381,110 406,119 417,133 417,150 396,163 354,169 313,160 300,150">
       <p>ČO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="371,235 377,219 394,204 423,196 465,194 531,194 560,200 583,215 592,233 588,254 567,271 529,279 481,283 423,277 388,267 375,248">
       <p>KLIETKU. UKÁŽ MI JU.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 3/61.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="158,67 165,48 196,31 252,31 281,38 300,54 300,81 281,98 244,106 200,104 169,96 158,77">
       <p>GOD DAMN IT!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="98,173 106,156 127,146 160,144 196,148 215,158 219,175 208,194 185,204 154,206 119,200 100,188">
       <p>WHAT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="215,285 221,263 242,248 277,238 325,238 356,246 375,260 381,288 375,313 354,331 323,340 273,340 240,331 219,310">
       <p>THAT'S NOT A SQUIRREL.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="158,67 165,48 196,31 252,31 281,38 300,54 300,81 281,98 244,106 200,104 169,96 158,77">
       <p>SAKRA!</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="98,173 106,156 127,146 160,144 196,148 215,158 219,175 208,194 185,204 154,206 119,200 100,188">
       <p>ČO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="215,285 221,263 242,248 277,238 325,238 356,246 375,260 381,288 375,313 354,331 323,340 273,340 240,331 219,310">
       <p>TO NIE JE VEVERIČKA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/62.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="40,33 331,33 331,81 38,81">
       <p>IT'S A FUCKING RAT!</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="40,33 331,33 331,81 38,81">
       <p>JE TO SKURVENÝ POTKAN!</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 3/63.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="274,213 750,213 750,278 273,278" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>TO BE CONTINUED</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="274,213 750,213 750,278 273,278" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>POKRAČOVANIE NABUDÚCE</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 4</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 4</title>
      <image href="Issue 4/01.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,377 579,377 579,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>ISSUE 4</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,377 579,377 579,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>KAPITOLA 4</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/02.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="56,63 63,42 98,23 142,19 200,19 246,29 267,44 275,60 269,81 254,94 223,104 181,108 115,108 81,98 60,83">
       <p>WAGNER'S LINK IS DOWN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="802,52 810,35 835,21 883,17 935,19 960,31 971,44 973,58 965,69 944,83 919,90 877,90 840,85 813,77 802,65">
       <p>TRY JULIUS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="56,63 63,42 98,23 142,19 200,19 246,29 267,44 275,60 269,81 254,94 223,104 181,108 115,108 81,98 60,83">
       <p>WAGNEROVO SPOJENIE JE PRERUŠENÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="802,52 810,35 835,21 883,17 935,19 960,31 971,44 973,58 965,69 944,83 919,90 877,90 840,85 813,77 802,65">
       <p>SKÚS JULIA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/03.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/04.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="404,46 408,27 425,21 508,21 523,27 529,44 525,60 508,71 465,71 415,69 404,56">
       <p>LANEY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="646,83 646,65 663,50 685,42 719,42 744,50 756,67 758,88 750,102 733,110 702,115 667,110 650,98">
       <p>YEAH.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="646,194 646,169 656,154 671,152 783,152 794,165 794,200 781,213 660,213 648,202">
       <p>WHERE ARE YOU?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="692,340 696,313 710,285 740,267 781,254 844,250 913,258 950,273 977,296 985,321 985,358 977,383 954,406 917,423 883,429 840,431 781,427 746,419 717,402 698,377 694,356">
       <p>I'M WITH JAKE. WE JUST RAN A JOB THAT WAS SOME KIND OF SET-UP. I CAN'T GET WAGNER ON THE COMM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="404,46 408,27 425,21 508,21 523,27 529,44 525,60 508,71 465,71 415,69 404,56">
       <p>LANEY?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="646,83 646,65 663,50 685,42 719,42 744,50 756,67 758,88 750,102 733,110 702,115 667,110 650,98">
       <p>ÁNO.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="646,194 646,169 656,154 671,152 783,152 794,165 794,200 781,213 660,213 648,202">
       <p>KDE TRČÍŠ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="692,340 696,313 710,285 740,267 781,254 844,250 913,258 950,273 977,296 985,321 985,358 977,383 954,406 917,423 883,429 840,431 781,427 746,419 717,402 698,377 694,356">
       <p>SOM S JAKEOM. PRÁVE SME DOKONČILI DŽOB, KTORÝ BOL HNUSNOU PASCOU. NEDOKÁŽEM SA SPOJIŤ S WAGNEROM.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/05.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="19,69 25,46 60,21 113,6 244,6 292,15 325,31 340,52 342,79 327,102 296,121 250,131 194,133 106,131 58,119 31,100 21,83">
       <p>I'M AT WAGNER'S RIGHT NOW. HE'S NOT HERE AND THE PLACE IS TRASHED.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="381,31 392,17 513,17 525,25 529,46 527,77 515,92 398,92 381,81">
       <p>WHAT THE FUCK?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="552,144 560,102 577,69 606,42 665,21 725,13 825,10 881,23 925,42 956,65 977,108 981,154 969,202 933,242 881,267 827,275 729,279 660,271 602,248 567,206 554,165">
       <p>THERE'S MORE. I DIDN'T JUST COME OVER HERE FOR A CUP OF TEA - I WAS SUPPOSED TO MEET WAGNER TO GET THE DROP POINT FOR A PICK-UP I JUST FINISHED. IT'S PROBABLY OF SOME INTEREST TO YOU THAT THIS JOB WAS ALSO A SET-UP.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="544,325 556,310 735,308 750,321 752,365 738,377 556,377 544,367">
       <p>FUCK. WHAT'S THE CARGO?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="471,481 481,452 525,429 594,415 675,406 840,408 919,421 973,438 998,458 998,506 977,527 923,546 860,556 798,560 669,560 575,550 510,533 477,506">
       <p>NO IDEA. SOME SORT OF SUPER-COOLED LIQUID IN SMALL QUANTITIES. WHATEVER IT IS, IT'S ONLY GOT ABOUT NINE HOURS LEFT BEFORE IT GOES BAD.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="19,69 25,46 60,21 113,6 244,6 292,15 325,31 340,52 342,79 327,102 296,121 250,131 194,133 106,131 58,119 31,100 21,83">
       <p>SOM U WAGNERA TERAZ. NIE JE DOMA A CELÉ JE TO TU HORE NOHAMI.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="381,31 392,17 513,17 525,25 529,46 527,77 515,92 398,92 381,81">
       <p>ČO DO ČERTA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="552,144 560,102 577,69 606,42 665,21 725,13 825,10 881,23 925,42 956,65 977,108 981,154 969,202 933,242 881,267 827,275 729,279 660,271 602,248 567,206 554,165">
       <p>JE TOHO VIAC. NEPRIŠIEL SOM SEM NA ŠÁLKU ČAJU - MAL SOM SA STRETNÚŤ S WAGNEROM A DOHODNÚŤ MIESTO ODOVZDANIA ZÁSIELKY, KTORÚ SOM PRÁVE VYBAVIL. MOŽNO VÁS BUDE ZAUJÍMAŤ, ŽE TENTO DŽOB BOL TAKISTO PODVOD.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="544,325 556,310 735,308 750,321 752,365 738,377 556,377 544,367">
       <p>SAKRA. ČO JE TÁ ZÁSIELKA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="471,481 481,452 525,429 594,415 675,406 840,408 919,421 973,438 998,458 998,506 977,527 923,546 860,556 798,560 669,560 575,550 510,533 477,506">
       <p>NEMÁM POTUCHY. NEJAKÁ SUPER-CHLADENÁ TEKUTINA V MALÝCH AMPULKÁCH. ČOKOĽVEK TO JE, MÁ TO LEN DEVÄŤ HODÍN ČASU, KÝM SA STANE NIEČO ZLÉ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/06.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="135,52 144,31 169,19 215,15 269,17 294,29 306,46 306,65 285,83 248,94 192,92 158,85 138,69">
       <p>WAGNER SOLD US OUT.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="302,85 315,71 319,56 319,42 319,40 529,40 540,50 542,140 527,156 319,156 304,146">
       <p>ODDS ARE AGAINST THAT. BUT SOMEBODY DID.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="394,271 398,248 423,223 473,206 544,202 615,206 663,215 694,233 706,254 706,290 692,310 663,327 631,335 554,340 479,338 435,325 402,304">
       <p>SO WE'RE TOTALLY OUT IN THE OPEN. WE NEED TO UNPLUG AND FIGURE THIS SHIT OUT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="329,375 340,360 444,360 454,371 456,392 456,440 444,456 346,456 329,444">
       <p>I'LL BE THERE IN FIFTEEN.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="473,494 475,475 502,456 546,450 592,452 617,463 629,481 629,504 621,521 594,533 552,538 510,535 485,525 475,508">
       <p>WE'LL BE THERE IN FIVE.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="135,52 144,31 169,19 215,15 269,17 294,29 306,46 306,65 285,83 248,94 192,92 158,85 138,69">
       <p>WAGNER NÁS PREDAL.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="302,85 315,71 319,56 319,42 319,40 529,40 540,50 542,140 527,156 319,156 304,146">
       <p>MYSLÍM, ŽE ON NIE. ALE NIEKTO TO UROBIL.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="394,271 398,248 423,223 473,206 544,202 615,206 663,215 694,233 706,254 706,290 692,310 663,327 631,335 554,340 479,338 435,325 402,304">
       <p>TAKŽE SME ÚPLNE NA SUCHU. MUSÍME VYPNÚŤ A NIEČO VYMYSLIEŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="329,375 340,360 444,360 454,371 456,392 456,440 444,456 346,456 329,444">
       <p>BUDEM TAM ZA 15 MINÚT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="473,494 475,475 502,456 546,450 592,452 617,463 629,481 629,504 621,521 594,533 552,538 510,535 485,525 475,508">
       <p>MY TAM BUDEME ZA PÄŤ.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/07.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="48,38 56,23 88,13 140,10 179,15 210,23 221,33 221,46 210,56 188,65 160,67 98,69 65,60 50,48">
       <p>BE WHERE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="177,81 179,75 198,73 219,63 233,56 296,56 321,60 340,69 350,77 348,90 340,100 313,108 263,110 206,108 185,100">
       <p>SAFESPOT.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="4,206 10,185 27,171 69,158 115,154 188,154 238,160 271,173 288,194 290,213 279,233 252,248 202,260 146,263 79,258 33,248 8,229">
       <p>WE HAVE A SAFESPOT? HOW COME I DON'T KNOW ABOUT IT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="231,288 233,271 242,260 258,256 279,246 321,246 346,250 360,260 369,277 371,300 360,315 344,327 315,333 271,329 246,321 233,304">
       <p>TAKE A WILD GUESS.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="32,390 467,390 467,540 33,540" type="commentary"><p>BECAUSE NOBODY WITH A MILLIGRAM OF STREETSMARTS TRUSTS A JUNKIE. NOT EVEN HIS OWN CREW. THAT'S THE WAY IT GOES, AND JAKE KNEW IT JUST AS WELL AS ANYONE.</p></text-area></text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="48,38 56,23 88,13 140,10 179,15 210,23 221,33 221,46 210,56 188,65 160,67 98,69 65,60 50,48">
       <p>BUDEME KDE?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="177,81 179,75 198,73 219,63 233,56 296,56 321,60 340,69 350,77 348,90 340,100 313,108 263,110 206,108 185,100">
       <p>V NAŠEJ SKRÝŠI.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="4,206 10,185 27,171 69,158 115,154 188,154 238,160 271,173 288,194 290,213 279,233 252,248 202,260 146,263 79,258 33,248 8,229">
       <p>MY MÁME SKRÝŠU? AKOTO, ŽE O TOM NIČ NEVIEM?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="231,288 233,271 242,260 258,256 279,246 321,246 346,250 360,260 369,277 371,300 360,315 344,327 315,333 271,329 246,321 233,304">
       <p>ČO MYSLÍŠ?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="32,390 467,390 467,540 33,540" type="commentary"><p>PRETOŽE NIKTO ČO I LEN S MILIGRAMOM MOZGOVEJ HMOTY NEBUDE DÔVEROVAŤ FEŤÁKOVI. ANI JEHO VLASTNÁ PARTIA. TAK TO CHODÍ, A JAKE TO VEDEL, TAK AKO VŠETCI OSTATNÍ.</p></text-area></text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/08.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="169,29 171,18 188,5 203,1 263,1 278,9 285,19 286,31 285,40 275,49 260,55 239,58 210,58 184,51 171,41">
       <p>SO WHERE'S THE SAFESPOT?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="110,69 114,59 130,51 166,50 175,54 185,60 195,61 198,65 198,75 189,83 174,88 146,89 124,85 111,76">
       <p>ASHER'S.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="186,90 198,86 204,79 206,74 234,71 256,73 269,78 276,85 278,99 271,108 259,114 239,116 221,115 208,113 195,110 188,101">
       <p>WHAT'S "ASHER"?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="3,214 3,166 11,151 30,136 63,123 101,115 180,115 216,121 248,133 271,149 281,165 285,196 280,219 265,238 241,251 214,259 180,264 113,265 63,259 26,244 9,226">
       <p>NOT WHAT, WHO. HE'S AN OLD FRIEND OF JULIUS AND WAGNER FROM THEIR MERCENARY DAYS AT BURTIN INDUSTRIES. CYBERNETICS GURU, HACKER, INVENTOR - HE DESIGNED ALL OF THE FOURTH GENERATION BRAIN MODS FOR BLACKWATER SOLDIERS.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="169,29 171,18 188,5 203,1 263,1 278,9 285,19 286,31 285,40 275,49 260,55 239,58 210,58 184,51 171,41">
       <p>TAK, KDE JE TÁ SKRÝŠA?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="110,69 114,59 130,51 166,50 175,54 185,60 195,61 198,65 198,75 189,83 174,88 146,89 124,85 111,76">
       <p>U ASHERA.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="186,90 198,86 204,79 206,74 234,71 256,73 269,78 276,85 278,99 271,108 259,114 239,116 221,115 208,113 195,110 188,101">
       <p>ČO JE "ASHER"?</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="3,214 3,166 11,151 30,136 63,123 101,115 180,115 216,121 248,133 271,149 281,165 285,196 280,219 265,238 241,251 214,259 180,264 113,265 63,259 26,244 9,226">
       <p>NIE ČO, ALE KTO. JE TO STARÝ PRITEĽ JULIUSA A WAGNERA Z ICH ŽOLDÁCKYCH ČIAS V BURTIN INDUSTRIES. KYBERNETICKÝ GURU, HACKER, VYNÁLEZCA - NAVRHOL VŠETKY MOZGOVÉ MODIFIKÁCIE ŠTVRTEJ GENERÁCIE PRE VOJAKOV Z BLACKWATER.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/09.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="27,98 38,67 71,40 121,25 198,21 269,25 317,35 356,58 369,88 369,117 358,138 327,160 300,171 260,179 165,179 110,175 67,160 35,133">
       <p>THEN HE GOT SICK OF BUILDING KILLING MACHINES, STOLE A PILE OF BURTIN CASH, AND DROPPED OFF THE GRID.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="27,98 38,67 71,40 121,25 198,21 269,25 317,35 356,58 369,88 369,117 358,138 327,160 300,171 260,179 165,179 110,175 67,160 35,133">
       <p>POTOM SA MU ZHNUSILO VYTVÁRANIE ZABIJÁCKYCH MAŠÍN, UKRADOL HROMADU PRACHOV Z BURTIN INDUSTRIES, A VYPARIL SA.</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/10.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="433,40 440,25 463,13 496,8 552,8 579,15 598,23 606,38 602,52 590,63 567,71 542,73 479,71 456,69 440,58">
       <p>ASHER, IS THIS COOL?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="494,129 496,106 515,83 554,83 583,77 604,71 640,79 658,92 671,108 673,140 667,163 646,181 615,190 565,192 527,185 504,169 494,144">
       <p>IT'S FINE. JULIUS IS ALREADY HERE.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="442,508 442,473 463,448 498,429 556,423 615,427 648,440 673,465 679,490 675,525 656,546 625,565 494,563 467,550 448,529">
       <p>JULIUS IS ALREADY HERE? HOW THE FUCK DOES HE DO THAT?</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
   <text-layer lang="sk">
     <text-area points="433,40 440,25 463,13 496,8 552,8 579,15 598,23 606,38 602,52 590,63 567,71 542,73 479,71 456,69 440,58">
       <p>ASHER, SME TU DOBRE?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="494,129 496,106 515,83 554,83 583,77 604,71 640,79 658,92 671,108 673,140 667,163 646,181 615,190 565,192 527,185 504,169 494,144">
       <p>JASNE. JULIUS JE UŽ TU.</p>
     </text-area>
     <text-area points="442,508 442,473 463,448 498,429 556,423 615,427 648,440 673,465 679,490 675,525 656,546 625,565 494,563 467,550 448,529">
       <p>JULIUS JE UŽ TU? AKO TO LEN DO ČERTA ROBÍ?</p>
     </text-area>
   </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/11.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="142,100 150,67 181,42 227,23 304,13 406,13 471,19 521,38 550,60 567,94 567,121 550,152 517,175 475,188 429,198 375,200 283,198 235,192 190,177 158,154 142,127">
       <p>I'M ANALYZING THE SAMPLES JULIUS OBTAINED RIGHT NOW. WE SHOULD KNOW SOMETHING IN A FEW MINUTES. YOU MUST BE JAKE. PRETTY EXOTIC PET YOU'VE GOT THERE.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="17,248 17,227 31,210 65,196 133,190 200,194 238,200 258,215 271,231 269,252 244,275 200,288 144,290 88,288 42,277 21,258">
       <p>THANKS. IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE A SQUIRREL.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="69,425 75,381 110,333 163,304 227,290 308,283 400,290 463,308 502,331 527,363 542,400 542,446 531,485 500,523 456,544 390,560 358,565 227,565 152,546 100,510 75,471">
       <p>IF IT'S ANY CONSOLATION, THIS IS MUCH MORE VALUABLE. RATS WERE ERADICATED BY THE W.H.O. ON PURPOSE AND ARE ILLEGAL. SQUIRRELS DISAPPEARED IN THE LAST EXTINCTION WAVE, SO COLLECTORS WERE ABLE TO CLONE THEM BEFORE THEY VANISHED IN THE WILD.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="142,100 150,67 181,42 227,23 304,13 406,13 471,19 521,38 550,60 567,94 567,121 550,152 517,175 475,188 429,198 375,200 283,198 235,192 190,177 158,154 142,127"><p>PRÁVE ANALYZUJEM VZORKY, KTORÉ ZAOBSTARAL JULIUS. MALI BY SME MAŤ NEJAKÉ VÝSLEDKY O PÁR MINÚT. TY MUSÍŠ BYŤ JAKE. MÁŠ TAM PEKNÉ DOMÁCE ZVIERATKO.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="17,248 17,227 31,210 65,196 133,190 200,194 238,200 258,215 271,231 269,252 244,275 200,288 144,290 88,288 42,277 21,258"><p>DIK. MALA TO BYŤ VEVERIČKA.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="69,425 75,381 110,333 163,304 227,290 308,283 400,290 463,308 502,331 527,363 542,400 542,446 531,485 500,523 456,544 390,560 358,565 227,565 152,546 100,510 75,471"><p>AK ŤA TO UPOKOJÍ, TOTO JE OVEĽA VIAC HODNOTNÉ. POTKANY BOLI VYKYNOŽENÉ ORGANIZÁCIOU <emphasis>W.H.O.</emphasis> A SÚ NELEGÁLNE. VEVERIČKY ZMIZLI POČAS POSLEDNEJ VLNY VYHYNUTIA, TAKŽE ZBERAČI ICH BOLI SCHOPNÍ EŠTE PREDTÝM NAKLONOVAŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/12.jpg"/>
   <text-layer lang="en">
     <text-area points="15,79 15,54 33,29 69,15 123,4 208,6 254,17 281,27 296,44 302,71 292,98 269,117 235,127 158,133 83,127 44,117 19,94">
       <p>TOLD YA I SAW ONE - THE LAST WAVE WAS ONLY TEN YEARS AGO.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="317,115 323,100 344,90 400,83 446,88 469,96 479,110 477,125 463,135 435,144 400,146 365,144 335,138 321,127">
       <p>WHATEVER.</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="446,225 446,208 454,196 477,185 531,179 590,185 615,194 625,204 627,227 615,242 592,250 563,256 508,256 471,248 452,238">
       <p>WHAT'S WITH THE RAT?</p></text-area>
     <text-area points="404,485 408,444 427,406 469,381 529,367 621,367 673,377 710,398 740,440 744,475 738,513 719,542 685,565 460,565 429,542 413,519">
       <p>I HAVE NO FUCKING IDEA. ALL I KNOW IS THAT ABOUT FOUR HUNDRED PEOPLE TRIED TO KILL ME IN THE LAST HOUR, INCLUDING LANEY.</p></text-area>
   </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="15,79 15,54 33,29 69,15 123,4 208,6 254,17 281,27 296,44 302,71 292,98 269,117 235,127 158,133 83,127 44,117 19,94"><p>SOM TI VRAVEL, ŽE SOM JEDNU VIDEL - POSLEDNÁ VLNA BOLA LEN PRED DESIATIMI ROKMI.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="317,115 323,100 344,90 400,83 446,88 469,96 479,110 477,125 463,135 435,144 400,146 365,144 335,138 321,127"><p>NO A ČO.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="446,225 446,208 454,196 477,185 531,179 590,185 615,194 625,204 627,227 615,242 592,250 563,256 508,256 471,248 452,238"><p>ČO JE TO S TÝM POTKANOM?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="404,485 408,444 427,406 469,381 529,367 621,367 673,377 710,398 740,440 744,475 738,513 719,542 685,565 460,565 429,542 413,519"><p>NEMÁM ANI ŠAJNU. VŠETKO, ČO VIEM, JE, ŽE ASI ŠTYRISTO ĽUDÍ SA MA SNAŽILO ZABIŤ ZA POSLEDNÚ HODINU, VRÁTANE LANEYHO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/13.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="15,421 15,402 33,381 77,373 142,377 171,385 183,394 188,417 177,433 154,444 123,450 67,450 33,440 19,431">
          <p>WHAT'S ON THE FEED?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="806,294 758,281 727,260 710,235 706,206 713,173 733,146 775,127 852,119 921,127 960,144 983,175 990,202 983,240 963,269 917,288 852,294">
          <p>COME TAKE A LOOK. IT WAS TATOOED ON THE ARM OF THE RENT-A-NINJA THAT TRIED TO WHACK ME.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="15,421 15,402 33,381 77,373 142,377 171,385 183,394 188,417 177,433 154,444 123,450 67,450 33,440 19,431"><p>DEJE SA NIEČO?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="806,294 758,281 727,260 710,235 706,206 713,173 733,146 775,127 852,119 921,127 960,144 983,175 990,202 983,240 963,269 917,288 852,294"><p>POĎ SA POZRIEŤ. TOTO JE TETOVANIE Z RAMENA NÁJOMNÉHO NINJU, KTORÝ SA MA POKÚSIL ZABIŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/14.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="21,60 21,38 33,19 67,4 125,2 179,4 204,17 221,33 223,54 217,75 194,83 181,96 125,102 65,98 31,79">
          <p>WHAT HAVE YOU CHECKED SO FAR?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="171,158 171,127 188,100 217,81 275,69 342,69 394,79 425,100 438,121 442,148 435,179 410,204 363,219 302,225 231,217 194,200 175,175">
          <p>JUST THE NEWS FEEDS AND PHOTO POOLS. ALL THE PUBLIC STUFF. NOTHING SHOWS UP.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="675,79 663,56 663,29 675,13 688,2 869,2 885,17 892,40 890,60 873,85 838,100 808,104 740,104 706,96 683,88">
          <p>ASHER, CAN I GET A ZETTABIT CABLE FEED HERE?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="646,167 646,140 656,121 679,108 702,104 727,110 752,115 815,113 831,127 838,142 840,165 827,183 796,198 738,204 677,196 656,181">
          <p>YEAH. THE BOX ON YOUR RIGHT.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="21,60 21,38 33,19 67,4 125,2 179,4 204,17 221,33 223,54 217,75 194,83 181,96 125,102 65,98 31,79"><p>ČO SI ZATIAĽ NAŠIEL?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="171,158 171,127 188,100 217,81 275,69 342,69 394,79 425,100 438,121 442,148 435,179 410,204 363,219 302,225 231,217 194,200 175,175"><p>LEN NIEKOĽKO OBYČAJNÝCH SPRÁV, FOTIEK. VŠETKO VEREJNÉ INFO, NIČ ZAUJÍMAVÉ.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="675,79 663,56 663,29 675,13 688,2 869,2 885,17 892,40 890,60 873,85 838,100 808,104 740,104 706,96 683,88"><p>ASHER, MÔŽEM SI OD TEBA POŽIČAŤ ZETTABIT KÁBEL?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="646,167 646,140 656,121 679,108 702,104 727,110 752,115 815,113 831,127 838,142 840,165 827,183 796,198 738,204 677,196 656,181"><p>JASNE, BOX NAPRAVO OD TEBA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/15.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="483,88 483,60 500,38 544,21 600,17 658,23 688,35 706,58 708,85 694,110 652,127 598,133 531,127 498,113 488,96">
          <p>HAVE YOU CHECKED THE CITY SECURITY CAMS?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="646,296 631,267 631,229 640,200 665,175 713,154 775,146 854,148 906,158 948,179 969,204 977,242 969,279 942,308 881,331 800,340 710,331 669,315">
          <p>YEAH, RIGHT. DO I LOOK LIKE I HAVE A ZBIT ETHERNET PORT INTO MY BRAIN? JUST HACK THE SEC CAMS AND CUT THE CRAP.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="483,88 483,60 500,38 544,21 600,17 658,23 688,35 706,58 708,85 694,110 652,127 598,133 531,127 498,113 488,96"><p>PREZREL SI UŽ BEZPEČNOSTNÉ KAMERY?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="646,296 631,267 631,229 640,200 665,175 713,154 775,146 854,148 906,158 948,179 969,204 977,242 969,279 942,308 881,331 800,340 710,331 669,315"><p>HMM, VYZERÁM AKO BY SOM MAL Z-BIT ETERNET PORT NAPOJENÝ NA MÔJ MOZOG? NEVYMÝŠĽAJ A NAPOJ SA NA BEZPEČNOSTNÉ KAMERY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/16.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="44,396 963,396 963,535 44,533" type="commentary">
          <p>LANEY ZOOMED IN ON THE IMAGES JULIUS HAD RECORDED AND CONSTRUCTED A TRAINING SET FOR HER GAUSSIAN CLASSIFIERS AND PATTERN RECOGNITION SUB-ROUTINES. SHE SHUT DOWN HER HIGHER COGNITIVE FUNCTIONS AND BOOSTED BLOOD FLOW TO HER INFERIOR TEMPORAL CORTEX.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
<text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="44,396 963,396 963,535 44,533" type="commentary"><p>LANEY SA ZAMERALA NA OBRAZY, KTORÉ ZAZNAMENAL JULIUS A VYTVORILA TRÉNINGOVÚ SADU PRE JEJ GAUSSOV KLASIFIKÁTOR A SUBRUTINY PRE ROZOZNÁVANIE VZOROV. VYPLA SVOJE VYŠŠIE KOGNITÍVNE FUNKCIE A NASMEROVALA PRÚD KRVI DO SVOJHO SPÁNKOVÉHO LALOKU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/17.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="19,373 323,373 323,586 18,584" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
          <p>THE IMAGES WASHED OVER HER. HUNDREDS OF THOUSANDS PER SECOND, FLOODING HER NEURAL PATHWAYS. THE DATA FLOW WOULD HAVE FRIED A CONSCIOUS BRAIN IN UNDER A SECOND. BUT SHE WASN'T PROCESSING AT A CONSCIOUS LEVEL, THE IMAGES WEREN'T EVEN HITTING HER LATERAL GENICULATE NUCLEUS. SOMEWHERE DOWN IN THE TEMPORAL CORTEX, SYNAPSES WERE OSCILLATING LIKE MAD, FORMING CONNECTIONS, SORTING DATA, BUILDING ORDER OUT OF NOISE.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
<text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="19,373 323,373 323,586 18,584" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>ÚPLNE JU ZAPLAVILI OBRAZY, STOVKY ČI AŽ TISÍCE ZA SEKUNDU PRECHÁDZAJÚCE CEZ JEJ NEURÁLNE SPOJENIA. DÁTOVÝ TOK BY USMAŽIL MOZOG PRI PLNOM VEDOMÍ ZA MENEJ AKO JEDNU SEKUNDU. ALE ONA NESPRACOVÁVALA DÁTA PRI PLNOM VEDOMÍ, OBRAZY ANI LEN NEDOSAHOVALI JEJ LATERÁLNY UZLOVITÝ NUKLEUS. NIEKDE DOLE V SPÁNKOVOM LALOKU SYNAPSIE KMITALI AKO DIVÉ, FORMUJÚC SPOJENIA, TRIEDIAC DÁTA A VYTVÁRAJÚC PORIADOK Z CHAOSU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/18.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="865,71 865,50 885,35 906,31 954,31 977,40 988,56 985,73 971,85 942,92 896,92 875,83">
          <p>GOT IT.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="865,71 865,50 885,35 906,31 954,31 977,40 988,56 985,73 971,85 942,92 896,92 875,83"><p>MÁM TO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/19.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="56,158 38,129 33,102 44,71 73,46 125,29 200,23 288,31 333,50 360,77 365,110 354,144 313,173 258,188 154,190 90,177">
          <p>THERE'S A HIGH CONCENTRATION OF MEAN-LOOKING DUDES SPORTING THOSE TATTOOS HERE.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="542,117 546,79 575,44 633,19 721,4 838,4 917,23 965,52 988,94 988,135 965,173 900,206 817,219 706,219 619,204 569,175 546,144">
          <p>I'D SAY THE ODDS OF A RANDOM DISTRIBUTION CLUSTERING AROUND A LOCATION THIS SIZE ARE ABOUT ONE IN TWO TO THE 186<sup>TH</sup> POWER - IT'S BASICALLY IMPOSSIBLE. IS THAT WHAT I THINK IT IS?</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="56,158 38,129 33,102 44,71 73,46 125,29 200,23 288,31 333,50 360,77 365,110 354,144 313,173 258,188 154,190 90,177"><p>TU JE VEĽKÁ KONCENTRÁCIA DRSNE VYZERAJÚCICH TÝPKOV S ROVNAKÝMI TETOVANIAMI.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="542,117 546,79 575,44 633,19 721,4 838,4 917,23 965,52 988,94 988,135 965,173 900,206 817,219 706,219 619,204 569,175 546,144"><p>POVEDAL BY SOM, ŽE PRAVDEPODOBNOSŤ NÁHODNEJ DISTRIBÚCIE ZHLUKUJÚCEJ SA OKOLO MIESTA TEJTO VEĽKOSTI JE JEDNA K DVOM NA 186-TU - TO JE V PODSTATE ÚPLNE NEMOŽNÉ. JE TO TO, ČO SI MYSLÍM?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/20.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="19,177 15,142 25,94 54,56 127,25 235,13 354,17 442,35 496,71 521,113 521,175 490,223 419,258 331,273 210,273 131,263 65,235 31,202">
          <p>MEGA-CATHEDRAL FOR THE FIRST CHURCH OF TEXAS. THE BIGGEST GOD CONGLOMERATE IN THE COUNTRY, AND THE LARGEST SINGLE CONTRIBUTOR TO POLITICAL PARTIES OF ALL STRIPES. PROBABLY ONE OF THE FIVE MOST POWERFUL CORPORATIONS IN THE WORLD.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="19,177 15,142 25,94 54,56 127,25 235,13 354,17 442,35 496,71 521,113 521,175 490,223 419,258 331,273 210,273 131,263 65,235 31,202"><p>MEGA KATEDRÁLA PRE PRVÝ KOSTOL V TEXASE. NAJVÄČŠÍ BOŽÍ KONGLOMERÁT V KRAJINE, A NAJVÄČŠÍ PRISPIEVATEĽ POLITICKÝCH STRÁN VŠETKÝCH FARIEB. A PRAVDEPODOBNE JEDNA Z PIATICH NAJMOCNEJŠÍCH KORPORÁCIÍ NA SVETE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/21.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="20,54 13,44 14,33 24,23 46,16 73,14 108,18 125,28 129,36 128,48 114,58 93,63 43,61 26,58">
          <p>SO WHAT'S WITH THE INK?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="1,321 1,234 30,213 73,195 103,190 240,190 284,201 318,221 338,246 339,305 320,331 280,353 216,366 158,369 76,361 41,353 15,335">
          <p>WELL, THE STAR IN THE CENTER IS A RELIGIOUS MARK - FIRST SHOWS UP IN URUK ABOUT 4000 YEARS AGO. IT BECAME THE CITY SEAL OF JERUSALEM, AND WAS CO-OPTED BY THE CHRISTIANS PRETTY EARLY ON. USUALLY REFERS TO THE STAR THAT THE WISE MEN FOLLOWED TO REACH BETHLEHEM, OR IN OTHER WORDS A SYMBOL OF THE BIRTH OF CHRIST.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="20,54 13,44 14,33 24,23 46,16 73,14 108,18 125,28 129,36 128,48 114,58 93,63 43,61 26,58"><p>A ČO TÁ KRESBA?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="1,321 1,234 30,213 73,195 103,190 240,190 284,201 318,221 338,246 339,305 320,331 280,353 216,366 158,369 76,361 41,353 15,335"><p>NO, TÁ HVIEZDA V STREDE JE NÁBOŽENSKÉ ZNAMENIE - PRVÝKRÁT SA OBJAVUJE V URUKU OKOLO ROKU 4000 PRED NAŠIM LETOPOČTOM. BOLA ZÁROVEŇ MESTKOU PEČAŤOU JERUZALEMA A BOLA NÁSLEDNE POUŽÍVANÁ KRESŤANMI. ZVYČAJNE SA SPOMÍNA V SÚVISLOSTI S MUDRCMI, KTORÍ SLEDOVALI HVIEZDU AŽ DO BETLÉMA ALEBO INÝMI SLOVAMI - SYMBOL ZRODENIA JEŽIŠA KRISTA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/22.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="15,67 17,52 35,33 83,21 135,17 238,17 298,27 327,46 331,69 317,85 290,98 233,106 165,108 83,104 46,96 23,81">
          <p>IS THERE A REASON YOU KNOW SO MUCH ABOUT THIS?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="454,213 388,200 354,183 327,150 319,119 317,94 329,88 340,75 340,56 338,48 356,29 396,8 429,2 567,4 610,17 644,38 665,67 671,108 663,146 646,173 617,192 569,206 504,213">
          <p>THIS ISN'T THE FIRST TIME I'VE SEEN THAT MARK. LET ME SHOW YOU SOMETHING, AND THEN I'LL TELL YOU WHAT'S IN THOSE VIALS JULIUS IS CARRYING AROUND.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="15,67 17,52 35,33 83,21 135,17 238,17 298,27 327,46 331,69 317,85 290,98 233,106 165,108 83,104 46,96 23,81"><p>EXISTUJE NEJAKÝ DÔVOD, ŽE O TOM VIEŠ TAK VEĽA?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="454,213 388,200 354,183 327,150 319,119 317,94 329,88 340,75 340,56 338,48 356,29 396,8 429,2 567,4 610,17 644,38 665,67 671,108 663,146 646,173 617,192 569,206 504,213"><p>NIE JE TO PO PRVÝ-KRÁT, ČO VIDÍM TEN ZNAK. UKÁŽEM VÁM NIEČO A POTOM VÁM POVIEM, ČO JE V TÝCH AMPULKÁCH, KTORÉ PRENÁŠA JULIUS.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/23.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="31,188 10,154 4,113 15,73 40,38 90,15 138,4 321,4 375,21 415,44 435,79 442,121 429,169 402,200 333,227 265,238 146,233 77,219 48,202">
          <p>THESE ARE SEC CAM FEEDS FROM A FIRST CHURCH FACILITY IN TEXAS. I CAME ACROSS THIS A COUPLE OF YEARS AGO WHILE HACKING AROUND FOR DATA ON THEIR TERRAFORMING RESEARCH.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="458,500 452,469 458,431 479,402 525,381 594,371 704,373 763,383 810,408 829,452 829,488 810,523 769,548 698,565 585,565 525,552 481,531">
          <p>THEY'RE BIG INTO DESERT RECLAMATION IN THE PAN-ARAB OCCUPIED TERRITORIES, SINCE THE OCCUPIERS ARE MOSTLY FIRST CHURCH SETTLERS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="31,188 10,154 4,113 15,73 40,38 90,15 138,4 321,4 375,21 415,44 435,79 442,121 429,169 402,200 333,227 265,238 146,233 77,219 48,202"><p>TOTO SÚ ZÁZNAMY Z BEZPEČNOSTNÝCH KAMIER Z PRVEJ BUDOVY KOSTOLA V TEXASE. NAĎABIL SOM NA TO PÁR ROKOV DOZADU PRI HACKOVANÍ DÁT O ICH VÝSKUME TERRAFORMINGU.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="458,500 452,469 458,431 479,402 525,381 594,371 704,373 763,383 810,408 829,452 829,488 810,523 769,548 698,565 585,565 525,552 481,531"><p>ZAOBERAJÚ SA HLAVNE REKULTIVÁCIOU PÚŠTE V PANARABSKÝCH TERITÓRIÁCH, KEĎŽE ICH OKUPANTI SÚ HLAVNE VYZNÁVAČI PRVÉHO KOSTOLA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/24.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="69,358 54,327 58,296 79,273 121,254 192,244 296,246 354,254 394,273 410,292 417,319 410,348 381,373 333,390 269,398 169,394 106,383">
          <p>YOU'RE STILL IN ON THAT ARTIFICIAL CLIMATE - SHIFT SCAM? I'M TELLING YOU MAN, ANTARCTICA IS NOT GOING GREEN.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="494,344 485,313 496,281 529,258 596,244 721,242 785,250 825,269 846,290 850,317 840,346 806,369 735,385 617,388 550,377 510,360">
          <p>IT IS GOING GREEN, AND I HAPPEN TO OWN A SIZEABLE CHUNK OF IT NOW. BUT THAT'S BESIDE THE POINT.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="69,358 54,327 58,296 79,273 121,254 192,244 296,246 354,254 394,273 410,292 417,319 410,348 381,373 333,390 269,398 169,394 106,383"><p>STÁLE SA ZAOBERÁŠ TÝM NEZMYSLOM OHĽADOM ZMENY KLÍMY? HOVORÍM TI, ANTARKTÍDA ZELENÁ NEBUDE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="494,344 485,313 496,281 529,258 596,244 721,242 785,250 825,269 846,290 850,317 840,346 806,369 735,385 617,388 550,377 510,360"><p>VER MI, ZELENÁ BUDE A DOKONCA UŽ VLASTNÍM AJ JEJ NEMALÚ ČASŤ. ALE O TO TERAZ NEJDE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/25.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="38,108 21,83 25,52 50,31 102,21 190,19 240,31 265,48 273,71 267,96 240,115 190,125 100,127 63,119">
          <p>SO WHAT ARE WE LOOKING AT? DESIGNER CASKETS?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="488,504 479,475 479,438 492,410 525,383 585,363 669,352 806,352 888,367 942,388 971,415 985,450 979,488 958,519 919,544 867,558 835,565 617,565 552,550 510,531">
          <p>SORT OF. THESE ARE LONG-TERM CRYO TANKS. I'VE COMPARED THE PHOTOS OVER A ONE-YEAR TIME SERIES. THEY REPLACE YOUR BLOOD WITH SALINE AT SEVEN DEGREES, A LITTLE GLUCOSE MIXED IN. THEN THEY KILL YOU. FOR SIX MONTHS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="38,108 21,83 25,52 50,31 102,21 190,19 240,31 265,48 273,71 267,96 240,115 190,125 100,127 63,119"><p>TAK NAČO SA TEDA POZERÁME? DIZAJNY RAKIEV?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="488,504 479,475 479,438 492,410 525,383 585,363 669,352 806,352 888,367 942,388 971,415 985,450 979,488 958,519 919,544 867,558 835,565 617,565 552,550 510,531"><p>NIEČO PODOBNÉ. TOTO SÚ DLHODOBÉ KRYO KOMORY. POROVNAL SOM FOTOGRAFIE ZA POSLEDNÝ ROK. VYMENIA TVOJU KRV ZA SOĽNÝ ROZTOK PRI SIEDMYCH STUPNOCH CELZIA, PRIMIEŠAJÚ TROCHA GLUKÓZY. POTOM ŤA ZABIJÚ. NA ŠESŤ MESIACOV.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/26.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="6,8 371,8 371,558 10,558" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
          <p>AT THREE MONTHS THEY OPEN UP YOUR CHEST, AND DROP IN ONE OF THESE. TOP-OF-THE-LINE ARTIFICIAL HEART.</p><p>AFTER FOUR MONTHS THEY SHOVE A WIRE UP YOUR SPINAL COLUMN AND TAP INTO YOUR VENTRAL PUTAMEN, THE PART OF THE BRAIN THAT PROCESSES FEELINGS OF REWARD.</p><p>AT FIVE MONTHS THEY GIVE YOU A PRETTY STANDARD SET OF NINJA-MODS - ENHANCED REFLEXES, DERM-ARMOR, REINFORCED JOINTS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="6,8 371,8 371,558 10,558" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>PO TROCH MESIACOCH TI OTVORIA HRUĎ A VLOŽIA TI TAM JEDNO Z NAJNOVŠÍCH UMELÝCH SŔDC.</p><p>PO ŠTYROCH MESIACOCH TI VLOŽIA DO MIECHOVÉHO KANÁLU KÁBEL A NAPOJA NA MOZOG ... NA JEHO ČASŤ, KTORÁ SPRACOVÁVA POCITY USPOKOJENIA.</p><p>PO PIATICH MESIACOCH TI DAJÚ SADU ŠTANDARDNÝCH NINJA MODIFIKÁCIÍ - VYLEPŠENÉ REFLEXY, KOŽNĚ BRNENIE A VYSTUŽENÉ KĹBY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/27.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="169,144 156,108 156,69 173,33 219,4 560,4 602,33 623,79 617,123 579,165 506,194 390,202 283,194 213,177">
          <p>SO NOW YOU'VE GOT A JACKED-UP SOLDIER WHO CAN RUN 280 BEATS-PER-MINUTE AND WILL DO ANYTHING YOU WANT AS LONG AS YOU KEEP RUNNING A CURRENT THROUGH HIS BRAIN.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="288,350 273,321 271,275 292,238 340,213 442,213 513,202 569,217 604,246 621,279 617,327 592,360 544,385 481,394 396,396 329,379">
          <p>EXACTLY. PLUS HE'S PRETTY FUCKING ZOMBIED FROM BEING DEAD FOR SIX MONTHS. NOT VERY HARD TO PSYCHO-MANIPULATE. NOW, ZOOM IN.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="288,350 273,321 271,275 292,238 340,213 442,213 513,202 569,217 604,246 621,279 617,327 592,360 544,385 481,394 396,396 329,379"><p>PRESNE TAK. NAVYŠE JE TO V PODSTATE ZOMBIE ŠESŤ MESIACOV PO SMRTI. NIE JE ŤAŽKÉ HO ZMANIPULOVAŤ. POZRIME SA NA TO BLIŽŠIE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="169,144 156,108 156,69 173,33 219,4 560,4 602,33 623,79 617,123 579,165 506,194 390,202 283,194 213,177"><p>TAKŽE TERAZ MÁŠ V PODSTATE VOJAKA, KTORÝ DOKÁŽE BEŽAŤ S TEPOM 280 ZA MINÚTU A UROBÍ HOCIČO, POKIAĽ JEHO MOZGOM BUDE PRECHÁDZAŤ ELEKTRICKÝ PRÚD.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/28.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/29.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="30,50 9,44 4,38 5,29 20,20 45,18 88,20 101,29 101,40 90,48 64,51" text-rotation="0">
          <p>HOLY SHIT.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="69,69 70,59 74,55 89,53 105,49 143,50 155,58 156,68 144,78 114,80 91,79 78,75">
          <p>EXACTLY.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="180,78 166,71 163,65 161,54 171,44 194,39 234,38 256,44 269,53 269,64 261,73 244,79 220,80">
          <p>WHAT'S "DAYENDER?"</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="178,164 170,145 170,126 178,108 196,93 233,85 285,86 314,95 331,111 338,138 330,163 311,180 278,189 231,189 196,181">
          <p>I'M NOT SURE. BUT I THINK YOU'LL GET AN IDEA ONCE YOU SEE WHAT'S IN THOSE LITTLE GLASS VIALS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="30,50 9,44 4,38 5,29 20,20 45,18 88,20 101,29 101,40 90,48 64,51" text-rotation="0"><p>SAKRA.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="69,69 70,59 74,55 89,53 105,49 143,50 155,58 156,68 144,78 114,80 91,79 78,75"><p>PRESNE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="178,164 170,145 170,126 178,108 196,93 233,85 285,86 314,95 331,111 338,138 330,163 311,180 278,189 231,189 196,181"><p>NIE SOM SI ISTÝ. ALE MYSLÍM, ŽE SI UROBÍŠ PREDSTAVU, KEĎ UVIDÍŠ, ČO JE V TÝCH SKLENENÝCH AMPULKÁCH.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="180,78 166,71 163,65 161,54 171,44 194,39 234,38 256,44 269,53 269,64 261,73 244,79 220,80"><p>ČO JE "DAYENDER?"</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/30.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="23,104 40,92 85,79 175,71 335,73 398,85 423,102 423,117 402,131 321,146 225,148 113,144 56,135 29,123">
          <p>LET ME GUESS, IT'S NOT METHOXYHENETHYLAMINE-7.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="508,146 448,133 429,123 433,108 429,90 400,79 410,58 450,33 552,17 700,17 794,29 838,46 860,67 858,98 831,123 767,144 694,150 560,150">
          <p>RIGHT. IT'S NOT A DRUG AT ALL. IT'S BACTERIUM. MORE SPECIFICALLY, <emphasis>YERSINIA PESTIS,</emphasis> BETTER KNOWN AS BUBONIC PLAGUE.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="825,221 794,210 785,202 781,188 785,173 815,160 865,156 923,160 950,173 956,188 948,206 919,219 873,223">
          <p>THE BLACK DEATH.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="23,104 40,92 85,79 175,71 335,73 398,85 423,102 423,117 402,131 321,146 225,148 113,144 56,135 29,123"><p>NECHAJ MA HÁDAŤ, NIE JE TO METHOXYHENETHYLAMINE-7.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="508,146 448,133 429,123 433,108 429,90 400,79 410,58 450,33 552,17 700,17 794,29 838,46 860,67 858,98 831,123 767,144 694,150 560,150"><p>SPRÁVNE. NIE JE TO VÔBEC DROGA. JE TO BAKTÉRIA. PRESNEJŠIE, <emphasis>YERSINIA PESTIS,</emphasis> ZNÁMEJŠIA POD MENOM BUBONICKÝ MOR.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="825,221 794,210 785,202 781,188 785,173 815,160 865,156 923,160 950,173 956,188 948,206 919,219 873,223"><p>ČIERNA SMRŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/31.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="471,302 417,258 396,202 398,135 429,83 500,40 638,15 815,19 921,44 971,69 998,102 996,252 944,298 842,329 735,340 631,335 535,323">
          <p>BUT IT GETS WORSE. WILD <emphasis>YERSINIA PESTIS</emphasis> ISN'T DANGEROUS - WITH CONVENTIONAL ANTIBIOTIC TREATMENTS, ONLY ABOUT 10% OF INFECTIONS ARE FATAL. BUT WHEN THE BACTERIA MUTATES, IT CAN BECOME DRUG RESISTANT. AND WHAT YOU PICKED UP ON THE BARGE CITIES, JULIUS, ISN'T WILD <emphasis>PESTIS</emphasis> - IT'S A TOTALLY CUSTOM BUILD. DRUG-RESISTANT DOESN'T EVEN BEGIN TO DESCRIBE HOW TOUGH THIS FUCKER IS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="471,302 417,258 396,202 398,135 429,83 500,40 638,15 815,19 921,44 971,69 998,102 996,252 944,298 842,329 735,340 631,335 535,323"><p>JE TO EŠTE HORŠIE. OBYČAJNÁ <emphasis>YERSINIA PESTIS</emphasis> NIE JE AŽ TAK NEBEZPEČNÁ - S KONVENČNÝMI ANTIBIOTIKAMI LEN OKOLO 10% PRÍPADOV JE SMRTEĽNÝCH. ALE KEĎ TÁ BAKTÉRIA ZMUTUJE, MÔŽE SA STAŤ REZISTENTNOU. A TO ČO SI PRINIESOL Z VODNÉHO MESTA, JULIUS, NIE JE OBYČAJNÁ <emphasis>PESTIS</emphasis> - JE UMELO VYTVORENÁ. POJEM REZISTENTNOSŤ VOČI ANTIBIOTIKÁM ANI ZĎALEKA NEOPISUJE, AKÁ ODOLNÁ TÁTO BAKTÉRIA JE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/32.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="140,121 281,121 281,179 140,179">
          <p>BACTERIAL CHROMOSOME</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="713,83 825,83 825,121 713,117">
          <p>PLASMIDS</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="13,350 992,350 992,565 10,565" bgcolor="#000000" type="commentary" inverted="True">
          <p>"SPECIFICALLY, IT HAS AN EXTREMELY HIGH NUMBER OF PLASMIDS - THESE CIRCULAR STRANDS OF DNA YOU SEE HERE OUTSIDE THE CHROMOSOMAL DNA. THE PLASMIDS CONTAIN WHAT ARE CALLED "GENE CASSETTES" - ESSENTIALLY BITS OF DNA THAT CAN INSERT THEMSELVES INTO THE CHROMOSOMA. WITH THE NUMBER AND VARIETY OF PLASMIDS YOU SEE HERE, THIS THING COULD EVOLVE ORDERS OF MAGNITUDE FASTER THAN OUR ABILITY TO DEVELOP NEW ANTIBIOTICS."</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="140,121 281,121 281,179 140,179"><p>CHROMOZÓM BAKTÉRIE</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="713,83 825,83 825,121 713,117"><p>PLAZMIDY</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="13,350 992,350 992,565 10,565" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>"PRESNEJŠIE, MÁ EXTRÉMNE VYSOKÝ POČET PLAZMIDOV - TÝCHTO OKRÚHLYCH VLÁKIEN DNA, KTORÉ VIDNO V OKOLÍ CHROMOZOMÁLNEJ DNA. PLAZMIDY OBSAHUJÚ TAKZVANÉ "GÉNOVÉ KAZETY" - V PODSTATE KÚSKY DNA, KTORÉ SA DOKÁŽU UMIESTNIŤ DO CHROMOZOMÁLNEJ DNA A VYTVORIŤ ZMUTOVANÉ VERZIE BAKTÉRIE. S POČTOM A RÔZNORODOSŤOU PLAZMIDOV, KTORÉ TU VIDÍŠ. TÁTO VEC SA DOKÁŽE VYVÍJAŤ RÝCHLEJŠIE AKO NAŠA SCHOPNOSŤ VYTVÁRAŤ NOVÉ ANTIBIOTIKÁ."</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/33.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="235,88 206,81 188,58 190,33 206,15 231,4 281,4 308,15 321,33 321,60 308,77 277,88">
          <p>THAT SOUNDS BAD.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="267,98 296,94 325,79 335,50 333,35 402,17 521,6 754,6 871,21 950,50 973,81 975,106 956,138 885,167 769,183 615,188 456,183 344,165 281,133">
          <p>IT'S VERY BAD. I RAN A SIMULATION ON THE TRANSMISSION RATES AND MORBIDITY ASSUMING A SMALL INITIAL INFECTION BASE IN NEW YORK CITY. THIS IS WHAT IT LOOKS LIKE WITHIN ONE YEAR. THE RED AREAS ARE 100% KILL ZONES. OVER 200 MILLION DEAD.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="235,88 206,81 188,58 190,33 206,15 231,4 281,4 308,15 321,33 321,60 308,77 277,88"><p>TO NEZNIE DOBRE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="267,98 296,94 325,79 335,50 333,35 402,17 521,6 754,6 871,21 950,50 973,81 975,106 956,138 885,167 769,183 615,188 456,183 344,165 281,133"><p>JE TO VEĽMI ZLÉ. ZBEHOL SOM SIMULÁCIU PRENOSU A ÚMRTNOSTI POČÍTAJÚC S MALOU POČIATOČNOU INFEKČNOU BÁZOU V NEW YORK CITY. TU JE, AKO TO VYZERÁ O ROK NESKÔR. ČERVENÉ OBLASTI NA MAPE SÚ ZÓNY SO 100%-NOU ÚMRTNOSŤOU. VYŠE 200 MILIÓNOV MŔTVYCH.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/34.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="6,106 4,54 23,29 50,10 79,4 173,4 206,15 231,35 244,67 244,104 229,129 190,154 150,163 102,163 46,152 19,131">
          <p>AND THIS IS WHERE THE RAT COMES IN, RIGHT? IT'S SPREAD BY RATS.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="252,117 256,90 254,48 285,21 327,4 931,4 979,31 996,48 996,121 954,154 852,183 694,198 506,196 377,181 300,160 263,138 252,121">
          <p>SORT OF. RATS ARE IMPORTANT, BUT THEY'RE NOT THE WHOLE STORY. IT'S ACTUALLY SPREAD BY FLEAS THAT LIVE ON RATS. THE FLEAS BITE THE RATS, INGEST THE BACTERIA ALONG WITH THE BLOOD THEY SUCK OUT, AND THEN SOME OF THAT BACTERIA IS REGURGITATED INTO THE NEXT ORGANISM BITTEN BY THE FLEA.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="173,221 173,202 185,190 215,179 267,173 317,175 344,183 369,190 381,204 381,219 367,238 317,248 269,250 213,246 185,235">
          <p>WHICH COULD BE A PERSON.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="398,308 354,310 327,300 319,285 325,269 348,258 390,256 421,263 433,275 433,292 419,304">
          <p>RIGHT.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="544,319 544,296 556,279 592,269 652,271 679,281 690,296 685,323 667,335 621,344 579,340 556,331">
          <p>FUCKING GROSS.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="6,106 4,54 23,29 50,10 79,4 173,4 206,15 231,35 244,67 244,104 229,129 190,154 150,163 102,163 46,152 19,131"><p>A TU PRICHÁDZAJÚ NA SCÉNU NAŠE POTKANY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="252,117 256,90 254,48 285,21 327,4 931,4 979,31 996,48 996,121 954,154 852,183 694,198 506,196 377,181 300,160 263,138 252,121"><p>DÁ SA POVEDAŤ. POTKANY SÚ DÔLEŽITÉ, ALE NIELEN ONY. ŠÍRI SA TO V SKUTOČNOSTI BLCHAMI, KTORÉ ŽIJÚ NA POTKANOCH. BLCHY POHRYZNÚ POTKANY, PRIČOM VSTREBAJÚ BAKTÉRIE SPOLU S KRVOU, KTORÚ NASAJÚ A POTOM TIE BAKTÉRIE PREDAJÚ INÉMU ORGANIZMU, KTORÝ JE NIMI POHRYZENÝ NESKÔR.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="173,221 173,202 185,190 215,179 267,173 317,175 344,183 369,190 381,204 381,219 367,238 317,248 269,250 213,246 185,235"><p>ČO MÔŽE BYŤ AJ ČLOVEK.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="398,308 354,310 327,300 319,285 325,269 348,258 390,256 421,263 433,275 433,292 419,304"><p>SPRÁVNE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="544,319 544,296 556,279 592,269 652,271 679,281 690,296 685,323 667,335 621,344 579,340 556,331"><p>KURVA NECHUTNÉ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/35.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="56,125 21,104 8,77 17,48 75,21 160,4 533,4 617,23 658,44 671,63 669,90 625,123 519,148 310,154 163,148 94,138" text-rotation="0">
          <p>SO LET'S PIECE THIS TOGETHER. WE'VE GOT A BUNCH OF CYBORG ZOMBIES RUNNING AROUND WITH METAL HEARTS AND BRAIN CONTROL, WHO CAME OUT OF SOME PROJECT CALLED "DAYENDER."</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="673,104 683,77 675,50 694,29 742,8 779,4 908,4 963,23 985,46 996,75 985,108 960,133 910,150 783,152 733,146 698,133">
          <p>A RELIGIOUS SYMBOL THAT REFERS TO THE BIRTH, OR PERHAPS THE REBIRTH, OF CHRIST.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="500,244 475,225 469,202 475,179 506,158 552,150 594,142 696,144 733,156 763,160 785,181 792,200 781,227 750,246 681,258 583,260 533,252" text-rotation="0">
          <p>TWO OUT OF THREE INGREDIENTS FOR CREATING A SERIOUS PANDEMIC.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="715,565 685,550 673,529 681,508 713,490 760,479 888,479 935,492 965,510 967,531 954,552 923,565">
          <p>AND NO <emphasis>M7</emphasis>. THIS SOUNDS LIKE A TOTALLY SHIT DEAL.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="56,125 21,104 8,77 17,48 75,21 160,4 533,4 617,23 658,44 671,63 669,90 625,123 519,148 310,154 163,148 94,138" text-rotation="0"><p>TAK SI TO ZHRŇME. MÁME TU SKUPINU KYBORGOVÝCH ZOMBIE, KTORÍ BEHAJÚ S UMELÝMI SRDCAMI A S ELEKTRONICKY OVLÁDANÝMI MOZGAMI, A KTORÍ VZNIKLI Z PROJEKTU "DAYENDER".</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="673,104 683,77 675,50 694,29 742,8 779,4 908,4 963,23 985,46 996,75 985,108 960,133 910,150 783,152 733,146 698,133"><p>RELIGIÓZNY SYMBOL, KTORÝ PRIPOMÍNA NARODENIE ALEBO ZNOVUZRODENIE KRISTA.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="500,244 475,225 469,202 475,179 506,158 552,150 594,142 696,144 733,156 763,160 785,181 792,200 781,227 750,246 681,258 583,260 533,252" text-rotation="0"><p>DVE Z TROCH INGREDIENCIÍ NA VYTVORENIE NEBEZPEČNEJ PANDÉMIE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="715,565 685,550 673,529 681,508 713,490 760,479 888,479 935,492 965,510 967,531 954,552 923,565"><p>A ŽIADEN <emphasis>M7</emphasis>. TO VYZERÁ AKO KURVA ZLÝ OBCHOD.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/36.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="69,98 33,88 13,63 13,35 27,15 58,4 148,4 175,19 183,44 179,69 150,90 117,98" text-rotation="0">
          <p>YOU READ YOUR BIBLE MUCH?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="196,163 165,156 146,133 146,102 165,92 185,79 248,79 271,92 281,113 275,142 254,156 225,163">
          <p>EVERY FUCKING NIGHT.</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="533,260 402,242 310,210 265,165 285,148 294,113 281,88 265,75 288,42 350,4 910,4 967,35 998,75 998,156 958,200 858,240 713,260" text-rotation="0">
          <p>WELL, YOU KNOW THE BIT IN REVELATIONS ABOUT FOUR HORSEMEN OF THE APOCALYPSE AND THE SEVEN SEALS? WHEN THE FOURTH SEAL IS BROKEN, YOU GET THE FOUR HORSEMEN: "ITS RIDER WAS NAMED DEATH, AND HADES WAS FOLLOWING CLOSE BEHIND HIM. THEY WERE GIVEN POWER OVER A FOURTH OF THE EARTH TO KILL BY SWORD, FAMINE AND PLAGUE, AND BY THE WILD BEASTS OF THE EARTH."</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="69,98 33,88 13,63 13,35 27,15 58,4 148,4 175,19 183,44 179,69 150,90 117,98" text-rotation="0"><p>ČÍTAŠ SI ČASTO BIBLIU?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="196,163 165,156 146,133 146,102 165,92 185,79 248,79 271,92 281,113 275,142 254,156 225,163"><p>KAŽDÚ SKURVENÚ NOC.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="533,260 402,242 310,210 265,165 285,148 294,113 281,88 265,75 288,42 350,4 910,4 967,35 998,75 998,156 958,200 858,240 713,260" text-rotation="0"><p>TAKŽE POZNÁŠ TEN PRÍBEH ZO ZJAVENÍ O ŠTYROCH JAZDCOCH APOKALYPSY A SIEDMICH PEČATIACH? AK JE ZLOMENÁ ŠTVRTÁ PEČAŤ, ŠTVRTÝ JAZDEC JE PREPUSTENÝ: "NAZÝVAL SA SMRŤ A HÁDES HO TESNE NASLEDOVAL. A ZÍSKALI MOC NAD ŠTVRTINOU ZEME, ABY ZABÍJALI MEČOM, HLADOM ALEBO MOROM ČI DIVOKÝMI ZVERAMI ZEME."</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/37.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="288,177 194,171 127,156 83,133 60,100 65,67 88,40 144,15 204,4 483,4 567,29 600,54 613,81 606,110 569,144 479,169 348,177" text-rotation="0">
          <p>ALRIGHT. SO DAYENDER. END OF DAYS. PLAGUES AND WILD BEASTS. WHAT ARE YOU SAYING, THIS IS SOME KIND OF FIRST CHURCH WHACK-JOB PLOT TO BRING ABOUT THE APOCALYPSE?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="590,144 606,125 619,108 621,92 683,75 771,71 863,77 923,100 942,127 938,163 896,190 844,202 725,204 642,192 598,167">
          <p>THAT SOUNDS ABOUT RIGHT. BUT YOU KNOW AS MUCH AS I DO. EXCEPT FOR ONE MORE THING.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="288,177 194,171 127,156 83,133 60,100 65,67 88,40 144,15 204,4 483,4 567,29 600,54 613,81 606,110 569,144 479,169 348,177" text-rotation="0"><p>V PORIADKU. TAKŽE DAYENDER, KONIEC DNÍ. MOR A DIVÉ ZVERY. HOVORÍŠ, ŽE TOTO JE PRÁCA NEJAKÉHO PRVÉHO KOSTOLA, KTORÝ PLÁNUJE CELOSVETOVÚ APOKALYPSU?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="590,144 606,125 619,108 621,92 683,75 771,71 863,77 923,100 942,127 938,163 896,190 844,202 725,204 642,192 598,167"><p>TAK NEJAKO. ALE VIEŠ TOHO ASI TOĽKO, ČO JA. OKREM JEDNEJ JEDINEJ VECI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/38.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="190,260 110,246 67,223 40,188 31,148 40,104 71,69 131,40 238,27 338,29 413,42 460,63 494,98 504,138 500,177 477,213 421,244 331,263 240,265" text-rotation="0">
          <p>WAGNER WAS HERE THIS MORNING. HE LEFT A PACKAGE. SAID HE'D BE BACK LATER TO PICK IT UP, BUT THAT IF YOU SHOWED UP FIRST, I SHOULD GIVE IT TO YOU. UNTIL NOW I HAD NO IDEA WHY HE'D WANT IT. BUT NOW IT ALL MAKES SENSE.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="190,260 110,246 67,223 40,188 31,148 40,104 71,69 131,40 238,27 338,29 413,42 460,63 494,98 504,138 500,177 477,213 421,244 331,263 240,265" text-rotation="0"><p>WAGNER TU BOL DNES RÁNO. NECHAL TU BALÍK A POVEDAL, ŽE SA NESKÔR POŇHO VRÁTI. ALE TÝM, ŽE STE SA TU OBJAVILI SKOREJ, TAK BY SOM HO MAL DAŤ VÁM. NETUŠIL SOM, PREČO BY HO CHCEL. ALE TERAZ JE MI UŽ VŠETKO JASNÉ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 4/39.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="835,117 798,108 779,85 781,65 804,48 844,40 917,42 954,52 969,67 971,88 954,104 913,115 863,119" text-rotation="0">
          <p><emphasis>XENOPSYLLA CHEOPSIS</emphasis></p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="835,117 798,108 779,85 781,65 804,48 844,40 917,42 954,52 969,67 971,88 954,104 913,115 863,119" text-rotation="0"><p><emphasis>XENOPSYLLA CHEOPSIS</emphasis></p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 4/40.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="723,110 721,85 735,65 788,46 896,46 946,58 971,79 973,104 948,129 894,142 788,142 746,131" text-rotation="0">
          <p>RAT FLEA. ALSO OFFICIALLY EXTINCT.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="723,110 721,85 735,65 788,46 896,46 946,58 971,79 973,104 948,129 894,142 788,142 746,131" text-rotation="0"><p>BLCHA MOROVÁ. OFICIÁLNE VYHYNUTÁ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/41.jpg"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="4,208 4,98 33,56 90,21 138,4 481,4 550,33 592,73 613,131 610,192 581,246 498,294 408,315 292,321 183,313 96,292 35,254" text-rotation="0">
          <p>YOU ARE NOW THE PROUD OWNERS OF THE COMPLETE PACKAGE FOR DELIVERING A WORLDWIDE BLACK DEATH PANDEMIC. I DON'T THINK I HAVE TO TELL YOU HOW VALUABLE THIS IS TO CERTAIN PARTIES. BUT YOU BETTER FIGURE OUT WHAT TO DO WITH IT PRETTY FAST, BECAUSE YOU'VE ONLY GOT ABOUT 8 HOURS LEFT BEFORE THOSE VIALS GO BAD, AT WHICH POINT I'M GUESSING YOU'LL HAVE VERY LITTLE BARGAINING POWER.</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <text-layer lang="sk">
<text-area points="4,208 4,98 33,56 90,21 138,4 481,4 550,33 592,73 613,131 610,192 581,246 498,294 408,315 292,321 183,313 96,292 35,254" text-rotation="0"><p>PRÁVE STE SA STALI HRDÝMI VLASTNÍKMI KOMPLETNÉHO BALÍKA NA VYTVORENIE CELOSVETOVEJ MOROVEJ PANDÉMIE. ASI VÁM NEMUSÍM ZDÔRAZŇOVAŤ, AKÁ CENNÁ JE TÁTO VEC PRE ISTÝ OKRUH ĽUDÍ. TAKŽE RADŠEJ RÝCHLO ZISTITE, ČO S TÝM SPRAVÍTE. PRETOŽE MÁTE IBA PRIBLIŽNE 8 HODÍN, PREDTÝM NEŽ SA AMPULKY POKAZIA A OSTANE VÁM LEN VEĽMI MALÁ SILA NA VYJEDNÁVANIE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 4/42.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="276,213 746,213 746,277 274,277" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>TO BE CONTINUED</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="276,213 746,213 746,277 274,277" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>POKRAČOVANIE NABUDÚCE</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 5</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 5</title>
      <image href="Issue 5/01.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,375 579,375 579,406 419,406" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>ISSUE 5</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,375 579,375 579,406 419,406" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>KAPITOLA 5</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/02.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="435,65 454,40 494,25 577,13 667,17 733,40 756,69 742,110 710,125 613,142 496,135 440,104" text-rotation="0"><p>I'M CONFIRMING THE DROP POINT. TRANSMITTING HASHED GEO-CORDS NOW.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="435,65 454,40 494,25 577,13 667,17 733,40 756,69 742,110 710,125 613,142 496,135 440,104" text-rotation="0"><p>POTVRDZUJEM MIESTO VÝSADKU. PRENÁŠAM KÓDOVANÉ SÚRADNICE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/03.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="204,65 201,35 205,16 214,13 314,11 323,19 324,39 324,61 319,66" text-rotation="0"><p>THAT'S NOT THE ORIGINAL DROP POINT.</p></text-area><text-area points="41,579 15,564 10,543 16,524 38,506 71,500 115,498 159,505 188,518 198,538 193,559 174,578 133,586 81,586" text-rotation="0"><p>I KNOW. IT'S NEW DROP POINT. IF YOU WANT THE GOODS YOU'LL BE HERE IN THIRTY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="204,65 201,35 205,16 214,13 314,11 323,19 324,39 324,61 319,66" text-rotation="0"><p>TO NIE JE PÔVODNÉ MIESTO STRETNUTIA.</p></text-area><text-area points="41,579 15,564 10,543 16,524 38,506 71,500 115,498 159,505 188,518 198,538 193,559 174,578 133,586 81,586" text-rotation="0"><p>VIEM. JE TO NOVÉ MIESTO. AK CHCEŠ TOVAR, BUDEŠ TU DO TRIDSIATICH MINÚT.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/04.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/05.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/06.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/07.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="67,171 58,135 73,106 106,92 171,92 204,113 210,144 200,173 158,185 98,188" text-rotation="0"><p>YOU MUST BE WAGNER.</p></text-area><text-area points="719,81 733,56 769,40 825,29 885,40 925,63 927,100 906,121 863,129 810,133 760,127 733,113" text-rotation="0"><p>NICE PLACE. COME HERE OFTEN?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="67,171 58,135 73,106 106,92 171,92 204,113 210,144 200,173 158,185 98,188" text-rotation="0"><p>TY MUSÍŠ BYŤ WAGNER.</p></text-area><text-area points="719,81 733,56 769,40 825,29 885,40 925,63 927,100 906,121 863,129 810,133 760,127 733,113" text-rotation="0"><p>PEKNÉ MIESTO. CHODIEVAŠ SEM ČASTO?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/08.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="233,42 256,19 300,4 527,0 571,17 596,42 588,65 546,85 477,98 358,98 290,90 250,75" text-rotation="0"><p>6.5 TRILLION SERVED. THAT MANY PEOPLE CAN'T BE WRONG.</p></text-area><text-area points="440,175 444,144 475,129 544,125 594,133 606,160 594,188 550,206 496,204 463,198" text-rotation="0"><p>PLEASE, SIT DOWN.</p></text-area><text-area points="317,456 329,427 367,406 446,413 481,421 506,438 515,460 504,485 479,502 423,513 365,508 327,494 317,479" text-rotation="0"><p>LET'S KEEP THIS SHORT AND SWEET.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="233,42 256,19 300,4 527,0 571,17 596,42 588,65 546,85 477,98 358,98 290,90 250,75" text-rotation="0"><p>6,5 MILIARDY ZÁKAZNÍKOV. TAK VEĽA ĽUDÍ SA NEMÔŽE MÝLIŤ.</p></text-area><text-area points="440,175 444,144 475,129 544,125 594,133 606,160 594,188 550,206 496,204 463,198" text-rotation="0"><p>PROSÍM, SADNI SI.</p></text-area><text-area points="317,456 329,427 367,406 446,413 481,421 506,438 515,460 504,485 479,502 423,513 365,508 327,494 317,479" text-rotation="0"><p>VYBAVME TO RÝCHLO A HLADKO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/09.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="44,81 65,50 117,31 208,27 288,33 340,54 356,85 331,119 263,140 165,144 90,133 56,113" text-rotation="0"><p>DO YOU KNOW WHY YOU HIRED ME FOR THIS JOB?</p></text-area><text-area points="0,252 17,221 56,196 140,183 248,183 321,196 367,229 375,254 360,288 313,308 254,321 133,321 69,313 10,283" text-rotation="0"><p>BECAUSE YOUR NANO-MOB IS THE BEST IN THE CITY. NOBODY ELSE COULD HAVE PULLED IT OFF.</p></text-area><text-area points="83,465 96,440 142,423 215,415 290,423 321,446 327,467 302,490 252,502 165,506 108,492" text-rotation="0"><p>DO YOU KNOW WHY WE'RE THE BEST?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="44,81 65,50 117,31 208,27 288,33 340,54 356,85 331,119 263,140 165,144 90,133 56,113" text-rotation="0"><p>VIEŠ VÔBEC PREČO SI MA NAJAL NA TENTO DŽOB?</p></text-area><text-area points="0,252 17,221 56,196 140,183 248,183 321,196 367,229 375,254 360,288 313,308 254,321 133,321 69,313 10,283" text-rotation="0"><p>PRETOŽE TVOJ NANO GANG JE NAJLEPŠÍ V MESTE. NIKTO INÝ BY TO NEZVLÁDOL VYKONAŤ.</p></text-area><text-area points="83,465 96,440 142,423 215,415 290,423 321,446 327,467 302,490 252,502 165,506 108,492" text-rotation="0"><p>A VIEŠ PREČO SME MY NAJLEPŠÍ?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/10.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="13,71 21,40 65,21 129,8 204,15 256,38 271,65 263,96 219,117 123,121 48,110" text-rotation="0"><p>WHAT THE FUCK DOES THAT HAVE TO DO WITH ANYTHING?</p></text-area><text-area points="535,85 550,63 583,42 660,23 760,25 877,38 938,60 952,90 919,121 852,140 744,146 640,140 567,127 544,113" text-rotation="0"><p>IT HAS A LOT TO DO WITH EVERYTHING. IN PARTICULAR, WHAT'S ABOUT TO GO DOWN RIGHT NOW.</p></text-area><text-area points="677,500 681,469 723,440 785,425 883,423 946,435 985,469 988,510 965,544 906,567 760,567 702,544" text-rotation="0"><p>JUST CUT THE BULLSHIT AND LET'S TRADE UP. I'VE GOT THE MONEY, YOU'VE GOT THE GOODS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="13,71 21,40 65,21 129,8 204,15 256,38 271,65 263,96 219,117 123,121 48,110" text-rotation="0"><p>ČO TO DO ČERTA MÁ VÔBEC ZNAMENAŤ?</p></text-area><text-area points="535,85 550,63 583,42 660,23 760,25 877,38 938,60 952,90 919,121 852,140 744,146 640,140 567,127 544,113" text-rotation="0"><p>ZNAMENÁ TO VEĽMI VEĽA. PRESNEJŠIE POVEDANÉ, SUVISÍ TO S TÝM, ČO SA PRÁVE CHYSTÁ.</p></text-area><text-area points="677,500 681,469 723,440 785,425 883,423 946,435 985,469 988,510 965,544 906,567 760,567 702,544" text-rotation="0"><p>VYSER SA NA TO A POĎME ROVNO K VECI. JA MÁM PRACHY, TY MÁŠ TOVAR.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/11.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="454,73 488,38 554,10 642,0 810,0 898,17 965,44 1000,77 1000,119 965,160 906,185 817,198 679,202 554,188 481,160 450,121" text-rotation="0"><p>NO, YOU SEE, THAT'S THE PROBLEM. i DIDN'T BRING THE GOODS. SOME BAD-ASS MOTHERFUCKERS TRIED TO CUT ME OUT OF THE DEAL, AND SO THE GOODS ARE IN A SAFE PLACE WHERE YOU'RE NOT GONNA FIND THEM.</p></text-area><text-area points="21,350 994,350 994,558 21,558" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>LANEY AND JULIUS WERE AT ASHER'S - THAT MUCH HE KNEW BECAUSE HE COULD PING THEIR ENCRYPTED GEO-TAGS, BUT WITHOUT ACCESS TO A SECURE COMM CHANNEL, HE WAS TOTALLY IN THE DARK. IF THEIR PICK-UPS WERE ANYTHING LIKE HIS, THE TARGET PACKAGES DIDN'T MATCH THE ORIGINAL PURCHASE ORDER. NOW HE JUST HAD TO HOPE THE WHOLE PAYLOAD - WHATEVER THE HELL IT WAS - WAS SITTING IN ASHER'S LAB. IF NOT, THEN HIS BLUFF WAS ABOUT TO GET CALLED IN A VERY BAD WAY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="454,73 488,38 554,10 642,0 810,0 898,17 965,44 1000,77 1000,119 965,160 906,185 817,198 679,202 554,188 481,160 450,121" text-rotation="0"><p>BOHUŽIAĽ NIE. TO JE TEN PROBLÉM. NEPRINIESOL SOM TOVAR. NEJAKÍ ZASRANÍ HAJZLI SA MA SNAŽILI PODVIEZŤ, TAK TOVAR ZOSTAL UKRYTÝ NA BEZPEČNOM MIESTE, KDE HO NIKTO NIKDY NENÁJDE.</p></text-area><text-area points="21,350 994,350 994,558 21,558" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>LANEY A JULIUS BOLI U ASHERA - TO VEDEL, KEĎŽE MOHOL PINGNÚŤ ICH ZAŠIFROVANÉ GEO-PRÍVESKY, ALE BEZ PRÍSTUPU K ZABEZPEČENÉMU KOMUNIKAČNÉMU KANÁLU TÁPAL V TOTÁLNEJ TME. AK ICH DODÁVKA BOLA PODOBNÁ JEHO, TAK ICH BALÍKY NEZODPOVEDALI ORIGINÁLNEJ OBJEDNÁVKE. TERAZ LEN MOHOL DÚFAŤ, ŽE ICH BALÍK - ČOKOĽVEK TO SAKRA BOLO - BOL V BEZPEČÍ V ASHEROVOM LABORATÓRIU. AK BY TO TAK NEBOLO, JEHO BLAFOVANIE SKONČÍ ČOSKORO VEĽMI ZLE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/12.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="581,90 588,60 621,38 698,15 813,17 877,40 915,77 904,125 863,152 785,169 696,171 623,154 585,127" text-rotation="0"><p>FUCK YOURSELF. THIS WAS A CLEAN DEAL FROM THE START. YOU PLAY, MY CLIENT PAYS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="581,90 588,60 621,38 698,15 813,17 877,40 915,77 904,125 863,152 785,169 696,171 623,154 585,127" text-rotation="0"><p>NECHCI MA NASRAŤ. TOTO BOL JEDNODUCHÝ DŽOB OD ZAČIATKU. TY MAKÁŠ, MÔJ KLIENT PLATÍ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/13.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="467,77 502,38 575,4 883,6 954,33 996,81 1000,148 973,200 904,240 823,258 671,263 583,250 508,219 467,173 460,115" text-rotation="0"><p>I DON'T THINK THE DEAL'S THAT CLEAN AT THIS POINT. AND YOU NEVER LET ME ANSWER YOUR QUESTION. WHY ARE WE THE BEST NANO-MOB IN THE CITY? BECAUSE I'VE DONE THIS SHIT BEFORE. I LEARNED FROM THE BEST - BURTIN INDUSTRIES' BLACKWATER DIVISION.</p></text-area><text-area points="669,396 677,367 702,333 758,313 838,304 913,310 958,327 998,360 1000,448 977,481 935,504 883,519 796,519 727,504 683,475 671,438" text-rotation="0"><p>FIFTEEN YEARS IN THE INFORMATION WARFARE UNIT. I'VE BEEN UP AND DOWN EVERY TWO-BIT, TRIPLE-CROSS SCAM ANYONE EVER THOUGHT OF.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="467,77 502,38 575,4 883,6 954,33 996,81 1000,148 973,200 904,240 823,258 671,263 583,250 508,219 467,173 460,115" text-rotation="0"><p>NEMYSLÍM SI, ŽE BUDE TENTO OBCHOD AŽ TAKÝ JEDNODUCHÝ. A INAK NENECHAL SI MA ODPOVEDAŤ NA TVOJU PREDOŠLÚ OTÁZKU. PREČO SME NAJLEPŠÍ NANO GANG V MESTE? PRETOŽE SOM TIETO SRAČKY RIEŠIL UŽ PREDTÝM. UČIL SOM SA OD NAJLEPŠÍCH - BLACKWATER DIVÍZIA V BURTIN INDUSTRIES.</p></text-area><text-area points="669,396 677,367 702,333 758,313 838,304 913,310 958,327 998,360 1000,448 977,481 935,504 883,519 796,519 727,504 683,475 671,438" text-rotation="0"><p>PÄTNÁSŤ ROKOV V JEDNOTKE V INFORMAČNEJ VOJNE. VIDEL SOM VŠETKY MOŽNÉ ELEKTRONICKÉ PODVODY, KTORÉ KTO KEDY VYMYSLEL.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/14.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="571,96 565,77 577,60 617,44 669,33 752,33 831,38 888,52 908,73 894,98 850,117 758,125 654,123 606,115" text-rotation="0"><p>I'M SURE IT LOOKS FUCKING GREAT ON YOUR RESUME.</p></text-area><text-area points="494,390 502,342 521,304 571,260 650,233 760,229 850,235 917,256 975,294 1000,335 1000,438 963,492 908,523 817,546 694,546 602,529 535,490 502,442" text-rotation="0"><p>I GUESS YOU'RE NOT PAYING ATTENTION. I DON'T THINK YOU WORK FOR SOME MAINLAND ANIMAL COLLECTOR. THIS SHIT IS BIGGER THAN THAT. YOU BROUGHT US IN ON THE GIG TO COVER YOUR TRACKS, WHICH INCLUDED TRYING TO PUT US ON ICE. YOUR PROBLEM IS THAT IT DIDN'T REALLY WORK OUT THAT WAY, AND NOW I'VE GOT WHAT YOU WANT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="571,96 565,77 577,60 617,44 669,33 752,33 831,38 888,52 908,73 894,98 850,117 758,125 654,123 606,115" text-rotation="0"><p>SOM SI ISTÝ, ŽE TO VYZERÁ SKVELO V TVOJOM ŽIVOTOPISE.</p></text-area><text-area points="494,390 502,342 521,304 571,260 650,233 760,229 850,235 917,256 975,294 1000,335 1000,438 963,492 908,523 817,546 694,546 602,529 535,490 502,442" text-rotation="0"><p>MYSLÍM, ŽE TI TO EŠTE NEDOCHÁDZA. NEMYSLÍM SI, ŽE PRACUJEŠ PRE NEJAKÉHO ZBERAČA VZÁCNYCH ZVIERAT. JE TO NIEČO OMNOHO VÄČŠIE. VTIAHOL SI NÁS DO TOHO, ABY SI ZAHLADIL SVOJE STOPY, ČO ZAHŔŇALO AJ POKÚSIŤ SA POSLAŤ NÁS K ĽADU. TVOJ PROBLÉM VŠAK JE, ŽE TI TO NEVYŠLO PODĽA PLÁNU. A JA MÁM TERAZ NIEČO, ČO PATRÍ TEBE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/15.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="71,148 58,108 65,73 100,44 171,25 254,17 350,33 400,69 413,104 394,152 340,179 279,194 185,194 119,179" text-rotation="0"><p>THIS IS BULLSHIT. THE BOTTOM LINE IS THAT IF YOU'VE GOT THE GOODS THEN YOU HAVE TWO CHOICES: DELIVER OR GET DEAD.</p></text-area><text-area points="0,354 4,288 23,244 77,213 146,196 319,194 365,204 408,231 444,279 450,321 438,375 404,408 350,431 271,448 171,448 92,433 40,413 17,388" text-rotation="0"><p>HERE'S THE THING THAT'S REALLY STARTING TO BOTHER ME. I CAN SMELL BLACKWATER FROM TEN CLICKS OFF. YOU'VE GOT A TRADEMARK BURTIN POKER FACE. THE PANTOMIMES, CONTROLLED PUPIL DILATATION, FORCED BREATHING RHYTMS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="71,148 58,108 65,73 100,44 171,25 254,17 350,33 400,69 413,104 394,152 340,179 279,194 185,194 119,179" text-rotation="0"><p>CHUJOVINA. BEZOHĽADU NA TVOJE KECY, AK MÁŠ K DISPOZÍCII TOVAR, TAK MÁŠ LEN DVE MOŽNOSTI: DODAŤ HO ALEBO ZOMRIEŤ.</p></text-area><text-area points="0,354 4,288 23,244 77,213 146,196 319,194 365,204 408,231 444,279 450,321 438,375 404,408 350,431 271,448 171,448 92,433 40,413 17,388" text-rotation="0"><p>JEDNA VEC MA VŠAK NAOZAJ ZAČÍNA TRÁPIŤ. BLACKWATER ĽUDÍ DOKÁŽEM ZACÍTIŤ NA DESAŤ METROV. MÁŠ PERFEKTNÚ BURTINSKÚ POKROVÚ TVÁR. POHYBY TELA, KONTROLOVANÝ POHYB ZRENÍC OČÍ, UMELÝ NÚTENÝ RYTMUS DÝCHANIA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/16.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="704,85 706,52 735,33 800,21 879,21 935,42 956,73 938,113 885,129 823,135 758,129 719,110" text-rotation="0"><p>THING IS, YOU'RE JUST NOT VERY GOOD AT IT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="704,85 706,52 735,33 800,21 879,21 935,42 956,73 938,113 885,129 823,135 758,129 719,110" text-rotation="0"><p>VEC SA MÁ TAK, ŽE V TOM NIE SI MOC DOBRÝ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/17.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/18.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="677,150 679,106 696,71 750,46 815,40 910,44 960,58 994,83 1000,100 1000,183 950,217 867,235 765,231 702,204 683,181" text-rotation="0"><p>BUT THEN AGAIN, YOU PROBABLY DON'T KNOW THE WHOLE STORY. SO I'M GOING TO NEED TO BORROW A FEW THINGS FROM YOU.</p></text-area><text-area points="29,450 971,450 971,560 27,560" text-rotation="0" type="commentary"><p>WAGNER TOOK NO JOY IN KILLING PEOPLE. THREE TOURS IN CHINA WAR II HAD TAKEN CARE OF THAT. BUT SELF-PRESERVATION IS A POWERFUL FORCE. ESPECIALLY IF YOU DON'T HAVE ANY BRAIN MODS SCREWING WITH YOUR BASELINE INSTINCTS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="677,150 679,106 696,71 750,46 815,40 910,44 960,58 994,83 1000,100 1000,183 950,217 867,235 765,231 702,204 683,181" text-rotation="0"><p>NO ALE KEĎŽE PRAVDEPODOBNE NEPOZNÁŠ CELÝ PRÍBEH, TAK SI BUDEM MUSIEŤ OD TEBA PÁR VECÍ POŽIČAŤ.</p></text-area><text-area points="29,450 971,450 971,560 27,560" text-rotation="0" type="commentary"><p>WAGNER NEMAL ŽIADNU RADOSŤ ZO ZABÍJANIA. TRI VÝPRAVY V DRUHEJ ČÍNSKEJ VOJNE SA O TO POSTARALI. ALE PUD SEBAZÁCHOVY JE SILNÁ MOC, OBZVLÁŠŤ AK ČLOVEK NEMÁ MOZGOVÉ MODIFIKÁCIE MENIACE ZÁKLADNÉ INŠTINKTY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/19.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="17,35 317,35 275,131 279,167 310,202 365,319 390,354 446,398 460,431 460,535 15,535" text-rotation="0" type="commentary"><p>AND ANYWAY, BRAIN MODS WEREN'T ALL THAT USEFUL IN HIS LINE OF WORK. WHAT HE DID HAVE WERE ADAPTIVE BIOMETRIC COUNTERMEASURES. FINGERPRINTS. RETINAL PATTERNS. VOCAL PITCH AND TONE. ALL OF THESE COULD BE RECORDED, DOWNLOADED, HIS OWN BIOSIGNATURES RECONFIGURED. IN A WORLD WHERE NOBODY EVER LOOKED AT YOUR FACE, THESE THINGS CONSTITUTED YOUR ENTIRE IDENTITY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="17,35 317,35 275,131 279,167 310,202 365,319 390,354 446,398 460,431 460,535 15,535" text-rotation="0" type="commentary"><p>A MIMOCHODOM, MOZGOVÉ MODIFIKÁCIE NEBOLI AŽ TAK UŽITOČNÉ V JEHO PRÁCI. ČO VŠAK MAL, BOLI ADAPTÍVNE BIOMETRICKÉ PROTIOPATRENIA. ODTLAČKY PRSTOV. ŠTRUKTÚRY ZRENÍC. HLASOVÝ TÓN A JEHO VÝŠKU. TOTO VŠETKO MOHLO BYŤ NAHRÁVANÉ, SŤAHOVANÉ A JEHO VLASTNÁ SIGNATÚRA REKONFIGUROVANÁ. VO SVETE, KDE SA NIKTO NIKOMU NEPOZERAL DO TVÁRE, TIETO VECI PREDSTAVOVALI CELÚ ĽUDSKÚ IDENTITU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/20.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="19,13 979,13 979,60 915,135 19,135" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>NATHAN SAMUEL. WHEREVER THIS ASSHOLE COULD HAVE GONE IF HE WERE STILL ALIVE, WAGNER COULD NOW GO. MOST IMPORTANTLY, HE COULD FLIP HIS WAY PAST THE FIRST FEW LAYERS OF PHYSICAL SECURITY AT BURTIN INDUSTRIES HEADQUARTERS IN MIDTOWN.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="19,13 979,13 979,60 915,135 19,135" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>NATHAN SAMUEL. KAMKOĽVEK BY TENTO HAJZEL IŠIEL, KEBY BOL STÁLE NAŽIVE, TAK TAM MÁ TERAZ WAGNER PRÍSTUP. NAJPODSTATNEJŠIE JE, ŽE SA TERAZ DOKÁŽE DOSTAŤ CEZ NIEKOĽKO PRVÝCH BEZPEČNOSTNÝCH VRSTIEV V MESTSKEJ CENTRÁLE BURTIN INDUSTRIES.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/21.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="413,83 419,58 450,40 500,33 554,42 577,56 588,85 571,115 538,129 479,133 431,119" text-rotation="0"><p>SORRY ABOUT THE MESS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="413,83 419,58 450,40 500,33 554,42 577,56 588,85 571,115 538,129 479,133 431,119" text-rotation="0"><p>SORRY ZA TEN BORDEL.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/22.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="19,11 165,11 165,50 19,50" text-rotation="0" bgcolor="#000000"><p>BURTIN TOWER</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="19,11 165,11 165,50 19,50" text-rotation="0" bgcolor="#000000"><p>BURTINSKÁ VEŽA</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/23.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="15,8 245,8 245,40 14,40" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>A.K.A.: FORTRESS BURTIN</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="15,8 245,8 245,40 14,40" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>A.K.A.: PEVNOSŤ BURTIN</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/24.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="10,4 323,4 323,89 10,89" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>WORLD HEADQUARTERS FOR BURTIN INDUSTRIES. THE PLANET'S LARGEST PROVIDER OF PRIVATE ARMIES, NATION-SCALE LOGISTICS AND COUNTER-INSURGENCY SUPPORT.</p></text-area><text-area points="8,103 200,103 201,188 198,303 8,303" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>THEY'D HAD THEIR FINGERS IN EVERY BLOODY CONFLICT SOMEONE COULD AFFORD TO HIRE THEM FOR MORE THAN A CENTURY. IT WAS JUST ABOUT THE LAST PLACE WAGNER WANTED TO BE. BUT IT'S NOT LIKE YOU EVER HAD A CHOICE ABOUT IT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="10,4 323,4 323,89 10,89" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>SVETOVÁ CENTRÁLA BURTIN INDUSTRIES, NAJVÄČŠIEHO POSKYTOVATEĽA SÚKROMNÝCH ARMÁD, CELONÁRODNEJ LOGISTIKY A PROTIPOVSTALECKEJ PODPORY.</p></text-area><text-area points="8,103 200,103 201,188 198,303 8,303" bgcolor="#000000" text-rotation="0"><p>MALI SVOJE PRSTY V KAŽDOM KRVAVOM KONFLIKTE, KDE SI ICH MOHOL NIEKTO DOVOLIŤ NAJAŤ, POČAS VIAC AKO STOROČIA. BOLO TO POSLEDNÉ MIESTO, KDE BY WAGNER CHCEL ZROVNA BYŤ. ALE NIE VŽDY MÁ ČLOVEK MOŽNOSŤ VOĽBY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/25.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/26.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/27.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="146,33 165,15 367,15 383,27 383,88 367,102 163,102 148,85"><p>WAGNER. WHERE THE HELL HAVE YOU BEEN?</p></text-area><text-area points="408,50 419,27 450,10 521,10 560,23 577,50 567,81 540,98 475,102 429,92 413,77"><p>I HAD TO GRAB A BURGER.</p></text-area><text-area points="608,38 621,15 902,15 919,35 919,102 904,119 854,117 698,121 621,121 610,106"><p>I DON'T LIKE THE TRACE ON THIS FEED. ARE YOU WHERE I THINK YOU ARE?</p></text-area><text-area points="163,471 173,452 204,438 252,429 383,429 408,429 456,440 483,467 473,492 423,513 350,521 258,519 202,508 173,496"><p>YEAH. BURTIN HQ. I'M PROBABLY IN YOUR OLD OFFICE.</p></text-area><text-area points="471,510 492,492 500,473 696,473 715,488 756,492 756,540 740,556 488,556 469,542"><p>NOT LIKELY. DOESN'T LOOK LIKE A CORNER SUITE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="146,33 165,15 367,15 383,27 383,88 367,102 163,102 148,85"><p>WAGNER. KDE DO PEKLA ZAS TRČÍŠ?</p></text-area><text-area points="408,50 419,27 450,10 521,10 560,23 577,50 567,81 540,98 475,102 429,92 413,77"><p>MUSEL SOM SI SKOČIŤ PO HAMBURGER.</p></text-area><text-area points="608,38 621,15 902,15 919,35 919,102 904,119 854,117 698,121 621,121 610,106"><p>NEPÁČIA SA MI PARAMETRE TOHTO PRENOSU. SI TAM, KDE SI MYSLÍM?</p></text-area><text-area points="163,471 173,452 204,438 252,429 383,429 408,429 456,440 483,467 473,492 423,513 350,521 258,519 202,508 173,496"><p>JASNE. BURTINSKÁ CENTRÁLA. SOM PRAVDEPODOBNE V TVOJEJ STAREJ KANCELÁRII.</p></text-area><text-area points="471,510 492,492 500,473 696,473 715,488 756,492 756,540 740,556 488,556 469,542"><p>TO ŤAŽKO. NEVYZERÁ TO AKO ROHOVÁ KANCELÁRIA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/28.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="225,52 227,31 248,15 296,4 404,4 448,15 471,35 469,60 446,79 400,90 331,94 258,83 235,71"><p>DO YOU HAVE THE WHOLE PACKAGE?</p></text-area><text-area points="477,67 477,31 492,17 596,17 608,33 608,81 594,94 492,94 477,81"><p>IT'S ALL HERE.</p></text-area><text-area points="617,83 619,50 644,35 715,35 746,46 756,67 748,88 715,102 658,102 631,96"><p>SO WHAT IT IS?</p></text-area><text-area points="269,525 267,444 281,429 488,429 500,446 502,519 488,535 285,535"><p>IT'S NOT A FUCKING SQUIRREL, FOR STARTERS.</p></text-area><text-area points="515,552 508,529 510,448 523,442 746,442 763,458 760,538 742,552"><p>I'LL TELL YOU LATER. JUST GET THE HELL OUT OF THERE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="225,52 227,31 248,15 296,4 404,4 448,15 471,35 469,60 446,79 400,90 331,94 258,83 235,71"><p>MÁŠ CELÝ TEN BALÍK?</p></text-area><text-area points="477,67 477,31 492,17 596,17 608,33 608,81 594,94 492,94 477,81"><p>JE TO TU VŠETKO.</p></text-area><text-area points="617,83 619,50 644,35 715,35 746,46 756,67 748,88 715,102 658,102 631,96"><p>TAK ČO TO JE?</p></text-area><text-area points="269,525 267,444 281,429 488,429 500,446 502,519 488,535 285,535"><p>TAK ZA PRVÉ, NIE JE TO ŽIADNA ZASRATÁ VEVERIČKA.</p></text-area><text-area points="515,552 508,529 510,448 523,442 746,442 763,458 760,538 742,552"><p>POTOM TI O TOM POVIEM. TERAZ ODTIAĽ ČO NAJSKÔR VYPADNI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/29.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="25,67 35,42 54,25 85,17 135,17 163,31 179,56 175,90 140,108 81,113 40,100"><p>NOT YET. IS LANEY THERE?</p></text-area><text-area points="202,31 219,15 425,15 442,33 442,96 417,110 219,110 202,92"><p>YEAH. I'M HERE. WHAT THE FUCK IS GOING ON?</p></text-area><text-area points="471,58 485,33 529,13 569,8 660,8 708,19 740,42 746,73 727,98 669,115 585,117 510,106 479,92"><p>IF I JACK YOU IN, CAN YOU GROK THIS GUY'S FILES?</p></text-area><text-area points="571,413 588,396 931,396 946,415 946,538 927,552 590,552 571,538"><p>PROBABLY. DO YOU HAVE A WI-FI BEACON? NO WAY I HAVE TIME TO HACK A BURTIN FIREWALL BEFORE THEY NOTICE YOU STANDING AROUND THERE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="25,67 35,42 54,25 85,17 135,17 163,31 179,56 175,90 140,108 81,113 40,100"><p>POČKAJ. JE TAM NIEKDE LANEY?</p></text-area><text-area points="202,31 219,15 425,15 442,33 442,96 417,110 219,110 202,92"><p>ÁNO, SOM TU. ČO DO PEKLA CHCEŠ?</p></text-area><text-area points="471,58 485,33 529,13 569,8 660,8 708,19 740,42 746,73 727,98 669,115 585,117 510,106 479,92"><p>AK ŤA TU NAPICHNEM, DOKÁŽEŠ SA DOSTAŤ K SÚBOROM TOHTO TÝPKA?</p></text-area><text-area points="571,413 588,396 931,396 946,415 946,538 927,552 590,552 571,538"><p>PRAVDEPODOBNE. MÁŠ TAM WI-FI VYSIELAČ? V ŽIADNOM PRÍPADE NEDOKÁŽEM HACKNÚŤ BURTINSKÝ FIREWALL PREDTÝM, NEŽ ŤA TAM NIEKTO ZBADÁ POSTÁVAŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/30.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="71,85 81,69 127,48 215,35 385,35 460,48 508,69 506,98 460,119 383,127 215,129 123,121 88,106"><p>IT'S ALREADY PLUGGED IN. I'M TRANSMITTING THE NODE ADDRESS NOW.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="71,85 81,69 127,48 215,35 385,35 460,48 508,69 506,98 460,119 383,127 215,129 123,121 88,106"><p>JE TO ZAPOJENÉ. PRENÁŠAM ADRESU TUNAJŠIEHO SIEŤOVÉHO UZLA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/31.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="371,73 385,54 431,35 485,27 656,27 729,46 758,67 750,100 700,117 596,123 483,123 402,108 379,96"><p>WHAT THE FUCK? THIS IS THE SAME SHIT WE WERE JUST LOOKING AT!</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="371,73 385,54 431,35 485,27 656,27 729,46 758,67 750,100 700,117 596,123 483,123 402,108 379,96"><p>NO DO FRASA ... JE TO PRESNE TÁ ISTÁ VEC, NA KTORÚ SME PRED CHVÍĽOU POZERALI!</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/32.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="477,60 494,38 531,21 571,15 671,15 729,27 760,52 756,81 700,106 625,115 535,108 490,92"><p>WAIT. STOP THERE. DRILL DOWN ON THAT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="477,60 494,38 531,21 571,15 671,15 729,27 760,52 756,81 700,106 625,115 535,108 490,92"><p>POČKAJ. TAM ZASTAV. POZRI SA DOVNÚTRA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/33.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="206,60 217,42 246,21 296,17 394,17 444,27 469,50 467,83 448,98 398,110 296,115 229,102 208,85"><p>LOOKS LIKE SOME KIND OF PHARMACEUTICAL.</p></text-area><text-area points="517,71 533,44 560,31 588,25 635,25 669,35 690,54 692,83 675,113 629,125 569,125 531,108"><p>YEAH, IT'S SOMETHING LIKE THAT.</p></text-area><text-area points="460,208 471,181 502,163 527,156 604,156 644,169 667,198 663,238 627,260 585,269 525,267 490,256 469,238"><p>DOWNLOAD EVERYTHING IN THAT TAG SPACE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="206,60 217,42 246,21 296,17 394,17 444,27 469,50 467,83 448,98 398,110 296,115 229,102 208,85"><p>VYZERÁ TO AKO NEJAKÝ DRUH FARMACEUTIKA.</p></text-area><text-area points="517,71 533,44 560,31 588,25 635,25 669,35 690,54 692,83 675,113 629,125 569,125 531,108"><p>ÁNO, JE TO NIEČO TAKÉ.</p></text-area><text-area points="460,208 471,181 502,163 527,156 604,156 644,169 667,198 663,238 627,260 585,269 525,267 490,256 469,238"><p>STIAHNI ODŤIAĽ VŠETKO, ČO SA TOHO TÝKA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/34.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="15,360 23,329 52,304 104,285 133,281 231,281 288,292 338,313 358,354 348,400 300,429 235,442 129,442 63,423 23,396"><p>AND GRAB THIS GUY'S ORG CHART WHILE YOU'RE AT IT. I'M GONNA WANT TO HAVE A CHAT WITH HIS BOSS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="15,360 23,329 52,304 104,285 133,281 231,281 288,292 338,313 358,354 348,400 300,429 235,442 129,442 63,423 23,396"><p>A VEZMI ROVNO AJ ICH ORGANIZAČNÚ ŠTRUKTÚRU. MYSLÍM, ŽE SI POKECÁM S JEHO ŠÉFOM.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/35.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="46,77 54,48 79,29 121,19 206,19 246,29 273,52 277,83 258,115 217,129 152,135 96,127 60,108"><p>WAGNER, I THINK YOU NEED TO FETCH JULIUS.</p></text-area><text-area points="433,63 442,40 467,29 523,29 552,44 556,73 533,96 494,100 448,94"><p>WHERE IS HE?</p></text-area><text-area points="760,77 767,58 785,46 806,40 850,40 881,46 902,67 896,96 869,110 813,115 771,102"><p>HE'S AT CHURCH.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="46,77 54,48 79,29 121,19 206,19 246,29 273,52 277,83 258,115 217,129 152,135 96,127 60,108"><p>WAGNER, MYSLÍM, ŽE MUSÍŠ ÍSŤ PO JULIUSA.</p></text-area><text-area points="433,63 442,40 467,29 523,29 552,44 556,73 533,96 494,100 448,94"><p>KDE TERAZ JE?</p></text-area><text-area points="760,77 767,58 785,46 806,40 850,40 881,46 902,67 896,96 869,110 813,115 771,102"><p>JE V KOSTOLE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/36.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="54,25 519,25 519,121 460,144 410,190 383,206 52,206" bgcolor="#000000"><p>JULIUS HAD HEARD THEY USED TO PLAY BASKETBALL HERE. NOW IT WAS GOD CENTRAL, THE NORTHERN CITADEL FOR THE FIRST CHURCH OF TEXAS. HOME OF THE TRUE BELIEVERS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="54,25 519,25 519,121 460,144 410,190 383,206 52,206" bgcolor="#000000"><p>JULIUS POČUL O TOM, ŽE SA TU HRÁVAL BASKETBAL. TERAZ JE TO BOŽIA CENTRÁLA, SEVERNÁ CITADELA PRVEJ TEXASKEJ CIRKVI. DOMOV TÝCH SKUTOČNÝCH VERIACICH.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/37.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/38.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="106,81 117,52 150,31 213,15 354,15 415,29 450,50 465,81 454,115 406,144 338,156 227,156 152,142 117,119"><p>WELCOME BROTHER. NO SERVICES ARE SCHEDULED FOR TODAY. HAVE YOU COME ON PILGRIMAGE?</p></text-area><text-area points="660,58 675,35 708,23 767,23 808,38 819,60 806,88 775,100 700,100 669,83"><p>YOU MIGHT SAY THAT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="106,81 117,52 150,31 213,15 354,15 415,29 450,50 465,81 454,115 406,144 338,156 227,156 152,142 117,119"><p>VITAJ BRAT. NA DNES NIE JE PLÁNOVANÁ ŽIADNA BOHOSLUŽBA. PRIŠIEL SI NA PÚŤ?</p></text-area><text-area points="660,58 675,35 708,23 767,23 808,38 819,60 806,88 775,100 700,100 669,83"><p>DALO BY SA POVEDAŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/39.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/40.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/41.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/42.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/43.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/44.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/45.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/46.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/47.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/48.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/49.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/50.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="679,229 692,200 721,181 754,175 858,175 908,188 933,219 927,252 875,281 817,288 744,283 690,260"><p>WELCOME, FRIEND. WE'VE BEEN EXPECTING YOU.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="679,229 692,200 721,181 754,175 858,175 908,188 933,219 927,252 875,281 817,288 744,283 690,260"><p>VITAJ, PRIATEĽU. OČAKÁVALI SME ŤA TU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/51.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="358,52 367,29 402,13 429,10 515,10 560,23 575,54 565,83 519,104 442,106 385,96 365,79"><p>DON'T WORRY. THEY WILL NOT HARM YOU.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="358,52 367,29 402,13 429,10 515,10 560,23 575,54 565,83 519,104 442,106 385,96 365,79"><p>ŽIADEN STRACH. ONI TI NEUBLÍŽIA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/52.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="55,29 64,15 84,1 265,1 285,18 290,43 276,65 249,79 206,85 130,85 90,78 63,60 55,44"><p>THESE ARE THE DAYENDERS. SOLDIERS OF CHRIST. THEY HAVE DIED AND BEEN REBORN TO PERFORM A HOLY MISSION.</p></text-area><text-area points="204,401 210,384 228,371 253,366 298,366 325,380 334,398 329,418 316,431 284,439 231,435 209,423"><p>A HOLY MISSION TO WIPE OUT THE EAST COAST.</p></text-area><text-area points="83,531 88,508 103,490 134,474 175,465 248,465 303,479 328,495 338,510 338,560 321,579 285,595 274,598 145,598 109,584 88,560"><p>YOU UNDERESTIMATE THE ALMIGHTY, MY FRIEND. HIS ARMY IS DISPERSED ACROSS THE GLOBE. WHEN THE TIME COMES, THEY WILL UNLEASH A TERRIBLE PLAGUE WHICH WILL COVER THE EARTH.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="55,29 64,15 84,1 265,1 285,18 290,43 276,65 249,79 206,85 130,85 90,78 63,60 55,44"><p>TOTO SÚ VYZNAVAČI KONCA DNÍ. KRISTOVI VOJACI. ZOMRELI A ZNOVA SA NARODILI, ABY VYKONALI SVÄTÚ MISIU.</p></text-area><text-area points="204,401 210,384 228,371 253,366 298,366 325,380 334,398 329,418 316,431 284,439 231,435 209,423"><p>MISIU NA VYHLADENIE VÝCHODNÉHO POBREŽIA.</p></text-area><text-area points="83,531 88,508 103,490 134,474 175,465 248,465 303,479 328,495 338,510 338,560 321,579 285,595 274,598 145,598 109,584 88,560"><p>PODCEŇUJEŠ VŠEMOHÚCEHO, PRIATEĽ MÔJ. JEHO ARMÁDA JE ROZMIESTNENÁ PO CELOM SVETE. KEĎ NADÍDE ČAS, VYPUSTIA HRÔZOSTRAŠNÚ NÁKAZU, KTORÁ POKRYJE CELÚ ZEM.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/53.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="15,202 19,150 38,108 77,65 144,33 235,21 402,21 498,44 565,92 594,138 602,198 588,258 550,310 467,352 369,369 246,369 156,354 75,321 31,271"><p>THEY ARE FEARLESS, UNSTOPPABLE - A DEVOTED ARMY TEN THOUSAND STRONG, DESIGNED ACCORDING TO HIS WILL FOR THIS SINGULAR PURPOSE. IT IS THEY WHO WIILL CARRY DESTRUCTION TO THE FAR ENDS OF THE EARTH, UNLEASHING THE WILD BEASTS AND THE PLAGUE THEY CARRY. NO FORCE OF MAN WILL HINDER THEIR DIVINE MISSION, AND IN THE END THEY TOO WILL PERISH IN THIS APOCALYPSE, AS WILL YOU AND I.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="15,202 19,150 38,108 77,65 144,33 235,21 402,21 498,44 565,92 594,138 602,198 588,258 550,310 467,352 369,369 246,369 156,354 75,321 31,271"><p>SÚ NEBOJÁCNI, NEZASTAVITEĽNÍ - ODDANÁ ARMÁDA V SILE DESAŤ TISÍC MUŽOV, STVORENÁ Z JEHO VÔLE PRE TENTO JEDINÝ CIEĽ. SÚ TO ONI, KTORÍ PRINESÚ DEŠTRUKCIU DO NAJVZDIALENEJŠÍCH ČASTÍ SVETA, KTORÍ VYPUSTIA DIVOKÉ ZVERY A SMRTEĽNÚ EPIDÉMIU. ŽIADEN ČLOVEK NEDOKÁŽE ZABRÁNIŤ SPLNENIU ICH MISIE. NAPOKON AJ ONI ZAHYNÚ V TEJTO APOKALYPSE, TAK AKO AJ TY, AJ JA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/54.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="0,96 2,54 29,31 75,19 167,19 219,31 248,60 244,98 213,119 160,129 77,129 29,119"><p>THAT'LL BE HARD TO PULL OFF WITH A SINGLE RAT.</p></text-area><text-area points="233,121 250,98 258,73 269,50 315,31 367,21 488,21 575,40 617,81 623,125 606,163 567,188 508,202 381,202 338,202 298,192 256,171 240,152"><p>WE HAVE NEVER DEVELOPED CLONING TECH BECAUSE THE ALMIGHTY FORBIDS IT. BUT BURTIN INDUSTRIES WILL HAVE A SPECIAL ROLE IN THE END OF TIMES.</p></text-area><text-area points="296,477 302,446 323,425 377,398 465,379 677,379 750,388 825,413 856,444 867,481 850,519 804,550 760,565 398,565 333,540 302,510"><p>WITHIN DAYS THEY WILL HAVE CLONED THE WILD BEASTS, MULTIPLIED THEM BY THE TENS OF THOUSANDS, INFECTED THEM. AND THESE BEASTS WILL BE DELIVERED UNTO THE DAYENDERS WHO LIE IN WAIT TO SPREAD THE PLAGUE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="0,96 2,54 29,31 75,19 167,19 219,31 248,60 244,98 213,119 160,129 77,129 29,119"><p>TO BUDE ŤAŽKÉ REALIZOVAŤ S JEDINÝM POTKANOM.</p></text-area><text-area points="233,121 250,98 258,73 269,50 315,31 367,21 488,21 575,40 617,81 623,125 606,163 567,188 508,202 381,202 338,202 298,192 256,171 240,152"><p>NIKDY SME NEVYVINULI KLONOVACIU TECHNOLÓGIU, PRETOŽE TO VŠEMOHÚCI ZAKAZUJE. AVŠAK BURTIN INDUSTRIES BUDE MAŤ NA KONCI VEKOV MIMORIADNU ÚLOHU.</p></text-area><text-area points="296,477 302,446 323,425 377,398 465,379 677,379 750,388 825,413 856,444 867,481 850,519 804,550 760,565 398,565 333,540 302,510"><p>BEHOM PÁR DNÍ NAKLONUJÚ DIVÉ ZVERY, NAMNOŽIA ICH NA DESAŤTISÍCE A NAINFIKUJÚ. TIETO ZVERY BUDÚ NÁSLEDNE DORUČENÉ VYZNAVAČOM KONCA DNÍ, KTORÍ UŽ ČAKAJÚ, ABY MOHLI NÁKAZU ROZŠÍRIŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/55.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="9,38 13,24 26,15 60,8 128,8 159,15 174,26 175,40 161,55 129,63 85,64 39,59 18,50"><p>SO WHAT DOES BURTIN GET OUT OF THE DEAL?</p></text-area><text-area points="38,101 44,89 60,76 84,69 111,68 138,65 161,63 244,63 288,70 315,79 329,93 330,110 316,126 274,140 224,145 143,145 98,141 60,130 43,118"><p>THE MASTERS OF BURTIN SERVE MAMMON. THEY HAVE BEEN PAID HANDSOMELY FOR THEIR ROLE IN HIS PLAN, AND THAT IS ALL THEY SEEK.</p></text-area><text-area points="20,523 25,498 41,479 71,465 119,455 228,455 271,463 309,481 324,506 325,531 306,558 265,576 223,584 120,584 70,575 40,559 25,543"><p>BUT WON'T THEY TRY TO STOP IT ONCE THEY REALIZE THE EXTENT OF THE DEVASTATION? THEY'VE MANAGED PANDEMICS BEFORE, AND THEY CERTAINLY DON'T HAVE A BUSINESS INTEREST IN SEEING THE HUMAN RACE ERADICATED.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="9,38 13,24 26,15 60,8 128,8 159,15 174,26 175,40 161,55 129,63 85,64 39,59 18,50"><p>NO A ČO Z TOHO BUDE MAŤ BURTIN INDUSTRIES?</p></text-area><text-area points="38,101 44,89 60,76 84,69 111,68 138,65 161,63 244,63 288,70 315,79 329,93 330,110 316,126 274,140 224,145 143,145 98,141 60,130 43,118"><p>VLÁDCOVIA BURTIN INDUSTRIES SLÚŽIA MAMONU. ZA ICH ROLU V JEHO PLÁNE BOLI DOSTATOČNE ZAPLATENÍ. A TO JE VŠETKO PO ČOM TÚŽIA.</p></text-area><text-area points="20,523 25,498 41,479 71,465 119,455 228,455 271,463 309,481 324,506 325,531 306,558 265,576 223,584 120,584 70,575 40,559 25,543"><p>NEBUDÚ TO ALE CHCIEŤ ZASTAVIŤ, KEĎ SA DOZVEDIA O CELOM ROZSAHU DEVASTÁCIE? ZVLÁDLI PANDÉMIE UŽ V MINULOSTI, A URČITE NEMAJÚ OBCHODNÝ ZÁUJEM NA VYPLIENENÍ ĽUDSKEJ RASY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/56.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="4,108 6,80 19,53 48,28 98,13 125,9 225,9 289,26 323,55 335,91 330,130 309,163 268,184 205,195 121,195 61,181 24,159 10,133"><p>THEY WILL ATTEMPT TO UNDERMINE HIS PLAN. BUT OUR SPIES ARE EVERYWHERE. THEY TELL US THAT BURTIN HAS DEVELOPED A NEW GENERATION OF ANTIBIOTICS, A DRUG CALLED CATOXYUNE. HOWEVER, THE DESIGN OF OUR BACTERIA IS BEYOND WHAT THEY HAVE ANTICIPATED. THEIR EFFORTS WILL FAIL. THE ALMIGHTY HAS FORSEEN THIS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="4,108 6,80 19,53 48,28 98,13 125,9 225,9 289,26 323,55 335,91 330,130 309,163 268,184 205,195 121,195 61,181 24,159 10,133"><p>POKÚSIA SA NARUŠIŤ JEHO PLÁN. ALE NAŠI ZVEDOVIA SÚ VŠADE. POVEDALI NÁM, ŽE BURTIN VYVINULI NOVÚ GENERÁCIU ANTIBIOTÍK, DROGU NAZÝVANÚ CATOXYUNE. AVŠAK DIZAJN NAŠEJ BAKTÉRIE JE ĎALEKO POPREDU PRED VŠETKÝM, ČO POZNAJÚ. ICH POKUSY STROSKOTAJÚ. VŠEMOHÚCI TO TAK VIDÍ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/57.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="0,45 8,34 31,21 75,11 114,9 239,9 293,16 328,30 339,45 338,58 315,74 269,86 211,91 109,91 58,85 19,73 3,63"><p>HAS THE ALMIGHTY FORESEEN THIS? BURTIN DOESN'T HAVE THE WILD BEASTS. OR THE BACTERIA, WHICH ONLY HAVE 6 HOURS AND 32 MINUTES LEFT TO LIVE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="0,45 8,34 31,21 75,11 114,9 239,9 293,16 328,30 339,45 338,58 315,74 269,86 211,91 109,91 58,85 19,73 3,63"><p>VIDÍ VÁŠ VŠEMOHÚCI AJ TOTO? BURTIN NEMAJÚ ŽIADNE DIVÉ ZVERY A BAKTÉRIU, KTOREJ ZOSTÁVA LEN 6 HODÍN A 32 MINÚT ŽIVOTA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/58.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="10,134 10,100 18,70 33,48 65,26 109,15 131,11 218,11 264,21 295,36 318,61 329,93 330,130 318,165 288,193 253,206 206,215 146,215 78,205 38,185 19,161"><p>IT IS TRUE THAT WE UNDERESTIMATED YOUR TENACITY. WE DID NOT WISH TO POLLUTE OURSELVES BY PAYING FOR THESE THINGS WHICH RIGHTFULLY BELONG TO US. FORTUNATELY, BURTIN WAS WILLING TO PICK UP THE TAB IN THE END. I RECEIVED WORD JUST PRIOR TO YOUR ARRIVAL THAT YOUR FRIEND WAGNER MANAGED TO OBTAIN A CONSIDERABLE SUM OF MONEY IN EXCHANGE FOR THE PACKAGE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="10,134 10,100 18,70 33,48 65,26 109,15 131,11 218,11 264,21 295,36 318,61 329,93 330,130 318,165 288,193 253,206 206,215 146,215 78,205 38,185 19,161"><p>JE PRAVDA, ŽE SME PODCENILI TVOJU VYTRVALOSŤ. NECHCELI SME SA VŠAK POŠPINIŤ PLATENÍM ZA TIETO VECI, KTORÉ NÁM PRÁVOPLATNE PATRIA. NAŠTASTIE BURTIN INDUSTRIES BOLI OCHOTNÍ TO ZA NÁS VYBAVIŤ. DOSTAL SOM SPRÁVU TESNE PRED TVOJÍM PRÍCHODOM, ŽE TVOJ PRIATEĽ WAGNER OBDRŽAL ZNAČNÚ SUMU PEŇAZÍ ZA VÝMENU ZA BALÍK.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/59.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="692,67 702,48 731,35 806,35 838,50 846,71 831,92 788,102 733,100 700,88"><p>BEHOLD.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="692,67 702,48 731,35 806,35 838,50 846,71 831,92 788,102 733,100 700,88"><p>POZRI SA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/60.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="677,219 685,185 713,152 758,131 796,125 898,125 958,144 994,177 996,267 967,300 925,321 863,331 783,327 717,306 685,271"><p>THE INSTRUMENT OF DESCTRUCTION HAS BEEN DELIVERED TO BURTIN. WITHIN DAYS IT WILL HAVE BEEN CLONED BY THE MILLIONS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="677,219 685,185 713,152 758,131 796,125 898,125 958,144 994,177 996,267 967,300 925,321 863,331 783,327 717,306 685,271"><p>NÁSTROJ DEŠTRUKCIE BOL DORUČENÝ DO BURTIN INDUSTRIES. BEHOM PÁR DNÍ BUDE NAKLONOVANÝ V MILIÓNOCH KUSOV.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/61.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="196,71 198,46 221,29 385,29 398,60 390,96 371,104 308,106 213,104"><p><strong>LIES!</strong></p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="196,71 198,46 221,29 385,29 398,60 390,96 371,104 308,106 213,104"><p><strong>LŽI!!!</strong></p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/62.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="346,65 356,44 394,27 485,27 515,44 521,75 498,94 448,102 385,98 356,85"><p>TELL ME THE TRUTH!</p></text-area><text-area points="231,169 233,140 417,140 427,152 421,173 371,175 254,175"><p>KILL... HIM...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="346,65 356,44 394,27 485,27 515,44 521,75 498,94 448,102 385,98 356,85"><p>POVEDZ MI PRAVDU!</p></text-area><text-area points="231,169 233,140 417,140 427,152 421,173 371,175 254,175"><p>ZABITE... HO...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/63.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/64.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 5/65.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/66.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="256,38 267,17 292,0 415,0 438,19 448,44 438,67 404,85 352,90 304,88 265,71"><p>JULIUS, LET HIM GO. IT'S OVER.</p></text-area><text-area points="442,81 454,56 456,31 490,15 535,2 696,2 750,17 779,38 790,71 775,104 735,129 665,140 565,140 490,127 458,110"><p>IS IT TRUE, WAGNER? DID YOU GIVE EVERYTHING TO BURTIN? DO YOU REALIZE WHAT YOU'VE DONE?!?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="256,38 267,17 292,0 415,0 438,19 448,44 438,67 404,85 352,90 304,88 265,71"><p>JULIUS, NECHAJ HO. JE PO VŠETKOM.</p></text-area><text-area points="442,81 454,56 456,31 490,15 535,2 696,2 750,17 779,38 790,71 775,104 735,129 665,140 565,140 490,127 458,110"><p>JE TO PRAVDA, WAGNER? DAL SI TO VŠETKO BURTIN INDUSTRIES? DOCHÁDZA TI, ČO SI SPÔSOBIL?!?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 5/67.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area points="77,75 85,48 102,31 121,27 179,27 210,42 223,75 204,108 167,121 115,117 85,100"><p>I SAID, LET HIM GO.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area points="77,75 85,48 102,31 121,27 179,27 210,42 223,75 204,108 167,121 115,117 85,100"><p>POVEDAL SOM, NECHAJ HO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 5/68.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="272,214 748,214 748,277 272,277" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>TO BE CONTINUED</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="272,214 748,214 748,277 272,277" type="heading" inverted="True"><p>POKRAČOVANIE NABUDÚCE</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <title lang="en">Issue 6</title>
      <title lang="sk">Kapitola 6</title>
      <image href="Issue 6/01.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,375 581,375 581,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>ISSUE 6</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="419,375 581,375 581,404 417,404" inverted="True" type="heading"><p>KAPITOLA 6</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/02.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="25,42 27,65 40,77 63,88 85,90 98,96 135,98 140,102 260,102 265,98 319,94 323,90 360,83 377,73 388,58 388,40 369,21 358,19 348,10 335,10 327,4 292,2 285,0 129,0 121,4 85,6 48,19"><p>I'M ONLY GOING TO ASK ONE MORE TIME. RUN THE ODDS, JULIUS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#f7f7f7" points="560,46 560,63 569,77 583,90 588,90 592,94 610,96 615,100 715,100 719,96 725,96 738,90 746,90 765,71 767,63 765,35 752,23 744,21 725,10 715,10 706,6 690,6 688,6 638,6 635,6 621,6 610,10 602,10 579,23 565,38"><p>I ALREADY DID. GO TO HELL.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="25,42 27,65 40,77 63,88 85,90 98,96 135,98 140,102 260,102 265,98 319,94 323,90 360,83 377,73 388,58 388,40 369,21 358,19 348,10 335,10 327,4 292,2 285,0 129,0 121,4 85,6 48,19"><p>PÝTAM SA ŤA NAPOSLEDY. TAK SA ROZHODNI, JULIUS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#f7f7f7" points="560,46 560,63 569,77 583,90 588,90 592,94 610,96 615,100 715,100 719,96 725,96 738,90 746,90 765,71 767,63 765,35 752,23 744,21 725,10 715,10 706,6 690,6 688,6 638,6 635,6 621,6 610,10 602,10 579,23 565,38"><p>UŽ SA STALO, CHOĎ DO PEKLA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/03.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/04.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="502,69 502,129 527,156 583,177 692,179 738,167 752,158 760,158 785,133 794,104 788,60 763,33 748,23 738,23 723,15 694,10 625,10 573,13 527,35 508,54"><p>GET THIS FILTH OUT OF HERE. AND QUICKLY, BEFORE I CHANGE MY MIND ABOUT LETTING YOU LIVE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="502,69 502,129 527,156 583,177 692,179 738,167 752,158 760,158 785,133 794,104 788,60 763,33 748,23 738,23 723,15 694,10 625,10 573,13 527,35 508,54"><p>ODNES TEN ODPAD ODTIAĽTO PREDTÝM, NEŽ SI ROZMYSLÍM, ČI ŤA NECHÁM ŽIŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/05.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="12,20 327,20 327,70 11,70" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>WAGNER CARRIES THE LIMP BODY OF HIS FRIEND UP THE DARK PASSAGEWAY AND INTO THE COOL EVENING.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="12,20 327,20 327,70 11,70" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>WAGNER ODNÁŠA NEHYBNÉ TELO SVOJHO PRIATEĽA TMAVOU ULIČKOU DO CHLADNEJ NOCI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/06.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="310,53 949,53 949,93 309,93" type="commentary"><p>SOMETIMES WHAT IS NECESSARY IS NOT EASY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="310,53 949,53 949,93 309,93" type="commentary"><p>NIEKEDY NIE JE JEDNODUCHÉ SPRAVIŤ TO, ČO JE TREBA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/07.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#010101" points="550,56 935,56 935,144 550,144" inverted="True" type="commentary"><p>SOMETIMES EVEN THE TIES THAT BIND OLD SOLDIERS CAN BE BROKEN.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#010101" points="550,56 935,56 935,144 550,144" inverted="True" type="commentary"><p>NIEKEDY SA AJ PUTÁ, KTORÉ SPÁJAJÚ VETERÁNOV Z VOJNY, MÔŽU PRETRHNÚŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/08.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#030303" points="29,35 373,35 373,121 27,121" inverted="True" type="commentary"><p>BUT EVEN MORE OFTEN, THINGS ARE SIMPLY NOT AS THEY SEEM.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="188,225 196,196 300,196 331,213 321,240 275,238 202,238"><p>UHHHHH</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#030303" points="29,35 373,35 373,121 27,121" inverted="True" type="commentary"><p>ALE ČASTOKRÁT VECI NIE SÚ TAKÉ, AKO SA NA PRVÝ POHĽAD ZDAJÚ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="188,225 196,196 300,196 331,213 321,240 275,238 202,238"><p>AAAACH</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/09.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="144,60 150,31 246,31 256,35 306,35 321,40 340,42 338,58 308,65 279,69 160,69"><p>UNNNGGGH...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="329,110 338,90 360,73 375,71 444,71 477,85 490,115 477,146 450,158 373,158 344,148 333,135"><p>WAKE UP. IT'S TIME TO GO.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="81,179 100,158 133,146 156,142 246,142 298,154 319,179 317,202 292,223 250,231 160,231 119,227 90,206"><p>DON'T EVER FUCKING SHOOT ME AGAIN.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="163,279 179,260 225,246 306,246 350,256 371,283 365,313 329,331 275,338 217,333 179,323 165,300"><p>I SHOT YOU WITH A TRANQ DART...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="144,60 150,31 246,31 256,35 306,35 321,40 340,42 338,58 308,65 279,69 160,69"><p>AAAACH...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="329,110 338,90 360,73 375,71 444,71 477,85 490,115 477,146 450,158 373,158 344,148 333,135"><p>VSTÁVAJ. JE ČAS ODÍSŤ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="81,179 100,158 133,146 156,142 246,142 298,154 319,179 317,202 292,223 250,231 160,231 119,227 90,206"><p>UŽ NA MŇA KURVA NIKDY NESTRIEĽAJ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="163,279 179,260 225,246 306,246 350,256 371,283 365,313 329,331 275,338 217,333 179,323 165,300"><p>STRELIL SOM ŤA USPÁVACOU ŠÍPKOU...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/10.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/11.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="390,60 392,81 425,121 442,129 494,135 498,140 569,140 654,125 675,106 681,90 690,81 690,54 685,50 685,44 667,25 638,13 621,10 617,6 598,6 592,2 579,2 575,0 508,0 504,2 492,2 485,6 448,10 419,23 402,38"><p>BUT I'M NOT SURE WHY YOU DIDN'T USE REAL BULLETS! WE'RE ALL DEAD ANYWAY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="390,60 392,81 425,121 442,129 494,135 498,140 569,140 654,125 675,106 681,90 690,81 690,54 685,50 685,44 667,25 638,13 621,10 617,6 598,6 592,2 579,2 575,0 508,0 504,2 492,2 485,6 448,10 419,23 402,38"><p>NEVIEM ALE PREČO SI RADŠEJ NEPOUŽIL SKUTOČNÉ NÁBOJE! AJ TAK SME UŽ VŠETCI MŔTVI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/12.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/13.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="590,202 598,169 625,144 700,119 867,119 935,138 969,165 979,200 965,242 919,271 833,285 717,283 635,267 598,242"><p>IF YOU WANNA DO THAT AGAIN, YOU'VE GOT ABOUT 9.2 SECONDS BEFORE MY NANOS METABOLIZE THE GAMMA- HYDROXYBUTYRATE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="681,454 690,417 715,388 769,360 879,360 938,377 975,406 990,452 977,502 935,538 875,552 783,552 719,531 690,498"><p>AT WHICH POINT I  START KICKING YOUR ASS UNLESS YOU COME UP WITH REALLY GOOD REASON WHY I SHOULDN'T.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="590,202 598,169 625,144 700,119 867,119 935,138 969,165 979,200 965,242 919,271 833,285 717,283 635,267 598,242"><p>AK TO CHCEŠ SPRAVIŤ ZNOVA, MÁŠ NA TO PRESNE 9.2 SEKÚND PREDTÝM, NEŽ MOJE NANOLÁTKY ZMETABOLIZUJÚ GAMMA- HYDROXYBUTYRÁT.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="681,454 690,417 715,388 769,360 879,360 938,377 975,406 990,452 977,502 935,538 875,552 783,552 719,531 690,498"><p>V TOM ČASE TI ZAČNEM NAKOPÁVAŤ PRDEL, AK NÁHODOU NEPRÍDEŠ S DOBRÝM DÔVODOM, PREČO BY SOM NEMAL.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/14.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="225,44 238,21 288,0 383,0 423,15 444,33 446,67 431,83 385,100 308,104 254,92 229,77"><p>SHUT UP AND LISTEN TO ME FOR A MINUTE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="215,181 215,225 250,271 294,294 365,308 508,310 598,302 671,275 698,248 710,225 710,181 698,160 669,133 648,121 598,106 527,100 425,100 396,110 315,110 260,131"><p>IT WAS NEVER SUPPOSED TO BE LIKE THIS. STEALING CANDY FROM WAL*MART AND THE MAFIA, THAT'S ONE THING. NOW WE'RE BACK TO KILLING INNOCENT PEOPLE FOR MONEY. WE'VE BECOME WHAT WE TRIED TO LEAVE BEHIND.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="285,381 292,356 317,333 377,321 465,321 517,329 552,350 563,385 544,417 513,431 458,442 375,438 321,427 294,410"><p>NO WE HAVEN'T. WE'RE NOT WORKING FOR BURTIN, WE'RE WORKING FOR US.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="240,488 240,523 265,552 283,565 296,567 419,567 450,546 465,529 465,523 469,519 469,488 465,483 463,473 444,454 427,446 367,446 331,440 283,440 277,442 271,452 246,473"><p>I'M NOT SURE I CAN TELL THE DIFFERENCE ANYMORE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="225,44 238,21 288,0 383,0 423,15 444,33 446,67 431,83 385,100 308,104 254,92 229,77"><p>DRŽ HUBU A POČÚVAJ MA CHVÍĽU.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="215,181 215,225 250,271 294,294 365,308 508,310 598,302 671,275 698,248 710,225 710,181 698,160 669,133 648,121 598,106 527,100 425,100 396,110 315,110 260,131"><p>TOTO SA NIKDY NEMALO STAŤ. UKRADNÚŤ CUKRÍK ZO SUPERMARKETU ALEBO MAFII, TO JE JEDNA VEC. ALE ZABÍJAŤ NEVINNÝCH ĽUDÍ PRE PENIAZE ...? STALI SME SA TÝMI, PROTI KTORÝM SME VŽDY CHCELI BOJOVAŤ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="285,381 292,356 317,333 377,321 465,321 517,329 552,350 563,385 544,417 513,431 458,442 375,438 321,427 294,410"><p>NIE NESTALI. MY NEPRACUJEME PRE BURTIN, MY PRACUJEME PRE NÁS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="240,488 240,523 265,552 283,565 296,567 419,567 450,546 465,529 465,523 469,519 469,488 465,483 463,473 444,454 427,446 367,446 331,440 283,440 277,442 271,452 246,473"><p>NIE SOM SI ISTÝ, ČI V TOM VIDÍM NEJAKÝ ROZDIEL.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/15.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="217,75 223,100 246,123 306,138 406,148 602,148 694,138 748,119 773,92 775,56 750,25 696,-2 344,-2 252,29 221,60"><p>LOOK, BURTIN HAS A CURE FOR THE PLAGUE. AND IN ADDITION TO ALL OF THE OTHER STUFF WE'VE STOLEN RECENTLY, WE HAVE THAT AS WELL. SO WE CAN STOP IT.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="242,208 256,190 306,171 400,158 650,158 729,169 785,192 794,219 769,240 692,256 596,263 435,265 338,254 267,240 248,227"><p>YOU FIXED US ALL REAL GOOD, DIDN'T YOU? THE FIRST CHURCH ALREADY KNOWS ABOUT THE ANTI-BIOTIC.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="217,340 225,365 246,385 300,404 371,410 429,410 494,404 556,383 573,367 577,356 577,327 550,298 498,279 458,277 452,275 352,275 346,277 296,279 281,288 252,294 229,315"><p>CATOXYUNE'S NOT AN ANTI-BIOTIC - THAT WAS JUST PART OF BURTIN'S DOUBLE-CROSS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="406,485 419,458 448,438 513,423 608,423 681,440 713,473 710,510 679,538 625,552 531,554 463,546 419,521 408,504"><p>IT'S A BACTERIOPHAGE, A MICROSCOPIC ORGANISM THAT EATS BACTERIA.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="217,75 223,100 246,123 306,138 406,148 602,148 694,138 748,119 773,92 775,56 750,25 696,-2 344,-2 252,29 221,60"><p>POZRI. V BURTIN MAJÚ LIEK NA NÁKAZU. A NAVYŠE OHĽADOM TOHO VŠETKÉHO, ČO SME NEDÁVNO UKRADLI, HO MÁME AJ MY. TAKŽE TO MÔŽEME ZASTAVIŤ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="242,208 256,190 306,171 400,158 650,158 729,169 785,192 794,219 769,240 692,256 596,263 435,265 338,254 267,240 248,227"><p>DAL SI NÁM VŠETKÝM PROTILÁTKU, ŽE ÁNO? PRVÁ CIRKEV UŽ O TÝCH ANTIBIOTIKÁCH VIE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="217,340 225,365 246,385 300,404 371,410 429,410 494,404 556,383 573,367 577,356 577,327 550,298 498,279 458,277 452,275 352,275 346,277 296,279 281,288 252,294 229,315"><p>CATOXYÓN NIE JE ANTIBIOTIKUM - BOLO TO PRE BURTIN AKO ZADNÉ DVIERKA.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="406,485 419,458 448,438 513,423 608,423 681,440 713,473 710,510 679,538 625,552 531,554 463,546 419,521 408,504"><p>JE TO BAKTERIOFÁG, MIKROSKOPICKÝ ORGANIZMUS, KTORÝ POŽIERA BAKTÉRIE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/16.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="300,121 313,92 346,65 400,46 450,38 608,38 673,48 723,71 750,102 752,148 725,194 669,217 583,231 469,231 379,217 319,183 302,154"><p>ANYWHERE YOU FIND BACTERIA, YOU FIND PHAGES THAT EAT THEM, AND CATOXYUNE IS DESIGNED TO KEEP UP WITH THE PLAGUE'S MUTATIONS, TO EVOLVE ALONG WITH IT. TO STOP PANDEMIC.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="310,425 321,385 350,350 408,325 475,315 629,315 708,331 760,363 785,408 777,469 744,504 685,529 606,542 488,544 400,527 344,502 317,465"><p>OF COURSE, BURTIN'S NOT DOING THIS AS A PUBLIC SERVICE. THEY'LL MAKE A KILLING ON CATOXYUNE SALES. THEY JUST NEED TO LET A FEW HUNDRED MILLION PEOPLE DIE FIRST IN ORDER TO MAKE THE WHOLE THING LOOK PLAUSIBLE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="300,121 313,92 346,65 400,46 450,38 608,38 673,48 723,71 750,102 752,148 725,194 669,217 583,231 469,231 379,217 319,183 302,154"><p>VŠADE, KDE JE MOŽNÉ NÁJSŤ BAKTÉRIE, SA NACHÁDZAJÚ AJ FÁGY, KTORÉ ICH POŽIERAJÚ. A CATOXYÓN JE VYTVORENÝ TAK, ABY DOKÁZAL DRŽAŤ KROK S MUTÁCIAMI, VYVÝJA SA ZÁROVEŇ S BAKTÉRIAMI, ABY ZASTAVIL PANDÉMIU.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="310,425 321,385 350,350 408,325 475,315 629,315 708,331 760,363 785,408 777,469 744,504 685,529 606,542 488,544 400,527 344,502 317,465"><p>SAMOZREJME, ŽE TOTO V BURTIN NEROBIA AKO SLUŽBU PRE VEREJNOSŤ. ZAROBIA ŤAŽKÉ PRACHY NA PREDAJOCH CATOXYÓNU. POTREBUJÚ LEN, ABY PÁR MILIÓN ĽUDÍ NAJSKÔR ZOMRELO, ABY TO CELÉ VYZERALO UVERITEĽNE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/17.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="35,144 46,213 60,238 100,271 181,300 277,310 425,310 433,300 513,281 540,267 581,227 598,185 592,104 554,63 498,31 396,13 246,13 142,31 98,52 60,85"><p>BUT ASHER SAYS ANY OPEN SOURCE LAB IN THE WORLD CAN MAKE CATOXYUNE FROM WHATEVER PHAGE HAPPENS TO BE LIVING IN THEIR TOILET. IT'S HIGH SCHOOL SCIENCE SHIT.. WE CAN JUST POST THE MUTATION SEQUENCE ON THE NET AND TWO DAYS LATER THERE'S A PHAGE SHOP ON EVERY CORNER OF EVERY CITY IN THE WORLD.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="15,350 31,329 85,310 198,310 254,313 310,317 350,340 348,369 304,390 231,398 148,398 75,392 31,379 17,367"><p>AND THEN WE'RE DEAD - BURTIN WILL BE ALL OVER US.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#f8f8f8" points="244,442 244,481 256,510 283,538 342,563 652,563 713,538 744,506 754,481 752,444 744,419 706,383 646,363 560,352 435,352 369,358 331,388 271,400 250,423"><p>THIS IS GOING TO START A WAR. WHEN THEY REALIZE WHAT'S HAPPENED, THE CHURCH WILL HAVE THEIR DAYENDER ARMY FIGHTING BURTIN BLACKWATER DIVISIONS ALL OVER THE WORLD. WE'LL JUST SIT BACK AND WATCH THE GAME.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="35,144 46,213 60,238 100,271 181,300 277,310 425,310 433,300 513,281 540,267 581,227 598,185 592,104 554,63 498,31 396,13 246,13 142,31 98,52 60,85"><p>ASHER HOVORÍ, ŽE HOCIJAKÉ OBYČAJNÉ LABORATÓRIUM NA SVETE DOKÁŽE VYROBIŤ CATOXYÓN Z TOHO, ČO ZROVNA ŽIJE NA ICH TOALETE. JE TO STREDOŠKOLSKÁ VEDA. STAČÍ AK ZVEREJNÍME MUTAČNÚ SEKVENCIU NA NETE A O DVA DNI NESKÔR UŽ EXISTUJE OBCHOD PREDÁVAJÚCI FÁGY V KAŽDOM ROHU KAŽDÉHO MESTA NA SVETE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="15,350 31,329 85,310 198,310 254,313 310,317 350,340 348,369 304,390 231,398 148,398 75,392 31,379 17,367"><p>A POTOM JE PO NÁS - BURTIN SI NÁS NÁJDE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#f8f8f8" points="244,442 244,481 256,510 283,538 342,563 652,563 713,538 744,506 754,481 752,444 744,419 706,383 646,363 560,352 435,352 369,358 331,388 271,400 250,423"><p>TOTO SAMOZREJME ZAČNE VOJNU. KEĎ DOJDÚ NA TO, ČO SA STALO, CIRKEV POUŽIJE SVOJU ARMÁDU NA BOJ PROTI BURTINSKÝM BLACKWATER DIVÍZIÁM PO CELOM SVETE. BUDEME SA NA TO LEN POZERAŤ Z DIAĽKY A UŽÍVAŤ SI TO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/18.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="31,73 35,44 58,21 92,0 500,0 546,27 560,56 548,94 496,123 435,135 333,142 198,140 119,129 52,102"><p>WHY DIDN'T YOU JUST TRASH THE PACKAGE ONCE YOU HAD EVERYTHING FIGURED OUT? YOU JUST COULD'T STAND TO LEAVE MONEY ON THE TABLE, COULD YOU?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="0,256 10,221 31,194 79,165 165,148 381,148 446,169 492,208 508,260 496,315 448,354 379,375 300,385 177,381 71,360 19,325 0,283"><p>I DIDN'T DO THIS FOR THE MONEY, THOUGH WE DID MAKE A FAIR BIT. THE FACT IS THAT BURTIN CAN FIND ANOTHER RAT. THE CHURCH CAN RE-CULTURE THEIR BACTERIA. THEY DON'T NEED US TO MAKE THIS PLAN WORK. THEY JUST NEED US TO FUCK IT UP.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="29,492 35,456 71,431 138,413 194,406 315,406 406,419 469,444 492,479 469,525 415,550 338,567 177,567 123,554 58,535 38,517"><p>AND LIKE YOU SAID: WE LEFT BURTIN FOR A REASON. LETTING A HUNDRED MILLION PEOPLE DIE JUST ISN'T AT THE TOP OF MY TO-DO LIST TODAY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="31,73 35,44 58,21 92,0 500,0 546,27 560,56 548,94 496,123 435,135 333,142 198,140 119,129 52,102"><p>PREČO SI TEN BALÍK NEZNIČIL, KEĎ SI NA TO VŠETKO PRIŠIEL? NEMOHOL SI LEN TAK NECHAŤ NA STOLE BALÍK PEŇAZÍ, ŽE ÁNO?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="0,256 10,221 31,194 79,165 165,148 381,148 446,169 492,208 508,260 496,315 448,354 379,375 300,385 177,381 71,360 19,325 0,283"><p>NESPRAVIL SOM TO PRE PENIAZE, HOCI SME NA TOM NIEČO ZAROBILI. FAKTOM JE, ŽE BURTIN DOKÁŽE NÁJSŤ ĎALŠIEHO POTKANA. CIRKEV DOKÁŽE REKULTIVOVAŤ ICH BAKTÉRIE. NEPOTREBUJÚ NÁS NA TO, ABY TO DOKÁZALI. POTREBUJÚ LEN, ABY SME TO ZBABRALI.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="29,492 35,456 71,431 138,413 194,406 315,406 406,419 469,444 492,479 469,525 415,550 338,567 177,567 123,554 58,535 38,517"><p>A AKO SI POVEDAL: NEOPUSTILI SME BURTIN BEZ DÔVODU. NECHAŤ ZOMRIEŤ MILIÓN ĽUDÍ PROSTE NIE JE DNES NA PRVOM MIESTE V MEDZI MOJIMI PRIORITAMI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/19.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="427,31 442,15 483,0 621,0 663,15 675,35 663,60 633,75 560,79 485,75 440,60 429,48"><p>SO WHAT ARE WE WAITING FOR?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="258,167 277,135 319,113 398,96 540,96 631,110 681,144 685,177 660,215 602,240 500,250 394,248 315,229 271,202"><p>ASHER'S RE-CHECKING THE FINAL SEQUENCING DIAGRAMS RIGHT NOW. WE JUST HAVE TO STAY ALIVE FOR ANOTHER FEW HOURS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="442,333 458,302 500,281 542,273 619,273 685,290 719,327 717,360 690,388 638,406 552,408 477,394 444,365"><p>THEN WE SEND THE PHAGE RECIPE ON ITS WAY, PUT OUR MONEY IN THE BANK,</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="375,485 394,456 450,435 558,435 600,446 635,471 640,510 604,540 535,552 454,550 400,538 375,513"><p>AND GO ON A NICE HOLIDAY SOMEWHERE WARM AND SUNNY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="427,31 442,15 483,0 621,0 663,15 675,35 663,60 633,75 560,79 485,75 440,60 429,48"><p>TAK NA ČO TEDA EŠTE ČAKÁME?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="258,167 277,135 319,113 398,96 540,96 631,110 681,144 685,177 660,215 602,240 500,250 394,248 315,229 271,202"><p>ASHER PRÁVE TERAZ KONTOLUJE POSLEDNÉ SEKVENCIE DIAGRAMU. MUSÍME LEN VYDRŽAŤ NAŽIVE NIEKOĽKO ĎALŠÍCH HODÍN.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="442,333 458,302 500,281 542,273 619,273 685,290 719,327 717,360 690,388 638,406 552,408 477,394 444,365"><p>POTOM POŠLEME RECEPT NA FÁGA PO INTERNETE, VLOŽÍME NAŠE PENIAZE DO BANKY,</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="375,485 394,456 450,435 558,435 600,446 635,471 640,510 604,540 535,552 454,550 400,538 375,513"><p>A PÔJDEME NA DOVOLENKU NIEKAM, KDE JE TEPLO A SLNEČNO.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/20.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="369,54 385,33 421,25 479,25 521,44 515,75 485,90 438,92 396,85 375,75"><p>SOUNDS GREAT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="369,54 385,33 421,25 479,25 521,44 515,75 485,90 438,92 396,85 375,75"><p>TO ZNIE SUPER.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/21.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="17,69 17,79 19,83 31,96 35,96 42,100 58,102 60,104 71,104 73,106 156,106 158,104 169,104 196,96 202,92 210,81 210,63 200,54 179,44 171,44 169,42 152,40 150,40 79,40 77,40 54,42 31,52"><p>BUT WHAT...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="17,69 17,79 19,83 31,96 35,96 42,100 58,102 60,104 71,104 73,106 156,106 158,104 169,104 196,96 202,92 210,81 210,63 200,54 179,44 171,44 169,42 152,40 150,40 79,40 77,40 54,42 31,52"><p>ČO ALE...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 6/22.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="25,52 25,56 31,65 42,73 48,73 52,77 58,77 60,79 90,79 94,83 158,83 165,79 192,79 194,77 200,77 204,73 210,73 225,60 225,44 208,31 196,29 188,25 177,25 167,23 81,23 77,25 67,25 60,29 46,31 38,35 29,44"><p>THE FUCK...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="25,52 25,56 31,65 42,73 48,73 52,77 58,77 60,79 90,79 94,83 158,83 165,79 192,79 194,77 200,77 204,73 210,73 225,60 225,44 208,31 196,29 188,25 177,25 167,23 81,23 77,25 67,25 60,29 46,31 38,35 29,44"><p>DO PEKLA...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 6/23.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="223,48 233,25 271,15 329,15 360,35 356,67 310,79 250,75 229,67"><p>IS THAT?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="223,48 233,25 271,15 329,15 360,35 356,67 310,79 250,75 229,67"><p>JE TOTO?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/24.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="394,33 392,31 392,27 385,21 381,21 379,19 377,19 375,17 371,17 365,13 356,13 350,8 342,8 340,8 333,8 331,10 325,10 323,13 315,13 313,15 306,15 302,19 296,21 285,31 285,33 283,35 283,54 288,60 292,60 296,65 306,67 313,71 319,71 321,73 356,73 358,71 367,71 369,69 375,69 379,65 383,65 392,58 392,52 394,50"><p>JAKE!</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="392,100 392,115 394,119 415,138 427,138 431,142 452,142 454,144 502,142 506,138 519,138 531,129 542,119 542,96 538,90 525,77 521,75 515,75 508,71 492,69 490,69 446,69 444,69 421,73 406,81 396,92"><p>WHAT?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fdfdfd" points="558,50 558,71 563,79 579,96 602,106 640,110 644,115 700,115 704,110 727,110 735,106 748,106 752,102 769,96 788,75 788,48 783,38 771,27 754,23 744,17 733,17 729,13 696,13 690,10 667,10 665,10 644,10 642,13 629,13 621,17 608,17 581,27"><p>YOU SCAN THIS THING FOR TRACKERS?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="592,173 592,188 598,196 598,202 604,210 615,219 621,219 625,223 638,225 642,229 713,229 717,225 733,223 738,219 744,219 758,206 763,200 763,190 767,185 767,175 763,171 763,165 748,148 742,146 735,140 729,140 723,135 702,135 700,135 656,135 654,135 640,135 633,140 625,140 621,144 613,146 604,154 598,167"><p>EVERY 30 SECONDS, MAN.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="394,33 392,31 392,27 385,21 381,21 379,19 377,19 375,17 371,17 365,13 356,13 350,8 342,8 340,8 333,8 331,10 325,10 323,13 315,13 313,15 306,15 302,19 296,21 285,31 285,33 283,35 283,54 288,60 292,60 296,65 306,67 313,71 319,71 321,73 356,73 358,71 367,71 369,69 375,69 379,65 383,65 392,58 392,52 394,50"><p>JAKE!</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="392,100 392,115 394,119 415,138 427,138 431,142 452,142 454,144 502,142 506,138 519,138 531,129 542,119 542,96 538,90 525,77 521,75 515,75 508,71 492,69 490,69 446,69 444,69 421,73 406,81 396,92"><p>ÁNO?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fdfdfd" points="558,50 558,71 563,79 579,96 602,106 640,110 644,115 700,115 704,110 727,110 735,106 748,106 752,102 769,96 788,75 788,48 783,38 771,27 754,23 744,17 733,17 729,13 696,13 690,10 667,10 665,10 644,10 642,13 629,13 621,17 608,17 581,27"><p>SKENUJEŠ TÚTO VEC NA PLOŠTICE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="592,173 592,188 598,196 598,202 604,210 615,219 621,219 625,223 638,225 642,229 713,229 717,225 733,223 738,219 744,219 758,206 763,200 763,190 767,185 767,175 763,171 763,165 748,148 742,146 735,140 729,140 723,135 702,135 700,135 656,135 654,135 640,135 633,140 625,140 621,144 613,146 604,154 598,167"><p>KAŽDÝCH 30 SEKÚND, ČLOVEČE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/25.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="229,92 229,115 238,144 260,171 300,190 381,200 385,204 456,204 460,200 510,196 550,181 565,181 602,146 602,135 610,121 610,83 606,73 577,42 531,21 473,13 369,13 308,21 263,44 240,67"><p>IT'S PROBABLY NEXT GEN BLACKWATER PRODUCT. NOT IN ANY OF THE SCAN PATTERNS. THEY MUST HAVE BEEN TAGGED DURING THE RAT PICK-UP.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="235,250 235,265 242,285 258,304 265,308 275,308 283,315 296,315 308,319 396,319 400,315 417,313 444,300 452,292 460,269 460,231 419,208 365,208 344,206 294,206 277,208 256,221 246,231 242,244"><p>AND WHERE HAS THIS HEAP OF SHIT BEEN LATELY?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="408,519 410,521 413,529 421,538 431,544 446,544 450,548 523,548 527,544 540,544 546,540 550,540 563,529 563,510 556,502 544,496 531,494 529,492 521,492 519,492 438,492 429,498 423,500 413,510"><p>ASHER...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="229,92 229,115 238,144 260,171 300,190 381,200 385,204 456,204 460,200 510,196 550,181 565,181 602,146 602,135 610,121 610,83 606,73 577,42 531,21 473,13 369,13 308,21 263,44 240,67"><p>JE TO PRAVDEPODOBNE NOVÁ GENERÁCIA PRODUKTU OD BLACKWATER. NEOBJAVÍ JU BEŽNÝ SKEN. MUSELI TO NAINŠTALOVAŤ POČAS TEJ AKCIE S POTKANOM.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="235,250 235,265 242,285 258,304 265,308 275,308 283,315 296,315 308,319 396,319 400,315 417,313 444,300 452,292 460,269 460,231 419,208 365,208 344,206 294,206 277,208 256,221 246,231 242,244"><p>A KDE SA POSLEDNE POHYBOVALA TÁTO KOPA HOVNA?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="408,519 410,521 413,529 421,538 431,544 446,544 450,548 523,548 527,544 540,544 546,540 550,540 563,529 563,510 556,502 544,496 531,494 529,492 521,492 519,492 438,492 429,498 423,500 413,510"><p>ASHER...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/26.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="1,49 1,66 5,79 23,100 45,111 71,115 74,118 155,119 193,111 219,98 230,86 236,74 236,40 229,25 211,10 183,0 54,0 48,5 30,10 8,33"><p>I'M CALLING IN THE RAVEN. BLACKWATER IS PROBABLY ALREADY ON THEIR WAY TO ASHER'S AND THAT MOTO WON'T STAND A CHANCE IF THEY'VE GOT AIR SUPPORT.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="1,49 1,66 5,79 23,100 45,111 71,115 74,118 155,119 193,111 219,98 230,86 236,74 236,40 229,25 211,10 183,0 54,0 48,5 30,10 8,33"><p>VOLÁM HAVRANOVI. BLACKWATER SÚ UŽ PRAVDEPODOBNE NA CESTE K ASHEROVI A TÁ JEHO KRAKSŇA NEBUDE MAŤ ŽIADNU ŠANCU, KEĎŽE MAJÚ PODPORU ZO VZDUCHU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/27.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/28.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="23,56 23,73 29,96 52,117 73,123 77,127 90,127 94,131 204,133 221,131 225,127 246,127 252,121 258,121 279,108 292,96 292,90 298,83 298,54 292,40 260,10 246,4 238,4 231,0 90,0 83,4 75,4 71,8 50,15 29,35"><p>JAKE, YOU'VE GOT ABOUT FIFTY BLOCKS TO LEARN HOW TO FLY THIS THING.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="340,467 340,496 348,510 367,525 373,525 377,529 396,529 400,533 452,533 458,529 475,529 479,525 483,525 488,521 496,519 510,504 513,471 506,460 506,456 498,448 477,438 463,435 450,431 406,431 400,433 383,435 373,440 365,440 354,448 348,458"><p>I THOUGHT IT WAS A DRONE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="640,452 640,483 652,510 671,529 721,548 767,554 846,554 892,548 917,540 946,525 960,510 975,477 969,440 942,406 919,394 890,390 879,383 858,383 854,381 748,381 744,383 708,390 665,415 654,425"><p>IT'LL FLY ON MANUAL. AND WE'LL PROBABLY NEED SOME REAL DRIVING IF BURTIN IS GOING IN WITH GUNS BLAZING.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="23,56 23,73 29,96 52,117 73,123 77,127 90,127 94,131 204,133 221,131 225,127 246,127 252,121 258,121 279,108 292,96 292,90 298,83 298,54 292,40 260,10 246,4 238,4 231,0 90,0 83,4 75,4 71,8 50,15 29,35"><p>JAKE, MÁŠ ASI PÄŤDESIAT BLOKOV NA TO, ABY SI SA TÚTO VEC NAUČIL RIADIŤ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="340,467 340,496 348,510 367,525 373,525 377,529 396,529 400,533 452,533 458,529 475,529 479,525 483,525 488,521 496,519 510,504 513,471 506,460 506,456 498,448 477,438 463,435 450,431 406,431 400,433 383,435 373,440 365,440 354,448 348,458"><p>MYSLEL SOM, ŽE JE TO DRÓN.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="640,452 640,483 652,510 671,529 721,548 767,554 846,554 892,548 917,540 946,525 960,510 975,477 969,440 942,406 919,394 890,390 879,383 858,383 854,381 748,381 744,383 708,390 665,415 654,425"><p>POLETÍ TO AJ NA MANUÁL. A BUDEME PRAVDEPODOBNE POTREBOVAŤ DOBRÉHO PILOTA, KEĎ NA NÁS VYBEHNE BURTIN S NABITÝMI BÚCHAČKAMI.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/29.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="396,48 396,77 406,90 417,94 421,98 427,98 429,100 435,100 438,102 483,102 485,100 492,100 496,96 500,96 504,92 508,92 519,81 521,81 521,44 519,42 519,38 502,23 485,21 483,19 473,19 471,19 440,19 435,21 419,23 402,38"><p>IS IT FAST?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="469,127 471,140 488,158 517,171 527,171 529,173 617,173 640,167 654,156 660,156 669,148 671,142 671,108 654,90 621,75 604,75 602,75 535,75 527,79 523,92 515,100 494,108 481,110 473,119"><p>JUST SHUT UP AND DRIVE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="396,48 396,77 406,90 417,94 421,98 427,98 429,100 435,100 438,102 483,102 485,100 492,100 496,96 500,96 504,92 508,92 519,81 521,81 521,44 519,42 519,38 502,23 485,21 483,19 473,19 471,19 440,19 435,21 419,23 402,38"><p>JE TO RÝCHLE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="469,127 471,140 488,158 517,171 527,171 529,173 617,173 640,167 654,156 660,156 669,148 671,142 671,108 654,90 621,75 604,75 602,75 535,75 527,79 523,92 515,100 494,108 481,110 473,119"><p>DRŽ UŽ HUBU A LEŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/30.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/31.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="48,51 49,104 53,110 351,110 354,67 351,49 58,48" type="commentary"><p>AT ASHER'S LAB...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="48,51 49,104 53,110 351,110 354,67 351,49 58,48" type="commentary"><p>V ASHEROVOM LABÁKU...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 6/32.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/33.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/34.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/35.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/36.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/37.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="44,46 46,66 59,79 77,88 130,100 187,105 305,105 385,99 442,85 469,63 466,40 444,19 328,4 185,4 132,7 67,24"><p>THEY'LL BE THROUGH IN LESS THAN A MINUTE. WE'RE OUTNUMBERED.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="474,79 474,92 478,103 492,115 518,124 560,128 614,128 616,127 655,122 677,112 686,103 691,93 690,74 672,56 651,47 609,44 555,44 510,49 488,60 477,71"><p>WE'RE ALWAYS OUTNUMBERED.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="827,55 827,76 836,94 849,107 867,116 871,116 877,121 933,121 958,118 979,110 1000,88 1000,43 977,20 949,11 893,11 870,12 849,22 831,41"><p>JUST DO WHAT I SAY, WHEN I SAY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="44,46 46,66 59,79 77,88 130,100 187,105 305,105 385,99 442,85 469,63 466,40 444,19 328,4 185,4 132,7 67,24"><p>DOSTANÚ SA CEZ TO ZA MENEJ AKO MINÚTU. SÚ V PRESILE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="474,79 474,92 478,103 492,115 518,124 560,128 614,128 616,127 655,122 677,112 686,103 691,93 690,74 672,56 651,47 609,44 555,44 510,49 488,60 477,71"><p>ONI SÚ VŽDY V PRESILE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="827,55 827,76 836,94 849,107 867,116 871,116 877,121 933,121 958,118 979,110 1000,88 1000,43 977,20 949,11 893,11 870,12 849,22 831,41"><p>LEN UROB TO, ČO TI POVIEM, KEĎ TO POVIEM.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/38.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="202,131 217,114 307,103 325,113 329,145 317,159 221,172 205,160" text-rotation="8"><p>ASHER?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="202,131 217,114 307,103 325,113 329,145 317,159 221,172 205,160" text-rotation="8"><p>ASHER?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/39.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="358,42 359,56 364,66 381,80 386,89 433,89 435,90 497,90 540,82 555,74 566,63 570,50 568,33 552,16 524,6 485,3 424,3 415,6 395,9 388,13 381,13 362,31"><p>ASHER. WE'RE ON OUR WAY.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="466,128 467,145 479,158 511,166 513,167 579,167 591,166 597,163 610,161 614,157 618,157 629,145 629,141 631,139 629,126 618,114 600,106 574,104 520,104 517,104 507,104 505,106 494,107 479,114"><p>HOW FAR?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="367,208 370,222 379,230 383,230 391,235 431,241 518,241 523,237 530,237 555,229 565,219 565,205 556,195 534,186 495,183 450,183 407,185 380,192 370,202"><p>TWO MINUTES.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="358,42 359,56 364,66 381,80 386,89 433,89 435,90 497,90 540,82 555,74 566,63 570,50 568,33 552,16 524,6 485,3 424,3 415,6 395,9 388,13 381,13 362,31"><p>ASHER. SME UŽ NA CESTE.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="466,128 467,145 479,158 511,166 513,167 579,167 591,166 597,163 610,161 614,157 618,157 629,145 629,141 631,139 629,126 618,114 600,106 574,104 520,104 517,104 507,104 505,106 494,107 479,114"><p>AKO ĎALEKO?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="367,208 370,222 379,230 383,230 391,235 431,241 518,241 523,237 530,237 555,229 565,219 565,205 556,195 534,186 495,183 450,183 407,185 380,192 370,202"><p>DVE MINÚTY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/40.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="15,86 20,55 60,26 135,8 303,8 384,23 431,54 435,92 409,120 330,144 255,148 145,144 61,131 29,114"><p>WAGNER, LISTEN. LANEY HAS THE GENE SEQUENCE. YOU'LL HAVE TO GRAB HER ON A DRIVE-BY AT THE HANGAR.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fbfbfb" points="357,170 359,191 364,201 373,210 389,217 391,226 482,226 512,222 521,217 531,215 539,209 551,196 555,181 553,159 532,137 518,131 487,126 430,126 413,127 398,135 376,142 362,156"><p>YOU'LL GRAB US BOTH.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="535,62 537,28 559,9 577,1 669,1 702,24 704,59 689,82 647,98 584,95 550,83"><p>JUST GRAB WHAT YOU CAN.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="15,86 20,55 60,26 135,8 303,8 384,23 431,54 435,92 409,120 330,144 255,148 145,144 61,131 29,114"><p>WAGNER, POČÚVAJ. LANEY MÁ GÉNOVÚ SEKVENCIU. BUDEŠ JU MUSIEŤ VYZDVIHNÚŤ NA PREJAZDE PRI HANGÁRI.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fbfbfb" points="357,170 359,191 364,201 373,210 389,217 391,226 482,226 512,222 521,217 531,215 539,209 551,196 555,181 553,159 532,137 518,131 487,126 430,126 413,127 398,135 376,142 362,156"><p>VYZDVIHNEŠ NÁS OBOCH.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="535,62 537,28 559,9 577,1 669,1 702,24 704,59 689,82 647,98 584,95 550,83"><p>SPRAV TO, ČO SA TI PODARÍ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/41.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/42.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="102,13 100,21 98,23 98,40 101,44 103,50 111,58 116,59 118,61 133,63 162,63 164,61 176,60 184,51 184,48 189,42 189,22 187,19 187,16 175,3 171,2 167,0 121,0 115,3 110,4"><p>LANEY. GO! I'LL CATCH UP!</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="102,13 100,21 98,23 98,40 101,44 103,50 111,58 116,59 118,61 133,63 162,63 164,61 176,60 184,51 184,48 189,42 189,22 187,19 187,16 175,3 171,2 167,0 121,0 115,3 110,4"><p>CHOĎ, LANEY! JA ŤA DOBEHNEM!</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/43.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="761,58 766,91 783,112 808,123 838,129 905,130 958,122 977,113 998,92 998,47 980,29 971,24 928,13 859,13 816,17 789,27 772,42"><p>FACILITY SYSTEMS BEGIN SEQUENCE! BRAVO...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="761,58 766,91 783,112 808,123 838,129 905,130 958,122 977,113 998,92 998,47 980,29 971,24 928,13 859,13 816,17 789,27 772,42"><p>SYSTÉMY BUDOVY ZAHÁJIŤ SEKVENCIU! BRAVO...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/44.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="489,41 488,55 490,63 505,79 509,79 520,84 531,84 533,86 575,86 582,84 592,84 600,82 604,79 612,77 624,65 626,55 626,46 624,44 624,38 609,23 586,17 532,17 529,17 520,18 517,21 504,25 492,36"><p>LIMA...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="489,41 488,55 490,63 505,79 509,79 520,84 531,84 533,86 575,86 582,84 592,84 600,82 604,79 612,77 624,65 626,55 626,46 624,44 624,38 609,23 586,17 532,17 529,17 520,18 517,21 504,25 492,36"><p>LIMA...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/45.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="210,87 210,91 212,95 224,106 231,106 233,108 240,108 244,109 264,109 266,108 273,108 275,106 283,105 292,97 293,82 292,81 292,78 288,73 286,72 282,72 280,70 277,70 275,68 271,68 266,67 240,67 235,68 229,68 223,71 212,82"><p>OSCAR...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="210,87 210,91 212,95 224,106 231,106 233,108 240,108 244,109 264,109 266,108 273,108 275,106 283,105 292,97 293,82 292,81 292,78 288,73 286,72 282,72 280,70 277,70 275,68 271,68 266,67 240,67 235,68 229,68 223,71 212,82"><p>OSKAR...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/46.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/47.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="204,92 207,69 226,55 255,47 312,47 348,59 335,97 315,118 250,117 216,108"><p>WHISK...</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="204,92 207,69 226,55 255,47 312,47 348,59 335,97 315,118 250,117 216,108"><p>WHISK...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/48.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="460,45 460,68 467,84 484,102 498,109 500,118 610,118 642,114 675,99 690,83 695,64 694,43 688,30 665,10 657,8 654,4 645,4 632,1 517,1 513,3 492,9 480,17 468,29"><p>I THINK THIS IS GOING TO BE AN AIRBORNE DELIVERY.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="750,401 753,429 758,439 770,451 799,465 847,471 906,471 942,467 983,450 999,433 1000,426 999,387 980,368 962,360 961,349 958,349 870,349 822,350 795,357 771,369 753,389"><p>THERE'S A 93% CHANCE YOU'LL BREAK BOTH OF YOUR ARMS.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="773,509 773,515 779,533 792,546 803,551 811,552 813,554 823,554 825,555 875,555 877,554 887,554 908,544 920,532 920,529 924,524 924,501 918,492 900,477 835,477 830,477 803,477 790,481 779,492"><p>JUST BE THERE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="460,45 460,68 467,84 484,102 498,109 500,118 610,118 642,114 675,99 690,83 695,64 694,43 688,30 665,10 657,8 654,4 645,4 632,1 517,1 513,3 492,9 480,17 468,29"><p>MYSLÍM, ŽE TOTO BUDE DORUČENIE LETECKY.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="750,401 753,429 758,439 770,451 799,465 847,471 906,471 942,467 983,450 999,433 1000,426 999,387 980,368 962,360 961,349 958,349 870,349 822,350 795,357 771,369 753,389"><p>EXISTUJE 93% ŠANCA, ŽE SI DOLÁMEŠ OBE RUKY.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="773,509 773,515 779,533 792,546 803,551 811,552 813,554 823,554 825,555 875,555 877,554 887,554 908,544 920,532 920,529 924,524 924,501 918,492 900,477 835,477 830,477 803,477 790,481 779,492"><p>LEN ABY SI TAM BOL.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/49.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/50.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/51.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/52.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="302,69 300,79 302,95 310,110 316,116 321,118 328,128 366,128 368,129 401,129 403,128 416,128 425,123 432,123 437,118 447,115 456,106 456,93 451,78 451,60 449,55 439,45 421,38 407,37 405,37 361,37 335,40 319,48 307,60"><p>ARE WE GOOD JAKE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="459,51 460,83 467,96 482,111 508,121 547,128 608,128 660,117 678,107 691,94 697,75 695,45 691,37 675,21 654,9 645,9 623,2 607,2 603,1 551,1 505,9 482,20 465,37"><p>UNTIL THOSE THINGS SHOOT US OUT OF THE SKY, YEAH.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="302,69 300,79 302,95 310,110 316,116 321,118 328,128 366,128 368,129 401,129 403,128 416,128 425,123 432,123 437,118 447,115 456,106 456,93 451,78 451,60 449,55 439,45 421,38 407,37 405,37 361,37 335,40 319,48 307,60"><p>SME V PORIADKU, JAKE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="459,51 460,83 467,96 482,111 508,121 547,128 608,128 660,117 678,107 691,94 697,75 695,45 691,37 675,21 654,9 645,9 623,2 607,2 603,1 551,1 505,9 482,20 465,37"><p>DOKIAĽ NÁS NEZOSTRELIA TIE RAKETY TAK HEJ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/53.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="37,59 38,84 43,96 57,110 88,123 113,125 170,125 202,121 226,111 242,95 246,77 249,74 249,64 244,56 243,48 227,31 208,21 178,16 107,16 84,19 57,31 43,45"><p>GET ME A MEDIC! I WANT THIS FUCKER ALIVE!</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="794,34 794,58 799,70 817,86 834,93 842,93 850,95 922,95 925,91 942,83 956,69 960,59 961,37 956,22 940,6 930,2 825,2 815,6 799,22"><p>WHAT THE HELL IS HE SAYING?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="37,59 38,84 43,96 57,110 88,123 113,125 170,125 202,121 226,111 242,95 246,77 249,74 249,64 244,56 243,48 227,31 208,21 178,16 107,16 84,19 57,31 43,45"><p>ZOŽENTE DOKTORA! CHCEM TOHTO BASTARDA NAŽIVE!</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="794,34 794,58 799,70 817,86 834,93 842,93 850,95 922,95 925,91 942,83 956,69 960,59 961,37 956,22 940,6 930,2 825,2 815,6 799,22"><p>ČO TO DO PEKLA MRMLE?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 6/54.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="661,110 663,143 686,170 728,185 778,190 838,190 904,179 925,169 944,150 950,134 949,107 944,97 927,80 896,65 856,60 852,57 781,57 713,65 684,81 668,97"><p>HE'S ABOUT TO BUY THE FARM AND HE WANTS A GLASS OF <emphasis>WHISKEY.</emphasis></p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="661,110 663,143 686,170 728,185 778,190 838,190 904,179 925,169 944,150 950,134 949,107 944,97 927,80 896,65 856,60 852,57 781,57 713,65 684,81 668,97"><p>IDE SI PRÁVE KÚPIŤ FARMU A CHCE POHÁR <emphasis>WHISKEY.</emphasis></p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="blend">
      <image href="Issue 6/55.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="650,113 650,201 668,219 948,219 963,205 963,112 943,95 677,95 666,96" type="code"><p>SELF DESTCRUCT AUTHORIZED. BRAVO, LIMA, OSCAR, WHISKEY.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="650,113 650,201 668,219 948,219 963,205 963,112 943,95 677,95 666,96" type="code"><p>SAMODEŠTUKCIA AUTORIZOVANÁ. BRAVO, LIMA, OSKAR, WHISKEY.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
