    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="214,87 491,87 491,137 213,137" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>ONE WEEK LATER.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="152,231 615,231 615,299 150,299" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>ASHER'S BEACHFRONT VILLA.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="418,413 846,413 846,465 417,465" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>TERRA NOVA BAY, ANTARCTICA.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="214,87 491,87 491,137 213,137" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>O TÝŽDEŇ NESKÔR.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="152,231 615,231 615,299 150,299" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>ASHEROVA VILA NA PLÁŽI.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#020202" points="418,413 846,413 846,465 417,465" type="commentary" inverted="True"><p>ZÁLIV TERRA NOVA, ANTARKTÍDA.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/70.jpg"/>
    </page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/71.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="394,57 394,77 401,92 408,99 416,99 432,106 443,106 445,108 487,108 489,106 500,106 504,103 510,103 513,99 521,96 533,84 537,69 534,51 522,38 511,31 494,28 491,27 440,27 438,28 424,30 408,38 399,47 398,53"><p>ARE WE READY?</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#fefefe" points="394,57 394,77 401,92 408,99 416,99 432,106 443,106 445,108 487,108 489,106 500,106 504,103 510,103 513,99 521,96 533,84 537,69 534,51 522,38 511,31 494,28 491,27 440,27 438,28 424,30 408,38 399,47 398,53"><p>SME PRIPRAVENÍ?</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/72.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="325,72 328,112 340,134 357,151 394,165 427,170 545,170 588,158 610,146 629,127 640,99 638,63 628,42 616,30 586,12 539,1 427,1 389,9 356,25 336,45"><p>I'VE GOT OVER TWO HUNDRED DRUG LAB CONTACTS RIGHT HERE. FROM THERE IT SHOULD SPREAD PRETTY FAST.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="403,223 402,262 404,273 410,283 435,305 459,311 464,315 529,317 577,310 598,298 615,281 622,266 623,232 618,216 611,206 590,189 546,178 485,178 460,180 429,193 411,210"><p>THE GENE CODES ARE PACKAGED AND READY TO DISTRIBUTE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="325,72 328,112 340,134 357,151 394,165 427,170 545,170 588,158 610,146 629,127 640,99 638,63 628,42 616,30 586,12 539,1 427,1 389,9 356,25 336,45"><p>MÁM TU ASI DVESTO KONTAKTOV NA LABÁKY PO CELOM SVETE. ODTIAĽ BY SA TO MALO ROZŠÍRIŤ VEĽMI RÝCHLO.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="403,223 402,262 404,273 410,283 435,305 459,311 464,315 529,317 577,310 598,298 615,281 622,266 623,232 618,216 611,206 590,189 546,178 485,178 460,180 429,193 411,210"><p>GÉNOVÉ SEKVENCIE SÚ ZBALENÉ A PRIPRAVENÉ NA DISTRIBÚCIU.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="scroll_right">
      <image href="Issue 6/73.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="14,89 16,129 45,163 86,180 173,191 257,190 334,175 366,158 387,137 394,118 393,82 368,51 322,29 264,19 178,19 95,27 59,39 41,51 23,69"><p>I ADDED ASHER'S DIGITAL KEY TO SEQUENCING FILES. THE WHOLE WORLD WILL REMEMBER HIM FOR THIS.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="14,89 16,129 45,163 86,180 173,191 257,190 334,175 366,158 387,137 394,118 393,82 368,51 322,29 264,19 178,19 95,27 59,39 41,51 23,69"><p>PRIDALA SOM TAM ASHEROV DIGITÁLNY KĽÚČ K SEKVENČNÝM SÚBOROM. CELÝ SVET SI HO ZA TOTO BUDE PAMÄTAŤ.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
    <page transition="fade">
      <image href="Issue 6/74.jpg"/>
    <text-layer lang="en"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="55,100 55,110 60,121 77,136 110,147 145,150 261,150 264,144 279,140 294,132 308,115 307,91 286,73 275,67 253,62 207,59 153,59 100,65 73,77 59,91"><p>ALRIGHT. SEND IT. SEND IT EVERYHERE.</p></text-area></text-layer><text-layer lang="sk"><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="55,100 55,110 60,121 77,136 110,147 145,150 261,150 264,144 279,140 294,132 308,115 307,91 286,73 275,67 253,62 207,59 153,59 100,65 73,77 59,91"><p>V PORIADKU. ODOŠLI TO. ROZPOŠLI TO VŠADE.</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
